msgid ""
"Your user instances could not be loaded as your Sentinel Hub account was "
"not set up/expired. You can still use Copernicus Browser but you will not "
"be able to use personal user instances. To be able to set up personal user "
"instances you can apply for a 30-days free trial or consider subscribing to "
"one of the plans: "
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir do chásanna úsáideora a luchtú toisc nár socraíodh do "
"chuntas Sentinel Hub nó go bhfuil sé imithe in éag. Is féidir leat "
"Copernicus Browser a úsáid fós ach ní bheidh tú in ann cásanna úsáideora "
"pearsanta a úsáid. Chun cásanna úsáideora pearsanta a shocrú, is féidir "
"leat iarratas a dhéanamh ar thriail saor in aisce 30 lá nó liostáil le "
"ceann de na pleananna a mheas: "

