msgid ""
"The evalscript you are using is too long and a short-URL cannot be "
"generated.\n"
"Please shorten your evalscript or save it to a website and use the “Load "
"script from URL” functionality."
msgstr ""
"Tá an evalscript atá á úsáid agat ró-fhada agus ní féidir URL gearr a "
"ghiniúint.\n"
"Giorraigh d'evalscript le do thoil nó sábháil é ar shuíomh gréasáin agus "
"úsáid an fheidhmiúlacht “Luchtaigh script ó URL”."

