#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"An evalscript (or \"custom script\") is a piece of Javascript code that "
"defines how the satellite data\n"
"should be processed by Sentinel Hub (one of the underlying services that "
"powers the Browser) and what values the\n"
"service should return.\n"
"Read more about custom scripts in our [tutorials](${ tutorial }) or use "
"already prepared scripts\n"
"for different collections from the [custom script repository](${ repo })."
msgstr ""
"Is píosa de chód Javascript é evalscript (nó “script saincheaptha”) a "
"shainmhíníonn conas ar chóir do Sentinel Hub (ceann de na seirbhísí "
"bunúsacha a chumhachtaíonn an Brabhsálaí) na sonraí satailíte a phróiseáil "
"agus cad iad na luachanna ar chóir don\n"
"seirbhís a thabhairt ar ais.\n"
"Léigh tuilleadh faoi scripteanna saincheaptha inár [dteagaisc](${ tutorial "
"}) nó úsáid scripteanna réamhullmhaithe\n"
"do bhailiúcháin éagsúla ón [stór scripteanna saincheaptha](${ repo })."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"An OpenEO process graph is a chain of processes that defines how satellite "
"data should be processed by the synchronous OpenEO API (one of the "
"underlying services that powers the Browser) and what values the service "
"should return. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Read more about processes and process graphs [here](${ processGraphUrl })."
msgstr ""
"Is slabhra próiseas é graf próisis OpenEO a shainmhíníonn conas ar chóir "
"don API sioncronach OpenEO (ceann de na seirbhísí bunúsacha a "
"chumhachtaíonn an Brabhsálaí) na sonraí satailíte a phróiseáil agus cad iad "
"na luachanna ar chóir don tseirbhís a thabhairt ar ais. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Léigh tuilleadh faoi phróisis agus grafanna próisis [anseo](${ "
"processGraphUrl })."

msgid ""
"Note: The **collection_id**, **spatial_extent**, **temporal_extent**, and "
"**advanced options** settings (e.g., mosaickingOrder, upsampling, "
"downsampling) are read-only. These values are updated automatically based "
"on your map navigation, date selection, collection choice, and advanced "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Nóta: Tá na socruithe **collection_id**, **spatial_extent**, "
"**temporal_extent**, agus **advanced options** (m.sh., mosaickingOrder, "
"upsampling, downsampling) inléite amháin. Nuashonraítear na luachanna seo "
"go huathoibríoch de réir do nascleanúna ar an mapa, do roghnú dátaí, do "
"roghnú bailiúcháin, agus do shocruithe casta."

