#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Create a simple band ratio (A/B) to highlight the spectral differences "
"between two bands,\n"
"or create a normalized difference index ((A-B)/(A+B)) to compare your data "
"across time.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Popular difference indices are the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index "
"(NDVI),\n"
"which uses the near-infrared and red bands or the Normalized Difference "
"Water Index (NDWI),\n"
"which uses the near-infrared and shortwave infrared bands.\n"
"\n"
"More info [here](${ link1 }) or [here](${ link2 })."
msgstr ""
"Cruthaigh cóimheas simplí bandaí (A/B) chun na difríochtaí speictreacha "
"idir dhá bhanda a aibhsiú,\n"
"nó cruthaigh innéacs difríochta normalaithe ((A-B)/(A+B)) chun do shonraí a "
"chomparáid thar am.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Is iad na hinnéacsanna difríochta is coitianta ná an tInnéacs Difríochta "
"Normalaithe Plandúlachta (NDVI),\n"
"as a n-úsáidtear na bandaí gar-infridheirg agus dearg, nó an tInnéacs "
"Difríochta Normalaithe Uisce (NDWI),\n"
"as a n-úsáidtear na bandaí gar-infridheirg agus infridhearg gearrthonnach.\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais [anseo](${ link1 }) nó [anseo](${ link2 })."

msgid ""
"Modifying the index configuration switches the mode to custom script and "
"updates the layer automatically."
msgstr ""
"Má athraítear cumraíocht an innéacs, aistrítear an mód go script "
"saincheaptha agus nuashonraítear an ciseal go huathoibríoch."

msgid "Drag bands into the index equation"
msgstr "Tarraing bandaí isteach san chothromóid innéacs"

msgid "Index "
msgstr "Innéacs "

msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "Tairseach"

msgid "Remove color picker"
msgstr "Bain an roghnóir datha"

msgid "Add color picker"
msgstr "Cuir roghnóir datha leis"

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"By using different spectral bands in the different colour channels (RGB) of "
"an image, certain\n"
"features can be emphasised in the data.\n"
"\n"
"Popular RGB composites are True Colour (red, blue and green\n"
"bands) or False Colour (near-infrared, red and green bands).\n"
"\n"
"More info [here](${ link1 }) or [here](${ link2 })."
msgstr ""
"Trí bhandaí speictreacha éagsúla a úsáid sna cainéil dhatha (RGB) éagsúla "
"d'íomhá, is féidir gnéithe áirithe\n"
"sna sonraí a aibhsiú.\n"
"\n"
"Is iad na comhchodanna RGB is coitianta ná Fíordhath (bandaí dearg, gorm "
"agus glas)\n"
"nó Dath Bréagach (bandaí gar-infridheirg, dearg agus glas).\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais [anseo](${ link1 }) nó [anseo](${ link2 })."

msgid ""
"Modifying the band assignment switches the mode to custom script and "
"updates the layer automatically."
msgstr ""
"Má athraítear sannadh na mbandaí, aistrítear an mód go script saincheaptha "
"agus nuashonraítear an ciseal go huathoibríoch."

msgid "Drag classes onto RGB fields"
msgstr "Tarraing ranganna ar réimsí RGB"

msgid "Drag bands onto RGB fields"
msgstr "Tarraing bandaí ar réimsí RGB"

