msgid ""
"Land Surface Temperature (LST) is the thermodynamic temperature of Earth’s "
"surface. LST is a key variable controlling energy, and water fluxes over "
"the land surface and atmosphere interface. In view of increasing extreme "
"temperature events and a growing population exposed to these events, LST is "
"increasingly relevant to sustainably manage food and water systems and "
"urban living conditions."
msgstr ""
"Is í Teocht Dromchla Talún (LST) teocht theirmidinimiciúil dhromchla an "
"Domhain. Is athróg thábhachtach í LST a rialaíonn sreabha fuinnimh agus "
"uisce ag comheadan dhromchla na talún agus an atmaisféir. I bhfianaise "
"imeachtaí teochta foircneacha atá ag méadú agus daonra atá ag fás a bhfuil "
"siad faoi nochtadh dóibh, tá LST ag éirí níos ábhartha chun córais bia agus "
"uisce agus coinníollacha maireachtála uirbeacha a bhainistiú ar bhealach "
"inbhuanaithe."

msgid ""
"# True color optimized\n"
"\n"
"This optimized True color script uses the visible light bands red, green "
"and blue in the corresponding red, green and blue color channels, resulting "
"in a product with natural colours that represents the Earth as humans would "
"naturally see it. The visualisation uses highlight compression and improves "
"the contrast and color vividness through minor contrast and saturation "
"enhancement."
msgstr ""
"# Fíordhath optamaithe\n"
"\n"
"Úsáideann an script optamaithe Fíordhath seo na bandaí solais infheicthe "
"dearg, glas agus gorm sna cainéil dhatha chomhfhreagracha dearg, glas agus "
"gorm, rud a fhágann táirge le dathanna nádúrtha a léiríonn an Domhan mar a "
"d'fheicfeadh daoine go nádúrtha é. Úsáideann an t-amharcléiriú comhbhrú "
"buaicphointí agus feabhsaíonn sé codarsnacht agus bríomhaireacht datha trí "
"fheabhsú beag codarsnachta agus sáithiúcháin."

msgid ""
"TCI, long used as a suitable indicator of vegetation health, characterises "
"how hot any given land pixel is with respect to its maximum temperature "
"range. Since over vegetated surfaces, temperature is strongly controlled by "
"energy fluxes (sensible and latent heat), the TCI indirectly characterizes "
"the moisture availability through the near-surface radiation and "
"aerodynamic conditions."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn TCI, a úsáidtear le fada mar tháscaire oiriúnach ar shláinte "
"plandúlachta, cé chomh te agus atá aon phicteilín talún ar leith maidir "
"lena raon teochta uasta. Ós rud é go rialaítear teocht go láidir ag sreabha "
"fuinnimh (teas ciallmhar agus folaigh) thar dhromchlaí plandaithe, léiríonn "
"an TCI go hindíreach infhaighteacht taise trí choinníollacha radaíochta "
"agus aeraidinimice in aice leis an dromchla."

msgid ""
"Maximum value of the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index calculated over "
"the 21-years period 1999-2019."
msgstr ""
"Uasluach an Innéacs Difríochta Normalaithe Plandúlachta arna ríomh thar "
"thréimhse 21 bliain 1999-2019."

msgid ""
"Mean value of the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index calculated over "
"the 21-years period 1999-2019."
msgstr ""
"Meánluach an Innéacs Difríochta Normalaithe Plandúlachta arna ríomh thar "
"thréimhse 21 bliain 1999-2019."

msgid ""
"Median value of the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index calculated over "
"the 21-years period 1999-2019."
msgstr ""
"Airmheánluach an Innéacs Difríochta Normalaithe Plandúlachta arna ríomh "
"thar thréimhse 21 bliain 1999-2019."

msgid ""
"Minimum value of the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index calculated over "
"the 21-years period 1999-2019."
msgstr ""
"Íosluach an Innéacs Difríochta Normalaithe Plandúlachta arna ríomh thar "
"thréimhse 21 bliain 1999-2019."

msgid ""
"NDVI, or Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, is a dimensionless index "
"that is indicative for vegetation density and is calculated by comparing "
"the visible and near-infrared sunlight reflected by the surface "
"(reflectance). The Global Land NDVI Collection 300m product is a 10-day "
"synthesis product derived from Top of Canopy PROBA-V 300m data."
msgstr ""
"Is innéacs gan toise é NDVI, nó Innéacs Difríochta Normalaithe "
"Plandúlachta, a léiríonn dlús plandúlachta agus a ríomhtar trí sholas na "
"gréine infheicthe agus gar-infridheirg a fhrithchaitear ag an dromchla "
"(frithchaitheacht) a chur i gcomparáid. Is táirge sintéise 10 lá é an "
"táirge Bailiúchán NDVI Talún Domhanda 300m a díorthaíodh ó shonraí PROBA-V "
"300m Barr an Chlúdaigh."

msgid ""
"SSM (Surface Soil Moisture) describes soil moisture of the soil’s topmost "
"5cm on a 1km (1°/112) spatial sampling. It is derived from microwave radar "
"data observed by the Sentinel-1 SAR satellite sensors."
msgstr ""
"Déanann SSM (Taise Ithreach Dromchla) cur síos ar thaise ithreach 5cm is "
"airde den ithir ag samplú spásúil 1km (1°/112). Díorthaítear é ó shonraí "
"radair micreathoinne arna mbreathnú ag braiteoirí satailíte SAR Sentinel-1."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the day of the year when the vegetation growing season "
"ends in the time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. The end-of-season "
"occurs, by definition, when the Plant Phenology Index value reaches 15% of "
"the season amplitude during the green-down period. The data are available "
"at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé lá na bliana nuair a chríochnaíonn séasúr fáis na "
"plandúlachta i bpróifíl ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tarlaíonn "
"deireadh an tséasúir, de réir sainmhínithe, nuair a shroicheann luach an "
"Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí 15% d'aimplitiúid an tséasúir le linn na "
"tréimhse glas-síos. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an "
"raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the day of the year when the vegetation growing season "
"ends in the time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. The end-of-season "
"occurs, by definition, when the Plant Phenology Index value reaches 15% of "
"the season amplitude during the green-down period. The data are available "
"at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé lá na bliana nuair a chríochnaíonn séasúr fáis na "
"plandúlachta i bpróifíl ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tarlaíonn "
"deireadh an tséasúir, de réir sainmhínithe, nuair a shroicheann luach an "
"Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí 15% d'aimplitiúid an tséasúir le linn na "
"tréimhse glas-síos. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an "
"raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the value of the Plant Phenology Index at the end of the "
"vegetation growing season. The data are available at 300 m spatial "
"resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí ag "
"deireadh shéasúr fáis na plandúlachta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach "
"spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the value of the Plant Phenology Index at the end of the "
"vegetation growing season. The data are available at 300 m spatial "
"resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí ag "
"deireadh shéasúr fáis na plandúlachta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach "
"spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the difference between the maximum and minimum Plant "
"Phenology Index values reached during the season. The data are available at "
"300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé an difríocht idir uasluachanna agus íosluachanna "
"an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí a shroichtear le linn an tséasúir. Tá na "
"sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an "
"lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the difference between the maximum and minimum Plant "
"Phenology Index values reached during the season. The data are available at "
"300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé an difríocht idir uasluachanna agus íosluachanna "
"an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí a shroichtear le linn an tséasúir. Tá na "
"sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an "
"lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the number of days between the start and end dates of "
"the vegetation growing season in the time profile of the Plant Phenology "
"Index. The data are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal "
"extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé líon na laethanta idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"shéasúr fáis na plandúlachta i bpróifíl ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta "
"Plandaí. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó "
"2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the number of days between the start and end dates of "
"the vegetation growing season in the time profile of the Plant Phenology "
"Index. The data are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal "
"extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé líon na laethanta idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"shéasúr fáis na plandúlachta i bpróifíl ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta "
"Plandaí. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó "
"2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the day of the year in the vegetation growing season "
"when the maximum Plant Phenology Index value is reached. The data are "
"available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé lá na bliana i séasúr fáis na plandúlachta nuair "
"a shroichtear uasluach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tá na sonraí ar "
"fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the day of the year in the vegetation growing season "
"when the maximum Plant Phenology Index value is reached. The data are "
"available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé lá na bliana i séasúr fáis na plandúlachta nuair "
"a shroichtear uasluach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tá na sonraí ar "
"fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the maximum (peak) value that the Plant Phenology Index "
"reaches during the vegetation growing season. The data are available at 300 "
"m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé an uasluach (buaic) a shroicheann an tInnéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí le linn shéasúr fáis na plandúlachta. Tá na sonraí "
"ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá "
"inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the maximum (peak) value that the Plant Phenology Index "
"reaches during the vegetation growing season. The data are available at 300 "
"m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé an uasluach (buaic) a shroicheann an tInnéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí le linn shéasúr fáis na plandúlachta. Tá na sonraí "
"ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá "
"inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the average Plant Phenology Index value of the minima on "
"left and right sides of each season. The data are available at 300 m "
"spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé meánluach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí de na "
"híosluachanna ar thaobhanna clé agus deas gach séasúir. Tá na sonraí ar "
"fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the average Plant Phenology Index value of the minima on "
"left and right sides of each season. The data are available at 300 m "
"spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé meánluach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí de na "
"híosluachanna ar thaobhanna clé agus deas gach séasúir. Tá na sonraí ar "
"fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: the growing season integral that is computed as the "
"time-integrated Plant Phenology Index values between the dates of the "
"season start and end, minus their base level value. The data are available "
"at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: suimeálaí an tséasúir fáis a ríomhtar mar luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí comhtháite thar am idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"an tséasúir, lúide a luach bunleibhéil. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach "
"spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: the growing season integral that is computed as the "
"time-integrated Plant Phenology Index values between the dates of the "
"season start and end, minus their base level value. The data are available "
"at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: suimeálaí an tséasúir fáis a ríomhtar mar luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí comhtháite thar am idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"an tséasúir, lúide a luach bunleibhéil. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach "
"spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the rate of change in the values of the Plant Phenology "
"Index at the day when the vegetation growing season ends. The data are "
"available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé ráta an athraithe i luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí an lá a chríochnaíonn séasúr fáis na plandúlachta. "
"Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go "
"dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the rate of change in the values of the Plant Phenology "
"Index at the day when the vegetation growing season ends. The data are "
"available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé ráta an athraithe i luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí an lá a chríochnaíonn séasúr fáis na plandúlachta. "
"Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go "
"dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the rate of change in the values of the Plant Phenology "
"Index at the day when the vegetation growing season starts. The data are "
"available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé ráta an athraithe i luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí an lá a thosaíonn séasúr fáis na plandúlachta. Tá na "
"sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an "
"lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the rate of change in the values of the Plant Phenology "
"Index at the day when the vegetation growing season starts. The data are "
"available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé ráta an athraithe i luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí an lá a thosaíonn séasúr fáis na plandúlachta. Tá na "
"sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an "
"lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: marks the day of the year when the vegetation growing season "
"starts in the time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. The "
"start-of-season occurs, by definition, when the Plant Phenology Index value "
"reaches 25% of the season amplitude during the green-up period. The data "
"are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from "
"2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: marcálann sé lá na bliana nuair a thosaíonn séasúr fáis na "
"plandúlachta i bpróifíl ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tarlaíonn "
"tús an tséasúir, de réir sainmhínithe, nuair a shroicheann luach an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí 25% d'aimplitiúid an tséasúir le linn na tréimhse "
"glas-suas. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama "
"ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: marks the day of the year when the vegetation growing season "
"starts in the time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. The "
"start-of-season occurs, by definition, when the Plant Phenology Index value "
"reaches 25% of the season amplitude during the green-up period. The data "
"are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from "
"2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: marcálann sé lá na bliana nuair a thosaíonn séasúr fáis na "
"plandúlachta i bpróifíl ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tarlaíonn "
"tús an tséasúir, de réir sainmhínithe, nuair a shroicheann luach an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí 25% d'aimplitiúid an tséasúir le linn na tréimhse "
"glas-suas. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon ama "
"ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the value of the Plant Phenology Index at the start of "
"the vegetation growing season. The data are available at 300 m spatial "
"resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: soláthraíonn sé luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí ag tús "
"shéasúr fáis na plandúlachta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 "
"m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the value of the Plant Phenology Index at the start of "
"the vegetation growing season. The data are available at 300 m spatial "
"resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: soláthraíonn sé luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí ag tús "
"shéasúr fáis na plandúlachta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 "
"m leis an raon ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 1: the growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant "
"Phenology Index values between the dates of the season start and end. The "
"data are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent "
"from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 1: suimeálaí an tséasúir fáis arna ríomh mar luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí comhtháite thar am idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"an tséasúir. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon "
"ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Season 2: the growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant "
"Phenology Index values between the dates of the season start and end. The "
"data are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent "
"from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Séasúr 2: suimeálaí an tséasúir fáis arna ríomh mar luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí comhtháite thar am idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"an tséasúir. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil 300 m leis an raon "
"ama ó 2023 go dtí an lá inniu."

msgid ""
"Growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant Phenology "
"Index values between the dates of the start and end of the first growing "
"season. Expressed in [m².day/m²]."
msgstr ""
"Suimeálaí an tséasúir fáis arna ríomh mar luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí comhtháite thar am idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"an chéad tséasúir fáis. Arna chur in iúl i [m².lá/m²]."

msgid ""
"Growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant Phenology "
"Index values between the dates of the start and end of the second growing "
"season. Expressed in [m².day/m²]."
msgstr ""
"Suimeálaí an tséasúir fáis arna ríomh mar luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí comhtháite thar am idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"an dara séasúr fáis. Arna chur in iúl i [m².lá/m²]."

msgid ""
"Growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant Phenology "
"Index values between the dates of the start and end of the first growing "
"season minus their base level value. Expressed in [m².day/m²]."
msgstr ""
"Suimeálaí an tséasúir fáis arna ríomh mar luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí comhtháite thar am idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"an chéad tséasúir fáis lúide a luach bunleibhéil. Arna chur in iúl i "
"[m².lá/m²]."

msgid ""
"Growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant Phenology "
"Index values between the dates of the start and end of the second growing "
"season minus their base level value. Expressed in [m².day/m²]."
msgstr ""
"Suimeálaí an tséasúir fáis arna ríomh mar luachanna an Innéacs "
"Feinealaíochta Plandaí comhtháite thar am idir dátaí tosaigh agus deiridh "
"an dara séasúr fáis lúide a luach bunleibhéil. Arna chur in iúl i "
"[m².lá/m²]."

msgid "Number of days between the start and the end of the first growing season."
msgstr "Líon na laethanta idir tús agus deireadh an chéad tséasúir fáis."

msgid "Number of days between the start and the end of the second growing season."
msgstr "Líon na laethanta idir tús agus deireadh an dara séasúr fáis."

msgid ""
"Difference between the Season Maximum value and the Season Minimum Value "
"for the first growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"An difríocht idir Uasluach an Tséasúir agus Íosluach an Tséasúir don chéad "
"tséasúr fáis. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Difference between the Season Maximum value and the Season Minimum Value "
"for the second growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"An difríocht idir Uasluach an Tséasúir agus Íosluach an Tséasúir don dara "
"séasúr fáis. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Value of the increasing rate of Plant Phenology Index during the first "
"season vegetation green-up. Expressed in [m² / m² /day]"
msgstr ""
"Luach an ráta méadaithe den Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí le linn "
"glas-suas plandúlachta an chéad tséasúir. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m² /lá]"

msgid ""
"Value of the increasing rate of Plant Phenology Index during the second "
"season vegetation green-up. Expressed in [m² / m² /day]."
msgstr ""
"Luach an ráta méadaithe den Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí le linn "
"glas-suas plandúlachta an dara séasúr. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m² /lá]."

msgid ""
"Absolute value of the decreasing rate of Plant Phenology Index during the "
"first season vegetation green-down. Expressed in [m² / m² /day]."
msgstr ""
"Luach absalóideach an ráta laghdaithe den Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí le "
"linn glas-síos plandúlachta an chéad tséasúir. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m² "
"/lá]."

msgid ""
"Absolute value of the decreasing rate of Plant Phenology Index during the "
"second season vegetation green-down. Expressed in [m² / m² /day]."
msgstr ""
"Luach absalóideach an ráta laghdaithe den Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí le "
"linn glas-síos plandúlachta an dara séasúr. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m² "
"/lá]."

msgid ""
"Day of the year when the first vegetation growing season starts in the time "
"profile of the Plant Phenology Index. A negative value of the SOSD "
"indicates that the peak of growing season is in the current year and the "
"start of the season is located in the previous year."
msgstr ""
"Lá na bliana nuair a thosaíonn an chéad séasúr fáis plandúlachta i bpróifíl "
"ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tugann luach diúltach den SOSD le "
"fios go bhfuil buaic an tséasúir fáis sa bhliain reatha agus go bhfuil tús "
"an tséasúir suite sa bhliain roimhe sin."

msgid ""
"Day of the year when the second vegetation growing season starts in the "
"time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. A negative value of the SOSD "
"indicates that the peak of growing season is in the current year and the "
"start of the season is located in the previous year."
msgstr ""
"Lá na bliana nuair a thosaíonn an dara séasúr fáis plandúlachta i bpróifíl "
"ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tugann luach diúltach den SOSD le "
"fios go bhfuil buaic an tséasúir fáis sa bhliain reatha agus go bhfuil tús "
"an tséasúir suite sa bhliain roimhe sin."

msgid ""
"Day of the year in the first vegetation growing season when the Plant "
"Phenology Index reaches its maximum value."
msgstr ""
"Lá na bliana sa chéad séasúr fáis plandúlachta nuair a shroicheann an "
"tInnéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí a uasluach."

msgid ""
"Day of the year in the second vegetation growing season when the Plant "
"Phenology Index reaches its maximum value."
msgstr ""
"Lá na bliana sa dara séasúr fáis plandúlachta nuair a shroicheann an "
"tInnéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí a uasluach."

msgid ""
"Day of the year when the first vegetation growing season ends in the time "
"profile of the Plant Phenology Index. A value of the EOSD larger than 365 "
"indicates that the peak of growing season is in the current year and the "
"end of the season is located in the next year."
msgstr ""
"Lá na bliana nuair a chríochnaíonn an chéad séasúr fáis plandúlachta i "
"bpróifíl ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tugann luach den EOSD níos "
"mó ná 365 le fios go bhfuil buaic an tséasúir fáis sa bhliain reatha agus "
"go bhfuil deireadh an tséasúir suite sa bhliain dár gcionn."

msgid ""
"Day of the year when the second vegetation growing season ends in the time "
"profile of the Plant Phenology Index. A value of the EOSD larger than 365 "
"indicates that the peak of growing season is in the current year and the "
"end of the season is located in the next year."
msgstr ""
"Lá na bliana nuair a chríochnaíonn an dara séasúr fáis plandúlachta i "
"bpróifíl ama an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí. Tugann luach den EOSD níos "
"mó ná 365 le fios go bhfuil buaic an tséasúir fáis sa bhliain reatha agus "
"go bhfuil deireadh an tséasúir suite sa bhliain dár gcionn."

msgid ""
"Value of the Plant Phenology Index at the start of the first vegetation "
"growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí ag tús an chéad tséasúir fáis "
"plandúlachta. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Value of the Plant Phenology Index at the start of the second vegetation "
"growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí ag tús an dara séasúr fáis "
"plandúlachta. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Maximum value that the Plant Phenology Index reaches during the first "
"vegetation growing season i.e. value of the Plant Phenology Index at the "
"maximum season date of the first growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"An t-uasluach a shroicheann an tInnéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí le linn an "
"chéad tséasúir fáis plandúlachta i.e. luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta "
"Plandaí ag dáta uasta an chéad tséasúir fáis. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Maximum value that the Plant Phenology Index reaches during the second "
"vegetation growing season i.e. value of the Plant Phenology Index at the "
"maximum season date of the second growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"An t-uasluach a shroicheann an tInnéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí le linn an "
"dara séasúr fáis plandúlachta i.e. luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí "
"ag dáta uasta an dara séasúr fáis. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"The average of the Plant Phenology Index value of the minima on left and "
"right sides of the first season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Meán luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí de na híosluachanna ar "
"thaobhanna clé agus deas an chéad tséasúir. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"The average of the Plant Phenology Index value of the minima on left and "
"right sides of the second season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Meán luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí de na híosluachanna ar "
"thaobhanna clé agus deas an dara séasúr. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Value of the Plant Phenology Index at the end of the first vegetation "
"growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí ag deireadh an chéad tséasúir fáis "
"plandúlachta. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Value of the Plant Phenology Index at the end of the second vegetation "
"growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Luach an Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí ag deireadh an dara séasúr fáis "
"plandúlachta. Arna chur in iúl i [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Land Surface Temperature (LST) is estimated from Top-of-Atmosphere (TOA) "
"brightness\n"
"temperatures of atmospheric window channels within the infrared range. LST "
"describes processes such as the exchange of energy and water between the "
"land surface and atmosphere, and influences the rate and timing of plant "
"growth."
msgstr ""
"Meastar Teocht Dromchla Talún (LST) ó theochtaí gile Barr an Atmaisféir "
"(TOA)\n"
"de chainéil fhuinneoige atmaisféir laistigh den raon infridhearg. Déanann "
"LST cur síos ar phróisis amhail malartú fuinnimh agus uisce idir dromchla "
"na talún agus an t-atmaisféar, agus tá tionchar aici ar ráta agus ar uainiú "
"fáis plandaí."

msgid "Land Surface Temperature, expressed in Kelvin."
msgstr "Teocht dromchla na talún, in Kelvin."

msgid ""
" GDMP (Gross Dry Matter Productivity) is considered as the amount of "
"biomass that primary producers create in a given length of time, without "
"any losses caused by respiration. The relation between the DMP (Dry matter "
"productivity) and the GDMP is as follows: DMP = GDMP * AR (with AR = "
"Autotrophic respiration factor)."
msgstr ""
" Meastar gur é GDMP (Táirgiúlacht Ábhair Thirim Comhlán) an méid bithmhaise "
"a chruthaíonn príomhtháirgeoirí i bhfad ama ar leith, gan aon chaillteanais "
"de bharr análaithe. Is mar seo a leanas atá an caidreamh idir DMP "
"(Táirgiúlacht ábhair thirim) agus GDMP: DMP = GDMP * AR (le AR = fachtóir "
"análaithe autotrófaigh)."

msgid ""
"Quality layer regarding the change detection between 0-3 (0 = no change, 3 "
"= high confidence). Note: this layer is only available for products "
"produced in production mode conso or nrt."
msgstr ""
"Ciseal cáilíochta maidir le brath athraithe idir 0-3 (0 = gan athrú, 3 = "
"muinín ard). Nóta: níl an ciseal seo ar fáil ach do tháirgí a tháirgtear sa "
"mhód táirgthe conso nó nrt."

msgid ""
"Data density indicator showing quality of the EO input data between 0 – 100 "
"(0 = bad, 100 = perfect data)."
msgstr ""
"Táscaire dlúis sonraí a thaispeánann cáilíocht na sonraí ionchuir EO idir 0 "
"– 100 (0 = olc, 100 = sonraí foirfe)."

msgid "Main discrete classification according to FAO LCCS scheme."
msgstr "Príomhaicmiú scoite de réir scéim FAO LCCS."

msgid ""
"Classification probability, a quality indicator for the discrete "
"classification."
msgstr "Dóchúlacht aicmithe, táscaire cáilíochta don aicmiú scoite."

msgid "Forest type for all pixels where tree cover fraction is bigger than 1%."
msgstr ""
"Cineál foraoise do gach picteilín ina bhfuil codán clúdaigh crann níos mó "
"ná 1%."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the bare and sparse vegetation class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme plandúlachta loime agus tanaí."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the cropland class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme talún curadóireachta."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the forest class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme foraoise."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the herbaceous vegetation class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme plandúlachta luibhe."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the moss & lichen class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme caonaigh agus léicin."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the permanent inland water bodies class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme comhlachtaí uisce intíre buan."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the seasonal inland water bodies class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme comhlachtaí uisce intíre séasúracha."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the shrubland class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme tom-talún."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the snow & ice class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme sneachta agus oighir."

msgid "Fractional cover (%) for the built-up class."
msgstr "Clúdach codánach (%) don aicme thógtha."

msgid ""
"This product is a 10-daily synthesis product derived from Top of Canopy "
"(TOC) PROVA-V 333 m data. The basic Water Bodies (WB) layer which tells "
"which pixels contain water and which not, defined as permanent and seasonal "
"water bodies, natural and man-made, independently of their size. Include "
"but are not restricted to the lakes of the Global terrestrial Network for "
"lakes."
msgstr ""
"Is táirge sintéise 10 lá é an táirge seo a díorthaíodh ó shonraí Barr an "
"Chlúdaigh (TOC) PROVA-V 333 m. An bunciseal Comhlachtaí Uisce (WB) a "
"insíonn cé na picteilíní ina bhfuil uisce agus cé nach bhfuil, sainithe mar "
"chomhlachtaí uisce buana agus séasúracha, nádúrtha agus déanta ag an duine, "
"beag beann ar a méid. Folaíonn sé lochanna an Líonra Domhanda Talúntaigh do "
"lochanna ach níl sé teoranta dóibh."

msgid "Information not currently available."
msgstr "Níl faisnéis ar fáil faoi láthair."

msgid ""
"Snow Water Equivalent (SWE) is the measure of the amount of water frozen "
"within the snow pack per unit area. In principle, it gives the height of "
"the water column that would form, if the snow pack would melt completely. "
"It is measured and indicated in millimetres [mm]. The retrieval algorithm "
"used here combines information from satellite-based microwave radiometer "
"and optical spectrometer observations with ground based weather station "
"snow depth measurements and produces daily hemispherical scale SWE "
"estimates. "
msgstr ""
"Is tomhas é Coibhéis Uisce Sneachta (SWE) ar an méid uisce atá reoite "
"laistigh den phaca sneachta in aghaidh an aonaid achair. I bprionsabal, "
"tugann sé airde an cholúin uisce a fhoirmeofaí dá leáfadh an paca sneachta "
"go hiomlán. Tomhaistear agus cuirtear in iúl é i milliméadair [mm]. "
"Comhcheanglaíonn an algartam aisghabhála a úsáidtear anseo faisnéis ó "
"bhreathnuithe raidiméadar micreathoinne agus speictriméadar optúil atá "
"bunaithe ar shatailít le tomhais doimhneachta sneachta ó stáisiúin aimsire "
"atá bunaithe ar an talamh agus táirgeann sé meastacháin laethúla SWE ar "
"scála leathshféarach. "

msgid ""
"The Snow Cover Extent (SCE) product provides information on the Fraction of "
"Snow Cover (FSC) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The SCE is derived "
"from medium resolution optical satellite data. The dataset has the "
"following classes: Outside area of interest (0), Water bodies (20), Cloud "
"mask (30), Polar night (251), Input data error (254), No data (255), and "
"Snow Cover Extent (values between 100 and 200, where the percentage of snow "
"cover can be derived using the formula: SCE = value – 100)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an táirge Méid Clúdaigh Sneachta (SCE) faisnéis ar Chodán "
"Clúdaigh Sneachta (FSC) in aghaidh an phicteilín i gcéatadán (0% – 100%). "
"Díorthaítear an SCE ó shonraí satailíte optúla meándeartha. Tá na haicmí "
"seo a leanas sa tacar sonraí: Lasmuigh de limistéar spéise (0), Comhlachtaí "
"uisce (20), Masc scamall (30), Oíche pholach (251), Earráid sonraí ionchuir "
"(254), Gan sonraí (255), agus Méid Clúdaigh Sneachta (luachanna idir 100 "
"agus 200, áit a bhfuil sé indíorthaithe céatadán an chlúdaigh sneachta ag "
"baint úsáide as an bhfoirmle: SCE = luach – 100)."

msgid ""
"The Snow Cover Extent (SCE) product is generated daily in near-real time "
"for the global land areas, excluding Antarctica, based on medium resolution "
"optical satellite data. The snow maps are generated from Sentinel-3 SLSTR "
"data and in parallel from NOAA-20 VIIRS data to assure service continuity "
"in case one satellite or sensor fails. The global SCE product provides "
"information on the Fraction of Snow Cover (FSC) on ground (also in forested "
"areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%) and is extending from 90°N/180°W "
"to 90°S/180°E with a pixel size of 0.01° x 0.01° (approx. 1 km x 1 km). The "
"product is provided within 1 day after the last raw image acquisition per "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Gintear an táirge Méid Clúdaigh Sneachta (SCE) go laethúil in aice le "
"fíor-am do limistéir talún dhomhanda, Antartaice ag fágáil as an áireamh, "
"bunaithe ar shonraí satailíte optúla meándeartha. Gintear na mapaí sneachta "
"ó shonraí Sentinel-3 SLSTR agus ar comhthrom ó shonraí NOAA-20 VIIRS chun "
"leanúnachas seirbhíse a chinntiú i gcás go dteipeann ar shatailít nó ar "
"bhraiteoir amháin. Soláthraíonn an táirge SCE domhanda faisnéis ar Chodán "
"Clúdaigh Sneachta (FSC) ar an talamh (i limistéir fhoraoisithe freisin) in "
"aghaidh an phicteilín i gcéatadán (0% – 100%) agus síneann sé ó 90°N/180°W "
"go 90°S/180°E le méid picteilín 0.01° x 0.01° (thart ar 1 km x 1 km). "
"Soláthraítear an táirge laistigh de lá amháin tar éis na gabhála deiridh "
"d'íomhá amh in aghaidh an dáta."

msgid "Snow Cover Extent Uncertainty, provided as unbiased Root Mean Square Error"
msgstr ""
"Éiginnteacht Mhéid Clúdaigh Sneachta, soláthraithe mar Earráid "
"Chearnmheánfhréamh gan chlaonadh"

msgid ""
"The main Water Bodies detection layer (WB) uses the following values: Sea "
"(0), Water (70), No data (251), No water (255). From the Sentinel-2 L1C "
"input reflectances, Water Bodies are detected using the Modified Normalized "
"Difference Water Index (MNDWI), for each input tile"
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an príomhciseal brath Comhlachtaí Uisce (WB) na luachanna seo a "
"leanas: Farraige (0), Uisce (70), Gan sonraí (251), Gan uisce (255). Ó "
"fhrithchaitheachtaí ionchuir Sentinel-2 L1C, braitear Comhlachtaí Uisce ag "
"úsáid an Innéacs Difríochta Normalaithe Uisce Athraithe (MNDWI), do gach "
"tíle ionchuir"

msgid ""
"The LIE variable is a classification of lake ice state, with the following "
"classes: Ice cover (10), Open water (30), Cloud (40). Some specific flag "
"values are used: Not interpreted / no satellite input data (50), Sea pixel "
"(60), Land pixel (70)."
msgstr ""
"Is aicmiú de staid oighir locha é athróg LIE, leis na haicmí seo a leanas: "
"Clúdach oighir (10), Uisce oscailte (30), Scamall (40). Úsáidtear roinnt "
"luachanna brataí sonracha: Gan léirmhíniú / gan sonraí ionchuir satailíte "
"(50), Picteilín farraige (60), Picteilín talún (70)."

msgid ""
"The LIE variable is a classification of lake ice state, with the following "
"classes: Fully snow covered ice (1), Partially snow covered or  snow free "
"ice (2), Open water (3). Some specific flag values are also used for LIE: 0 "
"for missing data, 4 for sea pixels, 5 for cloudy pixels, 6 for land area. "
"LIE 250m uses thresholds on Top-of-Atmosphere (TOA) reflectances for full "
"snow cover, partially snow covered ice/clear ice, and open water."
msgstr ""
"Is aicmiú de staid oighir locha é athróg LIE, leis na haicmí seo a leanas: "
"Oighear clúdaithe go hiomlán le sneachta (1), Oighear clúdaithe go "
"páirteach le sneachta nó saor ó shneachta (2), Uisce oscailte (3). "
"Úsáidtear roinnt luachanna brataí sonracha le haghaidh LIE freisin: 0 do "
"shonraí ar iarraidh, 4 do phicteilíní farraige, 5 do phicteilíní "
"scamallacha, 6 do limistéar talún. Úsáideann LIE 250m tairseacha ar "
"fhrithchaitheachtaí Barr an Atmaisféir (TOA) do chlúdach sneachta iomlán, "
"oighear clúdaithe go páirteach le sneachta/oighear soiléir, agus uisce "
"oscailte."

msgid ""
"Fraction of valid LST values (used to calculate statistics) in the "
"compositing period. In this context, a valid LST value corresponds to a "
"clear-sky retrieval, after outlier removal."
msgstr ""
"Codán de luachanna bailí LST (a úsáidtear chun staidreamh a ríomh) sa "
"tréimhse comhshuímh. Sa chomhthéacs seo, freagraíonn luach bailí LST "
"d'aisghabháil spéire soiléire, tar éis seachtracha a bhaint."

msgid ""
"The aim of 10-day Land Surface Temperature (LST) product is to provide a "
"complete overview of the LST daily cycle over each 10-day compositing for "
"every image pixel. This layer represents the maximum LST values retrieved "
"during the 10-days composite period."
msgstr ""
"Is é aidhm an táirge Teocht Dromchla Talún (LST) 10 lá forbhreathnú iomlán "
"a sholáthar ar thimthriall laethúil LST thar gach comhshuíomh 10 lá do gach "
"picteilín íomhá. Léiríonn an ciseal seo na huasluachanna LST a aisghabhadh "
"le linn thréimhse an chomhshuímh 10 lá."

msgid ""
"The aim of 10-day Land Surface Temperature (LST) product is to provide a "
"complete overview of the LST daily cycle over each 10-day compositing for "
"every image pixel. This layer represents the median LST values retrieved "
"during the 10-days composite period."
msgstr ""
"Is é aidhm an táirge Teocht Dromchla Talún (LST) 10 lá forbhreathnú iomlán "
"a sholáthar ar thimthriall laethúil LST thar gach comhshuíomh 10 lá do gach "
"picteilín íomhá. Léiríonn an ciseal seo na hairmheánluachanna LST a "
"aisghabhadh le linn thréimhse an chomhshuímh 10 lá."

msgid ""
"The aim of 10-day Land Surface Temperature (LST) product is to provide a "
"complete overview of the LST daily cycle over each 10-day compositing for "
"every image pixel. This layer represents the minimum LST values retrieved "
