"le linn thréimhse an chomhshuímh 10 lá."

msgid ""
"Chlorophyll-a (Chla) in mg/m³, commonly used as a proxy to phytoplankton "
"biomass."
msgstr ""
"Clóraifil-a (Chla) i mg/m³, a úsáidtear go coitianta mar ionadaí do "
