msgid ""
"Mean turbidity, which is a key indicator of water clarity, quantifying the "
"haziness of the water and acting as an indicator of underwater light "
"availability. Here TMEAN is derived from total suspended matter (TSM) "
"estimates."
msgstr ""
"Meándhoiléireacht, atá ina príomhtháscaire ar shoiléireacht uisce, a "
"chainníonn ceobhránacht an uisce agus a fheidhmíonn mar tháscaire ar "
"infhaighteacht solais faoi uisce. Anseo díorthaítear TMEAN ó mheastacháin "
"ábhair iomláin ar fuaidreamh (TSM)."

msgid ""
"Trophic State Index, referring to the degree at which organic matter "
"accumulates in the water body and is most commonly used in relation to "
"monitoring eutrophication. Here TSI is derived from phytoplankton biomass "
"by proxy of chlorophyll-a."
msgstr ""
"Innéacs Staid Trófach, a thagraíonn don mhéid a charnann ábhar orgánach sa "
"chomhlacht uisce agus a úsáidtear is minice maidir le monatóireacht a "
"dhéanamh ar eotrófú. Anseo díorthaítear TSI ó bhithmhais fhíteaplanctóin "
"trí ionadaí clóraifill-a."

msgid ""
"Total suspended matter (TSM) in g/m³, used to quantify the concentration of "
"suspended particles in the water body."
msgstr ""
"Ábhar iomlán ar fuaidreamh (TSM) i g/m³, a úsáidtear chun tiúchan cáithníní "
