msgid "Land Cover Map at 10m resolution with 11 different land cover classes."
msgstr "Mapa Clúdaigh Talún ag taifeach 10m le 11 aicme chlúdaigh talún éagsúla."

msgid "Tree Cover Density expressed as percentage of tree cover at 10 m resolution."
msgstr ""
"Dlús Clúdaigh Crann arna chur in iúl mar chéatadán de chlúdach crann ag "
"taifeach 10 m."

msgid ""
"Surface soil moisture (SSM) retrieval from scatterometer data has certain "
"limitations: it cannot be retrieved when the surface is frozen or covered "
"by snow, dense vegetation, or water. Whereas dense vegetation and water are "
"almost static factors, the freeze/thaw cycle is dynamic. The frozen state "
"of the surface is recorded within the surface state flag (SSF), which is "
"based on interpolated meteorological data."
msgstr ""
"Tá teorainneacha áirithe le haisghabháil taise ithreach dromchla (SSM) ó "
"shonraí scaipméadair: ní féidir í a aisghabháil nuair a bhíonn an dromchla "
"reoite nó clúdaithe ag sneachta, plandúlacht dhlúth, nó uisce. Cé go bhfuil "
"plandúlacht dhlúth agus uisce beagnach statach, tá an timthriall reo/leá "
"dinimiciúil. Taifeadtar staid reoite an dromchla laistigh de bhratach staid "
"an dromchla (SSF), atá bunaithe ar shonraí meitéareolaíochta idirshuite."

msgid ""
"SWI computed with a characteristic time length of 1 day. The Soil Water "
"index (SWI) provides global daily information about moisture conditions in "
"different soil depths. Near Real Time Data uses the H SAF H28 SSM product "
"as input data. The Archive of ASCAT SWI uses reprocessed SSM data from TU "
"Wien. "
msgstr ""
"SWI arna ríomh le fad ama sainiúil de lá amháin. Soláthraíonn an tInnéacs "
"Uisce Ithreach (SWI) faisnéis dhomhanda laethúil faoi choinníollacha taise "
"i ndoimhneachtaí éagsúla ithreach. Úsáideann Sonraí Beagnach Fíor-Ama an "
"táirge H SAF H28 SSM mar shonraí ionchuir. Úsáideann Cartlann ASCAT SWI "
"sonraí SSM athphróiseáilte ó TU Wien. "

