msgstr "Innéacs uisce ithreach ag fadanna ama éagsúla."

msgid ""
"The Lake Ice Coverage (LIE) is monitored using optical satellite data and "
"it classifies a section of the freshwater body as 1) Fully snow covered "
"ice; 2) Partially snow covered ice/clear ice; 3) Open water. Classification "
"is provided only for cloud free pixels, with dedicated cloud mask. The "
"gridded data product covers Northern-Europe with 250m (0.0025 degree) "
"resolution. The LIE product can have several important applications from "
"climate change monitoring and hydrological forecasting to winter transport "
"and recreational activity on lakes."
msgstr ""
"Déantar Clúdach Oighir Locha (LIE) a mhonatóiriú ag úsáid sonraí satailíte "
"optúla agus aicmíonn sé cuid de chomhlacht fionnuisce mar 1) Oighear "
"clúdaithe go hiomlán le sneachta; 2) Oighear clúdaithe go páirteach le "
"sneachta/oighear soiléir; 3) Uisce oscailte. Ní sholáthraítear aicmiú ach "
"do phicteilíní saor ó scamaill, le masc scamall tiomanta. Clúdaíonn an "
"táirge sonraí greille Tuaisceart na hEorpa le taifeach 250m (0.0025 céim). "
"Is féidir roinnt feidhmeanna tábhachtacha a bheith ag an táirge LIE ó "
"mhonatóireacht athraithe aeráide agus réamhaisnéis hidreolaíoch go iompar "
"geimhridh agus gníomhaíocht áineasa ar lochanna."

