msgid ""
"This is a simple RGB composite with NIR band B04 in the red channel, red "
"band B03 in the green channel and green band B02 in the blue channel. The "
"script is useful for plant density and health monitoring, as vegetation "
"(displayed in red) heavily reflects NIR light while absorbing red. The band "
"4 also penetrates atmospheric haze, and distinguishes between land and "
"water. Cities and exposed ground are grey or tan, and water appears blue or "
"black."
msgstr ""
"Is comhshuíomh RGB simplí é seo le banda NIR B04 sa chainéal dearg, banda "
"dearg B03 sa chainéal glas agus banda glas B02 sa chainéal gorm. Tá an "
"script úsáideach chun dlús agus sláinte plandaí a mhonatóiriú, mar go "
"bhfrithchaitheann plandúlacht (a thaispeántar i ndearg) solas NIR go mór "
"agus í ag ionsú solas dearg. Treáitear ceo atmaisféir ag banda 4 freisin, "
"agus déanann sé idirdhealú idir talamh agus uisce. Bíonn cathracha agus "
"talamh nochta liath nó buí-donn, agus bíonn uisce le feiceáil gorm nó dubh."

msgid ""
"The NDMI is a normalised difference moisture index, that uses NIR and SWIR "
"bands to display moisture. The SWIR band reflects changes in both the "
"vegetation water content and the spongy mesophyll structure in vegetation "
"canopies, while the NIR reflectance is affected by leaf internal structure "
"and leaf dry matter content but not by water content. The combination of "
"the NIR with the SWIR removes variations induced by leaf internal structure "
"and leaf dry matter content, improving the accuracy in retrieving the "
"vegetation water content. The amount of water available in the internal "
"leaf structure largely controls the spectral reflectance in the SWIR "
"interval of the electromagnetic spectrum. SWIR reflectance is therefore "
"negatively related to leaf water content."
msgstr ""
"Is innéacs taise difríochta normalaithe é an NDMI, a úsáideann bandaí NIR "
"agus SWIR chun taise a thaispeáint. Léiríonn an banda SWIR athruithe ar "
"ábhar uisce na plandúlachta agus ar struchtúr mheasafhill spúinseach i "
"gclúdaigh plandúlachta, agus tá tionchar ag struchtúr inmheánach duilleoige "
"agus ábhar ábhair thirim duilleoige ar fhrithchaitheacht NIR ach ní ag "
"ábhar uisce. Baineann comhcheangal NIR le SWIR na héagsúlachtaí a spreagann "
"struchtúr inmheánach duilleoige agus ábhar ábhair thirim duilleoige, rud a "
"fheabhsaíonn cruinneas aisghabhála ábhar uisce plandúlachta. Rialaíonn an "
"méid uisce atá ar fáil i struchtúr inmheánach duilleoige den chuid is mó an "
"fhrithchaitheacht speictreach san eatramh SWIR den speictream "
"leictreamaighnéadach. Dá bhrí sin, tá frithchaitheacht SWIR bainteach go "
"diúltach le hábhar uisce duilleoige."

msgid ""
"The Landsat normalized difference snow index is a ratio of two bands: the "
"Green band (B02) and the SWIR Band (B05). Values above 0.42 are usually "
"snow. NDSI can be used to differentiate between cloud and snow cover as "
"snow absorbs in the short-wave infrared light, but reflects the visible "
"light, whereas cloud is generally reflective in both wavelengths. In the "
"visualisation script snow cover is represented in bright vivid blue."
msgstr ""
"Is cóimheas de dhá bhanda é innéacs difríochta normalaithe sneachta "
"Landsat: an banda Glas (B02) agus an banda SWIR (B05). Is sneachta de "
"ghnáth luachanna os cionn 0.42. Is féidir NDSI a úsáid chun idirdhealú a "
"dhéanamh idir clúdach scamall agus sneachta mar go n-ionsúnn sneachta sa "
"solas infridhearg gearrthonnach, ach go bhfrithchaitheann sé an solas "
"infheicthe, ach is gnách go mbíonn scamall frithchaiteach sa dá thonnfhad. "
"Sa script amharcléiriúcháin léirítear clúdach sneachta i ngorm geal "
"bríomhar."

msgid ""
"The normalised difference vegetation index is a simple, but effective index "
"for quantifying green vegetation. It is a measure of the state of "
"vegetation health based on how plants reflect light at certain wavelengths. "
"The value range of the NDVI is -1 to 1. Negative values of NDVI (values "
"approaching -1) correspond to water. Values close to zero (-0.1 to 0.1) "
"generally correspond to barren areas of rock, sand, or snow. Low, positive "
"values represent shrub and grassland (approximately 0.2 to 0.4), while high "
"values indicate temperate and tropical rainforests (values approaching 1)."
msgstr ""
"Is innéacs simplí ach éifeachtach é an t-innéacs difríochta normalaithe "
"plandúlachta chun plandúlacht ghlas a chainníochtú. Is tomhas é ar staid "
"sláinte na plandúlachta bunaithe ar an gcaoi a bhfrithchaitheann plandaí "
"solas ag tonnfhaid áirithe. Is é -1 go 1 raon luachanna an NDVI. "
"Freagraíonn luachanna diúltacha NDVI (luachanna ag druidim le -1) d'uisce. "
"Freagraíonn luachanna gar do nialas (-0.1 go 0.1) go ginearálta do "
"limistéir loma de charraig, gaineamh, nó sneachta. Léiríonn luachanna "
"dearfacha ísle tor agus féarthalamh (thart ar 0.2 go 0.4), agus léiríonn "
"luachanna arda foraoisí báistí measartha agus trópaiceacha (luachanna ag "
"druidim le 1)."

msgid ""
"The NDWI is used to monitor changes related to water content in water "
"bodies. As water bodies strongly absorb light in visible to infrared "
"electromagnetic spectrum, NDWI uses green and near infrared bands to "
"highlight water bodies. It is sensitive to built-up land and can result in "
"over-estimation of water bodies."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear an NDWI chun athruithe a bhaineann le hábhar uisce i gcomhlachtaí "
"uisce a mhonatóiriú. Mar go n-ionsúnn comhlachtaí uisce solas go láidir sa "
"speictream leictreamaighnéadach infheicthe go hinfridhearg, úsáideann NDWI "
"bandaí glasa agus gar-infridheirg chun comhlachtaí uisce a aibhsiú. Tá sé "
"íogair do thalamh tógtha agus is féidir leis comhlachtaí uisce a mheas thar "
"fóir."

msgid ""
"Short wave infrared (SWIR) measurements can help scientists estimate how "
"much water is present in plants and soil, as water absorbs SWIR "
"wavelengths. Short wave infrared bands (a band is a region of the "
"electromagnetic spectrum; a satellite sensor can image Earth in different "
"bands) are also useful for distinguishing between cloud types (water clouds "
"versus ice clouds), snow and ice, all of which appear white in visible "
"light. In this composite vegetation appears in shades of green, soils and "
"built-up areas are in various shades of brown, and water appears black. "
"Newly burned land reflects strongly in SWIR bands, making them valuable for "
"mapping fire damages. Each rock type reflects shortwave infrared light "
"differently, making it possible to map out geology by comparing reflected "
"SWIR light."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le tomhais infridhearg gearrthonnach (SWIR) cabhrú le heolaithe "
"measúnú a dhéanamh ar an méid uisce atá i bplandaí agus in ithir, mar go "
"n-ionsúnn uisce tonnfhaid SWIR. Tá bandaí infridhearg gearrthonnach (is "
"réigiún den speictream leictreamaighnéadach é banda; is féidir le braiteoir "
"satailíte an Domhan a léiriú i mbandaí éagsúla) úsáideach freisin chun "
"idirdhealú a dhéanamh idir cineálacha scamall (scamaill uisce i gcomparáid "
"le scamaill oighir), sneachta agus oighear, a bhíonn bán go léir i solas "
"infheicthe. Sa chomhshuíomh seo bíonn plandúlacht le feiceáil i scáileanna "
"glasa, bíonn ithreacha agus limistéir thógtha i scáileanna éagsúla donna, "
"agus bíonn uisce le feiceáil dubh. Frithchaitheann talamh a dódh le déanaí "
"go láidir i mbandaí SWIR, rud a fhágann go bhfuil siad luachmhar chun "
"damáiste tine a mhapáil. Frithchaitheann gach cineál carraige solas "
"infridhearg gearrthonnach go difriúil, rud a fhágann gur féidir geolaíocht "
"a mhapáil trí sholas SWIR frithchaite a chomparáid."

msgid ""
"The true colour product maps Landsat bi-monthly mosaic band values B03, "
"B02, and B01 which roughly correspond to red, green, and blue part of the "
"spectrum, respectively, to R, G, and B components. The result is a true "
"colour product, that is a good representation of the Earth as humans would "
"see it naturally."
msgstr ""
"Mapálann an táirge fíordhatha luachanna bandaí mósáic dhémhíosúil Landsat "
"B03, B02, agus B01 a fhreagraíonn go garbh do chodanna dearga, glasa agus "
"gorma den speictream, faoi seach, do chomhpháirteanna R, G, agus B. Is "
"toradh é táirge fíordhatha, atá ina léiriú maith ar an Domhan mar a "
"d'fheicfeadh daoine go nádúrtha é."

msgid ""
"Uncertainty of the NDVI is calculated by error propagation of the "
"uncertainty associated to input spectral surface reflectances."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhtar éiginnteacht an NDVI trí iomadú earráide na héiginnteachta a "
"bhaineann le frithchaitheachtaí dromchla speictreacha ionchuir."

msgid ""
"Number of clear-sky surface reflectance in the dekad time window, minimum "
"over the spectral bands used for the NDVI calculation."
msgstr ""
"Líon na frithchaitheachta dromchla spéire soiléire san fhuinneog ama "
"deacaid, íosmhéid thar na bandaí speictreacha a úsáidtear le haghaidh ríomh "
"an NDVI."

msgid "Lake surface skin temperature, weighted average over the aggregation period."
msgstr ""
"Teocht chraiceann dromchla locha, meán ualaithe thar an tréimhse "
"chomhiomlánaithe."

msgid "Mean concentration of chlorophyll-a (in the observation period)."
msgstr "Meántiúchan clóraifill-a (sa tréimhse bhreathnóireachta)."

msgid ""
"Probability of floating cyanobacteria (with a range of values from 0 to 1 "
"indicating probability of cyanobacteria presence – the closer the value is "
"to 1, the higher the probability)."
msgstr ""
"Dóchúlacht cianóbaictéir snámhach (le raon luachanna ó 0 go 1 a thugann le "
"fios dóchúlacht i láthair cianóbaictéir – dá gaire an luach do 1, is airde "
"an dóchúlacht)."

msgid ""
"Representative spectrum of fully normalised water-leaving reflectance at "
