msgid ""
"# True Color\n"
"\n"
"This True color composite uses the visible light bands red, green and blue "
"in the corresponding red, green and blue color channels, resulting in a "
"natural colored product that is a good representation of the Earth as "
"humans would see it naturally. The visualization is based on "
"atmospherically corrected surface reflectances from the Sentinel-3 SYNERGY "
"SY_2_SYN product, which combines data from the OLCI and SLSTR instruments "
"at 300 m resolution.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info [here](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products)."
msgstr ""
"# Fíordhath\n"
"\n"
"Úsáideann an comhshuíomh Fíordhatha seo na bandaí solais infheicthe dearg, "
"glas agus gorm sna cainéil dhatha chomhfhreagracha dearg, glas agus gorm, "
"rud a fhágann táirge datha nádúrtha a léiríonn an Domhan go maith mar a "
"d'fheicfeadh daoine go nádúrtha é. Tá an t-amharcléiriú bunaithe ar "
"fhrithchaitheachtaí dromchla atá ceartaithe go hatmaisféarach ón táirge "
"Sentinel-3 SYNERGY SY_2_SYN, a chomhcheanglaíonn sonraí ó ionstraimí OLCI "
"agus SLSTR ag taifeach 300 m.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products)."

