msgid "Page up/Page down"
msgstr "Leathanach suas/Leathanach síos"

msgid "Use the PG UP or PG DN keys to change the elevation of the camera."
msgstr "Úsáid na heochracha PG UP nó PG DN chun airde an cheamara a athrú."

