msgid "Pan console"
msgstr "Consól panála"

msgid ""
"The pan console allows you to move across the map at a fixed height. Click "
"and drag to move\n"
"continuously. The farther you drag from the center, the faster you will "
"move."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an consól panála duit bogadh ar fud an mhapa ag airde sheasta. "
"Cliceáil agus tarraing chun bogadh\n"
"go leanúnach. Dá faide a tharraingíonn tú ón lár, is tapúla a bhogfaidh tú."

msgid "Camera console"
msgstr "Consól ceamara"

msgid ""
"The camera console moves the camera's view only. Click and drag to change "
"the camera's view.\n"
"The farther you drag from the center, the faster you will change the view."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhogann an consól ceamara ach amharc an cheamara. Cliceáil agus tarraing "
"chun amharc an cheamara a athrú.\n"
"Dá faide a tharraingíonn tú ón lár, is tapúla a athrófar an t-amharc."

msgid "Zoom buttons"
msgstr "Cnaipí súmála"

msgid ""
"Clicking them will change the elevation of the camera. The plus button will "
"move the camera\n"
"closer to the earth, the minus button will move the camera further away."
msgstr ""
"Athróidh cliceáil orthu airde an cheamara. Bogfaidh an cnaipe móide an "
"ceamara\n"
"níos gaire don domhan, bogfaidh an cnaipe lúide an ceamara níos faide ar "
"shiúl."

msgid ""
"Double clicking with the left mouse button on the camera console resets the "
"camera view to North and down looking position."
msgstr ""
"Athshocraíonn cliceáil faoi dhó leis an gcnaipe clé den luch ar an gconsól "
"ceamara amharc an cheamara go dtí an Tuaisceart agus suíomh ag breathnú "
"síos."

