msgid "Rotate around the clicked point"
msgstr "Rothlaigh timpeall an phointe cliceáilte"

#. Additional info for "pivot rotation" checkbox
msgid ""
"When checked, moving the mouse while the middle button is pressed, \n"
"rotates the world around the clicked point, \n"
"otherwise the camera rotates around itself. \n"
"Alt key, being pressed when starting to rotate, toggles this behavior."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn sé ticeáilte, rothlaíonn bogadh na luiche agus an cnaipe lár "
"brúite, \n"
"an domhan timpeall an phointe cliceáilte, \n"
"murach sin rothlaíonn an ceamara timpeall air féin. \n"
"Malartaíonn an eochair Alt, nuair a bhrúitear í ag tús an rothlaithe, an "
"iompar seo."

