msgstr "Chuaigh rud éigin cearr!"

msgid ""
"The product availability indicates whether a product can be downloaded "
"immediately (*Immediate*) or must first be processed in the user's "
"workspace (*To order*). The workspace offers processing options for:\n"
"- Sentinel-1 Level-1 SLC and\n"
"- Sentinel-2 L2A.\n"
"\n"
"The *To order* filter should therefore only be used when searching for one "
"of these two product types."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn infhaighteacht an táirge an féidir táirge a íoslódáil láithreach "
"(*Láithreach*) nó an gcaithfear é a phróiseáil ar dtús i spás oibre an "
"úsáideora (*Le hordú*). Tairgeann an spás oibre roghanna próiseála do:\n"
"- Sentinel-1 Leibhéal-1 SLC agus\n"
"- Sentinel-2 L2A.\n"
"\n"
"Dá bhrí sin níor chóir an scagaire *Le hordú* a úsáid ach amháin nuair a "
"chuardaítear ceann den dá chineál táirge seo."

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-1 data includes products from the Sentinel-1 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-1A (operational since 2014), "
"Sentinel-1B (operational from 2016 to 2022), Sentinel-1C (operational since "
"2025), Sentinel-1D (operational since 2026)."
msgstr ""
"Áirítear leis na sonraí Sentinel-1 atá ar fáil táirgí ó réaltbhuíon "
"satailíte Sentinel-1, lena n-áirítear Sentinel-1A (i bhfeidhm ó 2014), "
"Sentinel-1B (i bhfeidhm ó 2016 go 2022), Sentinel-1C (i bhfeidhm ó 2025), "
"Sentinel-1D (i bhfeidhm ó 2026)."

msgid ""
"Determines whether the data was recorded during a descending orbit (flight "
"direction: north - south) or an ascending orbit (flight direction: south - "
"north)."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann sé ar taifeadadh na sonraí le linn orbite íslitheach (treo "
"eitilte: ó thuaidh - ó dheas) nó orbite ardaitheach (treo eitilte: ó dheas "
"- ó thuaidh)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between successive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 to "
"the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending node "
"crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-1 is in a "
"near-polar, sun-synchronous orbit with a repeat cycle of 12 days and 175 "
"orbits per cycle for a single satellite."
msgstr ""
"Is é Uimhir na hOrbite Coibhneasta líon na n-orbit iomlán (idir trasnuithe "
"nód ardaitheach i ndiaidh a chéile tríd an Meánchiorcal) ón orbit "
"choibhneasta 1 go deireadh timthrialla. Is í an orbit choibhneasta 1 an "
"orbit a bhfuil a trasnú nód ardaitheach is gaire do Mheridian Greenwich. Tá "
"Sentinel-1 in orbit beagnach polach, sioncronach leis an ngrian le "
"timthriall athdhéanta de 12 lá agus 175 orbit in aghaidh an timthrialla do "
"shatailít amháin."

msgid ""
"Sentinel-1 operates in 4 exclusive instrument acquisition modes. Depending "
"on the instrument mode, the data products may be available in different "
"polarisation, resolution and swath withs (between 20 km and 410 km). The "
"four different modes are:\n"
"- Stripmap (SM) \n"
"- Interferometric Wide swath (IW)\n"
"- Extra-Wide swath (EW)\n"
"- Wave (WV)"
msgstr ""
"Oibríonn Sentinel-1 i 4 mhód gabhála ionstraime eisiacha. Ag brath ar an "
"mód ionstraime, d'fhéadfadh na táirgí sonraí a bheith ar fáil i "
"bpolarúchán, taifeach agus leithead stráice éagsúla (idir 20 km agus 410 "
"km). Is iad na ceithre mhód éagsúla:\n"
"- Stripmap (SM) \n"
"- Stráice Leathan Idirfheiriméadrach (IW)\n"
"- Stráice Breisleathan (EW)\n"
"- Tonn (WV)"

msgid ""
"Depending on the acquistion mode, the following swaths and identifiers are "
"possible:\n"
"- S1-S6 for SM mode (currently the only supported option)\n"
"- IW1-IW3 for IW mode\n"
"- EW1-EW5 for EW mode\n"
"- WV1-WV2 for WV mode"
msgstr ""
"Ag brath ar an mód gabhála, is féidir na stráicí agus na haitheantóirí seo "
"a leanas:\n"
"- S1-S6 do mhód SM (an t-aon rogha a dtacaítear léi faoi láthair)\n"
"- IW1-IW3 do mhód IW\n"
"- EW1-EW5 do mhód EW\n"
"- WV1-WV2 do mhód WV"

msgid ""
"Determines with which polarisation the data was acquired. The first letter "
"indicates the polarisation when sending the signal, the second letter when "
"receiving the signal, e.g., HV = horizontal polarisation when sending the "
"signal and vertical polarisation when receiving.\n"
"\n"
"Data can be acquired in single polarisation HH (SH) or VV (SV) or in dual "
"polarisation HH&HV (DH) or VV&VH (DV), depending on the instrument mode.\n"
"\n"
"SM, IW and EW can be acquired in single or dual polarisation. WV can only "
"be acquired in single polarisation."
msgstr ""
"Cinneann sé cén polarúchán lena bhfuarthas na sonraí. Léiríonn an chéad "
"litir an polarúchán nuair a sheoltar an comhartha, an dara litir nuair a "
"fhaightear an comhartha, m.sh., HV = polarúchán cothrománach nuair a "
"sheoltar an comhartha agus polarúchán ingearach nuair a fhaightear é.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir sonraí a fháil i bpolarúchán aonair HH (SH) nó VV (SV) nó i "
"bpolarúchán dúbailte HH&HV (DH) nó VV&VH (DV), ag brath ar an mód "
"ionstraime.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir SM, IW agus EW a fháil i bpolarúchán aonair nó dúbailte. Ní "
"féidir WV a fháil ach i bpolarúchán aonair."

msgid ""
"Only applies for Level-1 GRD products and varies depending on the "
"acquisition mode:\n"
"- 3.5 m pixel spacing (full resolution: only SM mode) \n"
"- 10 m pixel spacing (high resolution: SW, IW mode)\n"
"- 25 m pixel spacing (high resolution: EW mode; medium resolution: WV mode)\n"
"- 40 m pixel spacing (medium resolution: SM, IW, EW mode)"
msgstr ""
"Ní bhaineann sé ach le táirgí Leibhéal-1 GRD agus athraíonn sé ag brath ar "
"an mód gabhála:\n"
"- spásáil picteilíní 3.5 m (taifeach iomlán: mód SM amháin) \n"
"- spásáil picteilíní 10 m (ardtaifeach: mód SW, IW)\n"
"- spásáil picteilíní 25 m (ardtaifeach: mód EW; meántaifeach: mód WV)\n"
"- spásáil picteilíní 40 m (meántaifeach: mód SM, IW, EW)"

msgid ""
"Depending on the processing level different product classes are available:\n"
"- Standard (S): all processing levels\n"
"- Calibration (C): Level-0 products \n"
"- Noise (N): Level-0 products\n"
"- Annotation (A): Level-1 and Level-2 products"
msgstr ""
"Ag brath ar an leibhéal próiseála tá ranganna táirgí éagsúla ar fáil:\n"
"- Caighdeánach (S): gach leibhéal próiseála\n"
"- Calabrú (C): táirgí Leibhéal-0 \n"
"- Torann (N): táirgí Leibhéal-0\n"
"- Nótaí (A): táirgí Leibhéal-1 agus Leibhéal-2"

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-2 data includes products from the Sentinel-2 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-2A (operational since 2015) and "
"Sentinel-2B (operational since  2017)."
msgstr ""
"Áirítear leis na sonraí Sentinel-2 atá ar fáil táirgí ó réaltbhuíon "
"satailíte Sentinel-2, lena n-áirítear Sentinel-2A (i bhfeidhm ó 2015) agus "
"Sentinel-2B (i bhfeidhm ó 2017)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between sucessive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 "
"until the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending "
"node crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-2 is in a "
"sun-synchronous orbit with a 10-day repeat cycle (5-days with both "
"satellites) and 143 orbits per cycle."
msgstr ""
"Is é Uimhir na hOrbite Coibhneasta líon na n-orbit iomlán (idir trasnuithe "
"nód ardaitheach i ndiaidh a chéile tríd an Meánchiorcal) ón orbit "
"choibhneasta 1 go dtí deireadh timthrialla. Is í an orbit choibhneasta 1 an "
"orbit a bhfuil a trasnú nód ardaitheach is gaire do Mheridian Greenwich. Tá "
"Sentinel-2 in orbit sioncronach leis an ngrian le timthriall athdhéanta 10 "
"lá (5 lá leis an dá shatailít) agus 143 orbit in aghaidh an timthrialla."

msgid "The available Sentinel-2 data is processed either by ESA or by CloudFerro."
msgstr "Próiseálann ESA nó CloudFerro na sonraí Sentinel-2 atá ar fáil."

msgid ""
"Sentinel-3 data is  available in the following timeliness:\n"
"- Near Real Time (NRT):  typically available within 3 hours after data "
"acquisition\n"
"- Short Time Critical (STC): typically available within 48 hours after data "
"acquisition\n"
"- Non Time Critical (NTC): typically available within 1 months after data "
"acquisition"
msgstr ""
"Tá sonraí Sentinel-3 ar fáil sna tráthúlachtaí seo a leanas:\n"
"- Beagnach fíor-ama (NRT): ar fáil de ghnáth laistigh de 3 uair an chloig "
"tar éis gabhála na sonraí\n"
"- Gearr-am criticiúil (STC): ar fáil de ghnáth laistigh de 48 uair an "
"chloig tar éis gabhála na sonraí\n"
"- Neamh-am-chriticiúil (NTC): ar fáil de ghnáth laistigh de mhí amháin tar "
"éis gabhála na sonraí"

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-3 data includes products from the Sentinel-3 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-3A (operational since 2016) and "
"Sentinel-3B (operational since 2018)."
msgstr ""
"Áirítear leis na sonraí Sentinel-3 atá ar fáil táirgí ó réaltbhuíon "
"satailíte Sentinel-3, lena n-áirítear Sentinel-3A (i mbun oibre ó 2016) "
"agus Sentinel-3B (i mbun oibre ó 2018)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between successive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 "
"until the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending "
"node crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-3 is in a "
"near-polar, sun-synchronous orbit with a repeat cycle of 27 days."
msgstr ""
"Is é an Uimhir Orbaite Choibhneasta líon na n-orbaite iomlán (idir "
"trasnuithe leantacha an nóid ardaitheach tríd an Meánchiorcal) ón orbit "
"choibhneasta 1 go deireadh timthrialla. Is í an orbit choibhneasta 1 an "
"orbit a bhfuil a trasnú nóid ardaitheach is gaire do Mheridian Greenwich. "
"Tá Sentinel-3 in orbit gar-pholach, sioncrónach leis an ngrian, le "
"timthriall athrá 27 lá."

msgid ""
"The timeliness provides information about the delivery time of the data "
"product. For Sentinel-5P there are 3 different timeliness available:\n"
"- Near Real-Time (NRT): available within 3 hours of acquisition\n"
"- Offline: depending on the product, within 12 hours for Level 1B products\n"
"- Reprocessing: no time constraints (performed when major product upgrades "
"are required"
msgstr ""
"Tugann an tráthúlacht faisnéis faoi am seachadta an táirge sonraí. Maidir "
"le Sentinel-5P, tá 3 thráthúlacht dhifriúla ar fáil:\n"
"- Beagnach fíor-ama (NRT): ar fáil laistigh de 3 uair an chloig tar éis "
"gabhála\n"
"- As líne: ag brath ar an táirge, laistigh de 12 uair an chloig do tháirgí "
"Leibhéal 1B\n"
"- Athphróiseáil: gan srianta ama (déantar é nuair a bhíonn mórfheabhsúcháin "
"táirge de dhíth"

msgid ""
"The absolute Orbit Number is the number of orbits that have elapsed since "
"the first ascending node crossing after launch."
msgstr ""
"Is é an Uimhir Orbaite Absalóideach líon na n-orbaite atá caite ón gcéad "
"trasnú nóid ardaitheach tar éis an lainseála."

msgid ""
"These are pre-operational product types generated by the S5P Product "
"Algorithm Laboratory service."
msgstr ""
"Is cineálacha táirge réamh-oibríochtúla iad seo a ghineann seirbhís "
"Saotharlann Algartaim Táirge S5P."

msgid ""
"The unique identifier for a metadata item, including the ground segment "
"namespace to ensure uniqueness within EOP. See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."
msgstr ""
"An t-aitheantóir uathúil do mhír meiteashonraí, lena n-áirítear ainmspás an "
"deighleáin talún chun uathúlacht laistigh d'EOP a chinntiú. Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."

msgid ""
"Four characters code used for identifying the specific mission (e.g. SP05 "
"for Spot5, PH00 for Pleiades Constellation). See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."
msgstr ""
"Cód ceithre charachtar a úsáidtear chun an misean ar leith a aithint (m.sh. "
"SP05 do Spot5, PH00 do Réaltbhuíon Pleiades). Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."

msgid ""
"Full mission identifier name (e.g. SPOT 6/7 Constellation, Planetscope). "
"See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."
msgstr ""
"Ainm iomlán aitheantóra an mhisin (m.sh. Réaltbhuíon SPOT 6/7, "
"Planetscope). Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."

msgid ""
"Full dataset identifier associated to the product (e.g. "
"VHR_IMAGE_2021/IE/Level_3). See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."
msgstr ""
"Aitheantóir iomlán an tacair sonraí a bhaineann leis an táirge (m.sh. "
"VHR_IMAGE_2021/IE/Level_3). Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."

msgid ""
"The product type, specific to the mission, instrument and processing level "
"(e.g. HRG_THX__3_56FB). See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."
msgstr ""
"An cineál táirge, sonrach don mhisean, don ionstraim agus don leibhéal "
"próiseála (m.sh. HRG_THX__3_56FB). Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."

msgid ""
"Maximum absolute value of Off Nadir Angle of the acquired data when "
"available (optional). See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."
msgstr ""
"Uasluach absalóideach na hUillinne Lasnaidir de na sonraí a gabhadh, nuair "
"atá sé ar fáil (roghnach). Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"optical-data)."

msgid ""
"The unique identifier for a metadata item, including the ground segment "
"namespace to ensure uniqueness within EOP. See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."
msgstr ""
"An t-aitheantóir uathúil do mhír meiteashonraí, lena n-áirítear ainmspás an "
"deighleáin talún chun uathúlacht laistigh d'EOP a chinntiú. Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."

msgid ""
"Four characters code used for identifying the specific mission (e.g. CS01 "
"for COSMO-SkyMed 1, IE00 for ICEYE). See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."
msgstr ""
"Cód ceithre charachtar a úsáidtear chun an misean ar leith a aithint (m.sh. "
"CS01 do COSMO-SkyMed 1, IE00 do ICEYE). Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."

msgid ""
"Full mission identifier name (e.g. RADARSAT-2, TerraSAR-X). See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."
msgstr ""
"Ainm iomlán aitheantóra an mhisin (m.sh. RADARSAT-2, TerraSAR-X). Féach "
"tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."

msgid ""
"Full dataset identifier associated to the product (e.g. "
"SAR_SEA_ICE/RS02/Eurarctic). See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."
msgstr ""
"Aitheantóir iomlán an tacair sonraí a bhaineann leis an táirge (m.sh. "
"SAR_SEA_ICE/RS02/Eurarctic). Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."

