"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."
msgstr ""
"An cineál táirge, sonrach don mhisean, don ionstraim agus don leibhéal "
"próiseála (m.sh. SAR_SW_SCW_1BD2). Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"sar-data)."

msgid ""
"GLO-30 and GLO-90 are free and open COP DEM datasets, offering global "
"coverage at resolutions of 30 and 90 m."
msgstr ""
"Is tacair shonraí COP DEM saora agus oscailte iad GLO-30 agus GLO-90, a "
"sholáthraíonn clúdach domhanda ag taifigh de 30 agus 90 m."

msgid ""
"EEA-10 is a COP DEM dataset available for eligible users only, offering "
"European coverage at resolution of 10 m."
msgstr ""
"Is tacar sonraí COP DEM é EEA-10 atá ar fáil d'úsáideoirí incháilithe "
"amháin, a sholáthraíonn clúdach Eorpach ag taifeach de 10 m."

msgid ""
"The unique identifier for a metadata item, including the ground segment "
"namespace to ensure uniqueness within EOP. See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."
msgstr ""
"An t-aitheantóir uathúil do mhír meiteashonraí, lena n-áirítear ainmspás an "
"deighleáin talún chun uathúlacht laistigh d'EOP a chinntiú. Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."

msgid ""
"The delivery ID allows searching for a specific COP DEM delivery. See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an ID seachadta cuardach a dhéanamh ar sheachadadh COP DEM ar "
"leith. Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."

msgid ""
"This attribute allows selection of available data for a specific grid ID. "
"See more "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaíonn an tréith seo sonraí atá ar fáil a roghnú le haghaidh ID eangaí "
"ar leith. Féach tuilleadh "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/Others/CCM.html#"
"copernicus-dem)."

#. Shared across CLMS collections that expose these structural OData attributes.
msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. The format in which the data is stored "
"(NetCDF or Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF)."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé leis na fo-chatagóirí go léir. An fhormáid inar stóráiltear na "
"sonraí (NetCDF nó Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF)."

msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. The unique identifier for the specific "
"dataset within this collection."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé leis na fo-chatagóirí go léir. An t-aitheantóir uathúil don "
"tacar sonraí ar leith laistigh den bhailiúchán seo."

msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. The type of product, identifying the "
"thematic category or processing pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé leis na fo-chatagóirí go léir. An cineál táirge, a "
"shainaithníonn an chatagóir théamach nó an phíblíne próiseála."

msgid ""
"Only applies to data sources within the Snow, Water Bodies and Auxiliary "
"Data categories."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé le foinsí sonraí laistigh de na catagóirí Sneachta, Comhlachtaí "
"Uisce agus Sonraí Cúnta amháin."

msgid ""
"Only applies to data sources within Urban Atlas. Filters results by the "
"country the data covers. Country codes follow the Eurostat convention, see "
"the full list "
"[here](https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index."
"php?title=Glossary%3ACountry_codes)."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé le foinsí sonraí laistigh d'Urban Atlas amháin. Scagann sé "
"torthaí de réir na tíre a chlúdaíonn na sonraí. Leanann cóid tíre "
"coinbhinsiún Eurostat, féach an liosta iomlán "
"[anseo](https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index."
"php?title=Glossary%3ACountry_codes)."

msgid ""
"Applies to all sub-categories. Missions whose input data was used to "
"process the product."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé leis na fo-chatagóirí go léir. Misin ar úsáideadh a sonraí "
"ionchuir chun an táirge a phróiseáil."

msgid ""
"Near real-time consolidation level (RT0–RT6). RT0 is the fastest delivery; "
"RT6 has the highest accuracy. Only applies to data sources within the "
"Vegetation category."
msgstr ""
"Leibhéal comhdhlúthaithe beagnach fíor-ama (RT0–RT6). Is é RT0 an "
"seachadadh is tapúla; tá an cruinneas is airde ag RT6. Baineann sé le "
"foinsí sonraí laistigh den chatagóir Plandúlacht amháin."

msgid ""
"Only applies to data sources within Protected Areas. Filters results by "
"DUid (regional delivery unit code)."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé le foinsí sonraí laistigh de Limistéir Chosanta amháin. Scagann "
"sé torthaí de réir DUid (cód aonaid seachadta réigiúnaigh)."

msgid "This data product was processed by EUMETSAT."
msgstr "Phróiseáil EUMETSAT an táirge sonraí seo."

