"MSI)."

msgid "Identifier of the dataset within a collection."
msgstr "Aitheantóir an tacair shonraí laistigh de bhailiúchán."

msgid "Full name or path of the dataset."
msgstr "Ainm iomlán nó cosán an tacair shonraí."

msgid "Type of product generated, indicating processing level and acquisition mode."
msgstr ""
"Cineál an táirge a gineadh, ag léiriú an leibhéil próiseála agus an mhóid "
"gabhála."

msgid "Start time of the satellite sensing or data acquisition."
msgstr "Am tosaigh bhraite an tsatailíte nó ghabháil na sonraí."

msgid "Unique name or identifier of the product."
msgstr "Ainm uathúil nó aitheantóir an táirge."

msgid "Short name of the satellite platform (e.g., SENTINEL-1, SENTINEL-2)."
msgstr "Gearrainm an ardáin satailíte (m.sh., SENTINEL-1, SENTINEL-2)."

msgid "Identifier for the platform variant (e.g., A or B for Sentinel satellites)."
msgstr "Aitheantóir d'athraitheach an ardáin (m.sh., A nó B do shatailítí Sentinel)."

msgid "Orbit number relative to a fixed reference cycle."
msgstr "Uimhir orbaite i gcoibhneas le timthriall tagartha seasta."

msgid "Processing timeliness category (e.g., Near Real-Time, Offline)."
msgstr "Catagóir tráthúlachta próiseála (m.sh., Beagnach fíor-ama, As líne)."

msgid ""
"Direction of the satellite orbit during acquisition (e.g., ASCENDING, "
"DESCENDING)."
msgstr "Treo orbit an tsatailíte le linn na gabhála (m.sh., ASCENDING, DESCENDING)."

msgid "Acquisition mode used by the instrument (e.g., IW, SM)."
msgstr "Mód gabhála a d'úsáid an ionstraim (m.sh., IW, SM)."

msgid "Radar polarisation modes used (e.g., VV, VH)."
msgstr "Modhanna polarúcháin radair a úsáideadh (m.sh., VV, VH)."

msgid "Absolute orbit number at time of acquisition."
msgstr "Uimhir na horbaite absalóidí tráth na gabhála."

msgid "Mode used for processing the product, if applicable."
msgstr "Mód a úsáideadh chun an táirge a phróiseáil, más infheidhme."

msgid "Identifiers of the swath(s) used in the acquisition (e.g., IW1, IW2, IW3)."
msgstr ""
"Aitheantóirí an stráice/na stráicí a úsáideadh sa ghabháil (m.sh., IW1, "
"IW2, IW3)."

msgid "Indicates whether the product is currently available for download."
msgstr "Léiríonn sé an bhfuil an táirge ar fáil le híoslódáil faoi láthair."

msgid "Source organization or system that produced the data."
msgstr "An eagraíocht nó an córas foinse a tháirg na sonraí."

msgid "Version of the processing software used to generate the product."
msgstr "Leagan den bhogearra próiseála a úsáideadh chun an táirge a ghiniúint."

msgid "Identifier for Sentinel-2 collection (e.g., S2_MSI_L1C)."
msgstr "Aitheantóir do bhailiúchán Sentinel-2 (m.sh., S2_MSI_L1C)."

msgid "Class of the product, indicating type or access constraints."
msgstr "Aicme an táirge, ag léiriú an chineáil nó na srianta rochtana."

msgid "Spatial resolution of the dataset in meters."
msgstr "Taifeach spásúil an tacair shonraí i méadair."

msgid "Identifier conforming to Earth Observation Product standards."
msgstr "Aitheantóir a chomhlíonann caighdeáin Táirgí Faire Domhain."

msgid "Incidence angle across the track of the satellite, typically in degrees."
msgstr "Uillinn ionsaithe trasna rian an tsatailíte, de ghnáth i gcéimeanna."

msgid "Classification of the resolution level (e.g., High, Medium)."
msgstr "Aicmiú an leibhéil taifigh (m.sh., Ard, Meánach)."

msgid "Identifier for the delivery package or transfer bundle."
msgstr "Aitheantóir don phacáiste seachadta nó don bheartán aistrithe."

msgid "Full name of the satellite platform."
msgstr "Ainm iomlán an ardáin satailíte."

msgid "Identifier of the spatial grid cell containing the product."
msgstr "Aitheantóir an chille eangaí spásúil ina bhfuil an táirge."

msgid "Time interval between repeat acquisitions over the same location."
msgstr "Eatramh ama idir gabhálacha athchleachtacha thar an suíomh céanna."

msgid "Version number of the dataset definition."
msgstr "Uimhir leagain de shainmhíniú an tacair shonraí."

msgid "File format used for the data product (e.g., SAFE, GeoTIFF)."
msgstr "Formáid comhaid a úsáidtear don táirge sonraí (m.sh., SAFE, GeoTIFF)."

msgid "Geographic area the data product covers or is relevant to."
msgstr ""
"An limistéar geografach a chlúdaíonn an táirge sonraí nó a bhfuil sé "
"ábhartha dó."

msgid "Globally unique identifier for the dataset."
msgstr "Aitheantóir uathúil go domhanda don tacar sonraí."

msgid "Subsystem or data component involved in the acquisition or processing."
msgstr ""
"Fochóras nó comhpháirt sonraí a bhfuil baint aige leis an ngabháil nó leis "
"an bpróiseáil."

msgid "Human-readable label for the grid cell or tile."
msgstr "Lipéad inléite ag an duine don chill eangaí nó don tíle."

msgid "Spacing of the grid in meters used for spatial referencing."
msgstr "Spásáil na heangaí i méadair a úsáidtear le haghaidh tagartha spásúla."

msgid "Short, human-friendly name of the dataset."
msgstr "Ainm gearr, éasca don tacar sonraí."

msgid "Time period over which data is consolidated for processing or delivery."
msgstr ""
"Tréimhse ama inar comhdhlúthaítear sonraí le haghaidh próiseála nó "
"seachadta."

msgid ""
"The reference date for the data, often representing when it is intended to "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"An dáta tagartha do na sonraí, a léiríonn go minic cathain a bhfuiltear ag "
"tnúth lena n-úsáid."

msgid "We could not restore the compared layers. Please try opening the link again."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir linn na cisil chomparáide a athchóiriú. Bain triail as an "
"nasc a oscailt arís."

msgid "Next"
msgstr "Ar aghaidh"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Roimhe seo"

msgid "End tutorial"
msgstr "Críochnaigh an teagasc"

msgid "Remind me later"
msgstr "Cuir i gcuimhne dom níos déanaí"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Dún"

msgid "Don't show again"
msgstr "Ná taispeáin arís"

msgid ""
"# Welcome to Copernicus Browser!\n"
"\n"
"A complete archive of Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, "
"Sentinel-6,  \n"
"Copernicus Contributing Missions (Optical, SAR and DEM), Copernicus Land "
"Monitoring Service (CLMS), and Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 Global Mosaics "
"data in one place.\n"
"\n"
"[About Copernicus Browser "
"page](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Applications/Browser."
"html)  \n"
"[Available data "
"collections](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections)"
msgstr ""
"# Fáilte go Copernicus Browser!\n"
"\n"
"Cartlann iomlán de shonraí Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, "
"Sentinel-6,  \n"
"Misin Rannpháirteacha Copernicus (Optúil, SAR agus DEM), Seirbhís "
"Faireacháin Talún Copernicus (CLMS), agus Mósáicí Domhanda Sentinel-1 agus "
"Sentinel-2 in aon áit amháin.\n"
"\n"
"[Leathanach Eolais faoi Copernicus "
"Browser](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Applications/Browser."
"html)  \n"
"[Bailiúcháin sonraí atá ar "
"fáil](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections)"

msgid ""
"#### Quick overview of Copernicus Browser features\n"
"\n"
"Copernicus Browser serves as a central hub for accessing, exploring and "
"utilising the wealth of Earth observation and environmental \n"
"data provided by the Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, "
"Sentinel-6, Copernicus Contributing Missions (Optical, SAR and DEM), \n"
"and Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 Global Mosaics (see details "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data.html)). You "
"simply \n"
"go to your area of interest, select data sources, time range and cloud "
"coverage, and inspect the resulting data.\n"
"\n"
"You can continue the tutorial by clicking on the \"Next\" button or you can "
"close it. By clicking the info \n"
"icon <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> "
"in the top right \n"
"corner you can always resume the tutorial in case you closed it by mistake "
"or because you wanted to try something out."
msgstr ""
"#### Forléargas gasta ar ghnéithe Copernicus Browser\n"
"\n"
"Is lárionad é Copernicus Browser chun rochtain a fháil ar an saibhreas "
"sonraí faire Domhain agus comhshaoil a sholáthraíonn Sentinel-1, "
"Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, Sentinel-6, Misin Rannpháirteacha "
"Copernicus (Optúil, SAR agus DEM), \n"
"agus Mósáicí Domhanda Sentinel-1 agus Sentinel-2 (féach sonraí "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data.html)), iad a "
"iniúchadh agus a úsáid. Ní gá duit ach \n"
"teacht chuig do limistéar spéise, foinsí sonraí, raon ama agus clúdach "
"scamall a roghnú, agus na sonraí a thagann as a iniúchadh.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat leanúint ar aghaidh leis an teagasc trí chliceáil ar an "
"gcnaipe \"Ar aghaidh\" nó is féidir leat é a dhúnadh. Trí chliceáil ar an "
"deilbhín \n"
"faisnéise <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span> sa chúinne uachtarach ar dheis \n"
"is féidir leat an teagasc a atosú i gcónaí má dhún tú é trí earráid nó "
"toisc gur theastaigh uait rud éigin a thriail."

msgid ""
"Anonymous use of the Browser gives you access with limited functionality. "
"To be able to use all functions, you need a free account. \n"
"**Logged-in users** can use their custom themes, save and load pins, "
"measure distances, create a timelapse and use the extended image download."
msgstr ""
"Má úsáideann tú an Browser gan ainm, tá rochtain agat ar fheidhmiúlacht "
"theoranta. Chun gach feidhm a úsáid, teastaíonn cuntas saor in aisce uait. \n"
"Is féidir le **húsáideoirí logáilte isteach** a dtéamaí saincheaptha a "
"úsáid, bioráin a shábháil agus a luchtú, achair a thomhas, time-lapse a "
"chruthú agus an íoslódáil íomhá leathnaithe a úsáid."

msgid ""
"In the **Visualise tab** you can:\n"
"- Search for a **Date**.\n"
"- Select a **Theme**.\n"
"- Choose a **Collection**.\n"
"- Select a **Visualisation Layer**.\n"
"\n"
"You can change the **Date** (type in or select it from the calendar) and "
"set the cloud coverage. You can choose between \n"
"single date, mosaic and time range: ![Single](icon) ![Mosaic](icon) ![Time "
"Range](icon).\n"
"\n"
"The **Configurations** dropdown offers you different preconfigured themes "
"and your own custom configured instances if\n"
"you are logged in. To create an instance, go to your [personal "
"dashboard](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/).\n"
"\n"
"You can select a desired data source in the **Data Collections**. You can "
"read explanations of the satellites by clicking \n"
"on the information icon next to the name of the data collection. Here you "
"can also switch between different panels: \n"
"![Layers](icon) Layers, ![Highlights](icon) Highlights, ![Compare "
"mode](icon) Compare mode and ![Pins](icon) Pins."
msgstr ""
"Sa **chluaisín Amharcléirigh** is féidir leat:\n"
"- **Dáta** a chuardach.\n"
"- **Téama** a roghnú.\n"
"- **Bailiúchán** a roghnú.\n"
"- **Ciseal Amharcléirithe** a roghnú.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat an **Dáta** a athrú (clóscríobh é nó roghnaigh ón bhféilire "
"é) agus an clúdach scamall a shocrú. Is féidir leat a roghnú idir \n"
"dáta amháin, mósáic agus raon ama: ![Single](icon) ![Mosaic](icon) ![Time "
"Range](icon).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraíonn an anuasliosta **Cumraíochtaí** téamaí réamhchumraithe éagsúla "
"duit agus do chásanna saincheaptha féin má\n"
"tá tú logáilte isteach. Chun cás a chruthú, téigh chuig do [dheais "
"pearsanta](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/).\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat foinse sonraí atá uait a roghnú sna **Bailiúcháin Sonraí**. "
"Is féidir leat míniúcháin ar na satailítí a léamh trí chliceáil \n"
"ar an deilbhín faisnéise in aice le hainm an bhailiúcháin sonraí. Anseo is "
"féidir leat aistriú idir painéil éagsúla freisin: \n"
"![Layers](icon) Cisil, ![Highlights](icon) Buaicphointí, ![Compare "
"mode](icon) Mód comparáide agus ![Pins](icon) Bioráin."

msgid ""
"You can select different pre-installed or custom spectral band combinations "
"to visualise data for the selected result.\n"
"\n"
"Some of the common options:\n"
"- **True Color** - Visual interpretation of land cover\n"
"- **False Color** - Visual interpretation of vegetation\n"
"- **NDVI** - Vegetation index\n"
"- **Moisture index** - Moisture index\n"
"- **SWIR** - Shortwave-infrared index\n"
"- **NDWI** - Normalized Difference Water Index\n"
"- **NDSI** - Normalized Difference Snow Index\n"
"\n"
"Most visualisations are given a description and a legend, which you can "
"view by clicking on the expand sign ![expand](icon).\n"
"Each of the layers offers an option to add it to Compare or Pins by "
"clicking <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Add to</span>.\n"
"Based on your action, the Compare and Pins panels will include added layers "
"![compare-with-badge](icon) ![pins-with-badge](icon)\n"
"which you can further organise and analyse under each tab.\n"
"\n"
"Click on the **Custom visualisation** option to select custom band "
"combinations, index combinations or write your own classification script "
"for the\n"
"visualisation of data. You can also use custom scripts, which are stored "
"elsewhere, either on Google Drive, GitHub or in our\n"
"[Custom script repository](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/). Paste "
"the URL of the script into the text box in the advanced script editing "
"panel\n"
"and click Refresh. The custom script of preconfigured layers can be edited "
"by choosing the code icon ![code-icon](icon).\n"
"\n"
"You can select <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-sliders\"></i></span> "
"**Show effects and advanced options** like the sampling method, advanced "
"RGB effects or apply \n"
"contrast (gain) and luminance (gamma). To return to preconfigured layers, "
"click <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-paint-brush\"></i></span> "
"**Show visualisations**.\n"
"**Share** your visualisation on social media by clicking on the share icon "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-share-alt\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat teaglamaí banda speictrim éagsúla réamhshuiteáilte nó "
"saincheaptha a roghnú chun sonraí an toraidh roghnaithe a amharcléiriú.\n"
"\n"
"Cuid de na roghanna coitianta:\n"
"- **Fíordhath** - Léirmhíniú amhairc ar chlúdach talún\n"
"- **Dath bréagach** - Léirmhíniú amhairc ar phlandúlacht\n"
"- **NDVI** - Innéacs plandúlachta\n"
"- **Innéacs taise** - Innéacs taise\n"
"- **SWIR** - Innéacs infridhearg gearrthonnach\n"
"- **NDWI** - Innéacs Uisce Difríochta Normalaithe\n"
"- **NDSI** - Innéacs Sneachta Difríochta Normalaithe\n"
"\n"
"Tugtar cur síos agus eochair do fhormhór na n-amharcléiriúchán, ar féidir "
"leat iad a fheiceáil trí chliceáil ar an gcomhartha leathnaithe "
"![expand](icon).\n"
"Tugann gach ceann de na cisil rogha chun é a chur le Comparáid nó le "
"Bioráin trí chliceáil ar <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> "
"Cuir le</span>.\n"
"Ar bhonn do ghnímh, beidh na cisil a cuireadh leis sna painéil Comparáid "
"agus Bioráin ![compare-with-badge](icon) ![pins-with-badge](icon)\n"
"ar féidir leat iad a eagrú agus a anailísiú tuilleadh faoi gach cluaisín.\n"
"\n"
"Cliceáil ar an rogha **Amharcléiriú saincheaptha** chun teaglamaí banda "
"saincheaptha, teaglamaí innéacs a roghnú nó do script aicmithe féin a "
"scríobh chun\n"
"sonraí a amharcléiriú. Is féidir leat scripteanna saincheaptha a úsáid "
"freisin, atá stóráilte in áit eile, ar Google Drive, ar GitHub nó inár\n"
"[stór scripteanna saincheaptha](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/). "
"Greamaigh URL an script isteach sa bhosca téacs sa phainéal "
"eagarthóireachta script casta\n"
"agus cliceáil Athnuaigh. Is féidir script saincheaptha na gciseal "
"réamhchumraithe a chur in eagar trí dheilbhín an chóid a roghnú "
"![code-icon](icon).\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-sliders\"></i></span> "
"**Taispeáin éifeachtaí agus roghanna casta** a roghnú, ar nós modh "
"samplála, éifeachtaí RGB casta nó \n"
"codarsnacht (gnóthú) agus lonrachas (gamma) a chur i bhfeidhm. Chun "
"filleadh ar chisil réamhchumraithe, cliceáil <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-paint-brush\"></i></span> **Taispeáin amharcléiriúcháin**.\n"
"**Comhroinn** d'amharcléiriú ar na meáin shóisialta trí chliceáil ar an "
"deilbhín comhroinnte <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-share-alt\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"If you choose one of the preconfigured themes under **Configurations**, you "
"will be able to select from a highlights list under the Highlights panel.\n"
"\n"
"Each highlight has a description accessible under the dropdown icon "
"![expand-description](icon)."
msgstr ""
"Má roghnaíonn tú ceann de na téamaí réamhchumraithe faoi **Cumraíochtaí**, "
"beidh tú in ann roghnú ó liosta buaicphointí faoin bpainéal Buaicphointí.\n"
"\n"
"Tá cur síos ar fáil ar gach buaicphointe faoin deilbhín anuasliosta "
"![expand-description](icon)."

msgid ""
"Here you will find all visualisations that you added by clicking <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Add to</span> on \n"
"the layers under the Layers panel.\n"
"\n"
"There are two modes of comparing:\n"
"- **Opacity** (drag opacity slider left or right to fade between compared "
"images)\n"
"- **Split** (drag split slider left or right to set the boundary between "
"compared images)"
msgstr ""
"Anseo gheobhaidh tú na hamharcléiriúcháin go léir a chuir tú leis trí "
"chliceáil ar <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Cuir "
"le</span> ar \n"
"na cisil faoin bpainéal Cisil.\n"
"\n"
"Tá dhá mhód chomparáide ann:\n"
"- **Teimhneacht** (tarraing an sleamhnán teimhneachta ar chlé nó ar dheis "
"chun idir na híomhánna comparáide a chaochan)\n"
"- **Scoilt** (tarraing an sleamhnán scoilte ar chlé nó ar dheis chun an "
"teorainn idir na híomhánna comparáide a shocrú)"

msgid ""
"The **Pins** panel contains your pinned (favourite/saved) items. Pinned "
"items contain information about location, data source \n"
"and its specific layer, zoom level and time. To reorder the pins, choose "
"among the options in the **Order by** dropdown.\n"
"\n"
"You have several ways to interact with each pin:\n"
"- Change **order** - by clicking on the move icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-ellipsis-v\"></i><i class=\"fa fa-ellipsis-v\"></i></span> \n"
"in the top left corner of the pin and dragging the pin up or down the list.\n"
"- **Rename** - by clicking on the pencil icon ![rename](icon) next to the "
"pin's name.\n"
"- Add to the **Compare** panel - by clicking on the compare icon "
"![compare](icon).\n"
"- Enter a **description** - by clicking on the expand icon ![expand](icon).\n"
"- **Remove** - by clicking the remove icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"- **Zoom** to the pin's location - by clicking on the Lat/Lon.\n"
"\n"
"In the line above your pins, you have different options that apply to all "
"pins:\n"
"- Create your own story from pins - by clicking on **Story**.\n"
"- Share your pins with others via a link - by clicking on **Share**.\n"
"- Export pins as a JSON file - by clicking on **Export**.\n"
"- Import pins from a JSON file - by clicking on **Import**.\n"
"- Delete all pins - by clicking on **Clear**."
msgstr ""
"Tá do mhíreanna bioráin (ceanán/sábháilte) sa phainéal **Bioráin**. Tá "
"faisnéis i míreanna bioráin faoin suíomh, an fhoinse sonraí \n"
"agus a ciseal sonrach, leibhéal súmála agus am. Chun na bioráin a athordú, "
"roghnaigh i measc na roghanna san anuasliosta **Ordaigh de réir**.\n"
"\n"
"Tá roinnt bealaí agat chun idirghníomhú le gach biorán:\n"
"- Athraigh an **t-ord** - trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín bogtha <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-ellipsis-v\"></i><i class=\"fa "
"fa-ellipsis-v\"></i></span> \n"
"sa chúinne uachtarach ar chlé den bhiorán agus an biorán a tharraingt suas "
"nó síos an liosta.\n"
"- **Athainmnigh** - trí chliceáil ar dheilbhín an pheann luaidhe "
"![rename](icon) in aice le hainm an bhioráin.\n"
"- Cuir leis an bpainéal **Comparáid** - trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín "
"comparáide ![compare](icon).\n"
"- Cuir isteach **cur síos** - trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín leathnaithe "
"![expand](icon).\n"
"- **Bain** - trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín bainte <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"- **Súmáil** chuig suíomh an bhioráin - trí chliceáil ar an Lat/Lon.\n"
"\n"
"Sa líne os cionn do bhioráin, tá roghanna éagsúla agat a bhaineann leis na "
"bioráin go léir:\n"
"- Cruthaigh do scéal féin ó bhioráin - trí chliceáil ar **Scéal**.\n"
"- Comhroinn do bhioráin le daoine eile trí nasc - trí chliceáil ar "
"**Comhroinn**.\n"
"- Easpórtáil bioráin mar chomhad JSON - trí chliceáil ar **Easpórtáil**.\n"
"- Iompórtáil bioráin ó chomhad JSON - trí chliceáil ar **Iompórtáil**.\n"
"- Scrios na bioráin go léir - trí chliceáil ar **Glan**."

msgid ""
"The **WMS/WMTS panel** lets you add third-party map layers to Copernicus "
"Browser via a service **GetCapabilities URL**.\n"
"\n"
"To **add a service** - paste its GetCapabilities URL into the input field "
"and click the add button <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-plus\"></i></span> (or press Enter). The service and its layers appear "
"alongside the standard collections.\n"
"\n"
"Once a service is loaded, you can:\n"
"- View **service details** (description, access constraints and fees) - by "
"clicking on the info icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span> next to the service name.\n"
"- **Select** a service - by clicking on its name; the active service is "
"marked with a checkmark and its layers are listed below.\n"
"- **Remove** a service - by clicking on the remove icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"In the layer list you can **search** layers by name, page through them with "
"the <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i></span> and "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span> "
"controls, and pick how many layers to show per page. Click a layer to "
"display it on the map. On the active layer, use **Add to** <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span> to add it to the "
"**Compare** or **Pins** panels."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann **painéal WMS/WMTS** duit cisil léarscáile tríú páirtí a chur le "
"Copernicus Browser trí **URL GetCapabilities** seirbhíse.\n"
"\n"
"Chun **seirbhís a chur leis** - greamaigh a URL GetCapabilities isteach sa "
"réimse ionchuir agus cliceáil ar an gcnaipe cuir leis <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span> (nó brúigh Enter). "
"Taispeántar an tseirbhís agus a cisil taobh leis na bailiúcháin "
"chaighdeánacha.\n"
"\n"
"Ag an bpointe go bhfuil seirbhís luchtaithe, is féidir leat:\n"
"- **Sonraí na seirbhíse** (cur síos, srianta rochtana agus táillí) a "
"fheiceáil - trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín faisnéise <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> in aice le hainm na seirbhíse.\n"
"- Seirbhís a **roghnú** - trí chliceáil ar a hainm; marcáiltear an "
"tseirbhís ghníomhach le tic agus liostaítear a cisil thíos.\n"
"- Seirbhís a **bhaint** - trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín bainte <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Sa liosta ciseal is féidir leat cisil a **chuardach** de réir ainm, scrollú "
"tríothu leis na rialuithe <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-chevron-left\"></i></span> agus <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>, agus roghnú cé mhéad ciseal le taispeáint "
"ar gach leathanach. Cliceáil ar chiseal chun é a thaispeáint ar an "
"léarscáil. Ar an gciseal gníomhach, úsáid **Cuir le** <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span> chun é a chur leis na "
"painéil **Comparáid** nó **Bioráin**."

msgid ""
"Under **Search** you can set:\n"
"- **Search criteria** by a product name.\n"
"- Choose from which **data sources** you want to receive the data by "
"selecting checkboxes. Where applicable, you can also set **filters**\n"
"such as satellite platform, orbit direction, relative orbit, number, "
"acquisition mode, product availability, timeliness, etc.\n"
"- Select the **time range** by either typing the date or selecting it from "
"the calendar. If you want to omit some of the months, enable\n"
"the **Filter by months** option and uncheck the non-relevant months.\n"
"\n"
"Once you hit Search you get a list of results. Each result is presented "
"with a preview image and relevant data specific to the data source.\n"
"For **product info** and **zooming to product**, click on the <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i></span> and <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> icons.\n"
"If you are logged in, you can click on ![workspace-add](icon) to **add a "
"product to your Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem Workspace**\n"
"to easily collect and process your satellite data. You can also **download "
"the product** by clicking on the download icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-download\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Clicking on the Visualise button will open the **Visualise** tab for the "
"selected result."
msgstr ""
"Faoi **Cuardaigh** is féidir leat a shocrú:\n"
"- **Critéir chuardaigh** de réir ainm táirge.\n"
"- Roghnaigh cé na **foinsí sonraí** ar mian leat na sonraí a fháil uathu "
"trí na ticbhoscaí a roghnú. Nuair is infheidhme, is féidir leat "
"**scagairí** a shocrú freisin\n"
"ar nós ardán satailíte, treo orbaite, orbit choibhneasta, uimhir, mód "
"gabhála, infhaighteacht táirge, tráthúlacht, etc.\n"
"- Roghnaigh an **raon ama** trí chlóscríobh an dáta nó é a roghnú ón "
"bhféilire. Más mian leat roinnt de na míonna a fhágáil ar lár, cumasaigh\n"
"an rogha **Scag de réir míonna** agus díthiceáil na míonna nach bhfuil "
"ábhartha.\n"
"\n"
"An uair a bhuaileann tú Cuardaigh faigheann tú liosta torthaí. Léirítear "
"gach toradh le híomhá réamhamhairc agus sonraí ábhartha atá sonrach don "
"fhoinse sonraí.\n"
"Chun **faisnéis táirge** agus **súmáil chuig táirge**, cliceáil ar na "
"deilbhíní <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i></span> "
"agus <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-crosshairs\"></i></span>.\n"
"Má tá tú logáilte isteach, is féidir leat cliceáil ar "
"![workspace-add](icon) chun **táirge a chur le do Spás Oibre Copernicus "
"Data Space Ecosystem**\n"
"chun do shonraí satailíte a bhailiú agus a phróiseáil go héasca. Is féidir "
"leat **an táirge a íoslódáil** freisin trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín "
"íoslódála <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-download\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Má chliceálann tú ar an gcnaipe Amharcléirigh, osclófar an **cluaisín "
"Amharcléirigh** don toradh roghnaithe."

msgid ""
"Search for a location either by scrolling the map with a mouse or by "
"entering the location in the **Go to Place** field."
msgstr ""
"Cuardaigh suíomh trí scrollú na léarscáile le luch nó trí an suíomh a "
"iontráil sa réimse **Téigh chuig Áit**."

msgid ""
"Here you can select which base layer and overlays (borders, labels) are "
"shown on the map."
msgstr ""
"Anseo is féidir leat a roghnú cén bunchiseal agus cé na forleagain "
"(teorainneacha, lipéid) a thaispeántar ar an léarscáil."

msgid ""
"You can view the tutorial anytime by clicking on this info icon <span "
"class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an teagasc a fheiceáil am ar bith trí chliceáil ar an "
"deilbhín faisnéise seo <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to draw a polygon on the map and display the polygon's "
"size.\n"
"\n"
"All layers that return a single value (such as NDVI, Moisture Index, NDWI, "
"...) support viewing the index\n"
"for the selected area over time. Clicking the chart icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span> will\n"
"display the statistical information charts (you need to be logged in to use "
"this option). You can remove the polygon \n"
"by clicking the remove icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-close\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"You can also upload a KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (in EPSG:4326) or GEOJSON/JSON file "
"with a polygon geometry using the\n"
"upload icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"The two sheets icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> lets you copy the polygon coordinates as a \n"
"GEOJSON and the crosshair <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> centers the map on the drawn polygon."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an uirlis seo duit polagán a tharraingt ar an léarscáil agus méid "
"an pholagáin a thaispeáint.\n"
"\n"
"Tacaíonn gach ciseal a thugann luach amháin ar ais (ar nós NDVI, Innéacs "
"Taise, NDWI, ...) le hamharc ar an innéacs\n"
"don limistéar roghnaithe thar am. Má chliceálann tú ar dheilbhín na cairte "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span>, taispeánfar\n"
"na cairteacha faisnéise staidrimh (ní mór duit a bheith logáilte isteach "
"chun an rogha seo a úsáid). Is féidir leat an polagán a bhaint \n"
"trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín bainte <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-close\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat comhad KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (in EPSG:4326) nó GEOJSON/JSON le "
"céimseata polagáin a uaslódáil freisin leis an\n"
"deilbhín uaslódála <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Ligeann an deilbhín dhá bhileog <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> duit comhordanáidí an pholagáin a chóipeáil mar \n"
"GEOJSON agus déanann an crosghruaig <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> an léarscáil a lárú ar an bpolagán tarraingthe."

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to draw a line on the map and display the line length.\n"
"\n"
"It also includes the **Elevation Profile**, a tool that allows you to "
"create the altitude profile by defining a line from point A to point B.\n"
"\n"
"You can also upload a KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (in EPSG:4326) or GEOJSON/JSON file "
"using the upload icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"The two sheets icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> lets you copy the line coordinates as a \n"
"GEOJSON and the crosshair <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> centers the map on the drawn line."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an uirlis seo duit líne a tharraingt ar an léarscáil agus fad na "
"líne a thaispeáint.\n"
"\n"
"Tá an **Próifíl Airde** san áireamh freisin, uirlis a ligeann duit próifíl "
"airde a chruthú trí líne a shainiú ó phointe A go pointe B.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat comhad KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (in EPSG:4326) nó GEOJSON/JSON a "
"uaslódáil freisin leis an deilbhín uaslódála <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Ligeann an deilbhín dhá bhileog <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> duit comhordanáidí na líne a chóipeáil mar \n"
"GEOJSON agus déanann an crosghruaig <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> an léarscáil a lárú ar an líne tarraingthe."

msgid ""
"With this tool, you can mark a point on the map.\n"
"\n"
"You can also view statistical data for some layers by clicking on the chart "
"icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span>. \n"
"You can remove the mark by clicking the remove icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Leis an uirlis seo, is féidir leat pointe a mharcáil ar an léarscáil.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat sonraí staidrimh a fheiceáil do roinnt cisil freisin trí "
"chliceáil ar dheilbhín na cairte <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-bar-chart\"></i></span>. \n"
"Is féidir leat an marc a bhaint trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín bainte <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"With this tool, you can measure distances and areas on the map.\n"
"\n"
"Every mouse click creates a new point on the path. To stop adding points, "
"press the <code>Esc</code> key or double-click on the map.  \n"
"You can remove the measurement by clicking the remove icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Leis an uirlis seo, is féidir leat achair agus limistéir a thomhas ar an "
"léarscáil.\n"
"\n"
"Cruthaíonn gach cliceáil luiche pointe nua ar an gcosán. Chun stop a chur "
"le pointí a chur leis, brúigh an eochair <code>Esc</code> nó déchliceáil ar "
"an léarscáil.  \n"
"Is féidir leat an tomhas a bhaint trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín bainte <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"With this tool, you can download an image of visualised data for the "
"displayed location. You can choose to show \n"
"captions and you can add your own description. By enabling Analytical mode, "
"you can choose between various image formats, \n"
"image resolutions and coordinate systems. You can also select multiple "
"layers and download them as a <code>.zip</code> file.\n"
"\n"
"Click the download button <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-download\"></i> Download</span> and your image(s) will \n"
"begin to download. The process can take a few seconds, depending on the "
"selected resolution and the number of selected layers.\n"
"\n"
"Before downloading, you can define an area of interest (AOI) by clicking on "
"the Area selection tool icon ![selection](icon).\n"
"Your data will be clipped to match this area."
msgstr ""
"Leis an uirlis seo, is féidir leat íomhá de shonraí amharcléirithe a "
"íoslódáil don suíomh a thaispeántar. Is féidir leat a roghnú \n"
"fotheidil a thaispeáint agus is féidir leat do chur síos féin a chur leis. "
"Trí Mód Anailíseach a chumasú, is féidir leat roghnú idir formáidí íomhá "
"éagsúla, \n"
"taifigh íomhá agus córais chomhordanáidí. Is féidir leat cisil iolracha a "
"roghnú freisin agus iad a íoslódáil mar chomhad <code>.zip</code>.\n"
"\n"
"Cliceáil ar an gcnaipe íoslódála <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-download\"></i> Íoslódáil</span> agus tosóidh do chuid íomhá(nna) ag \n"
"íoslódáil. Féadann an próiseas cúpla soicind a thógáil, ag brath ar an "
"taifeach roghnaithe agus ar líon na gciseal roghnaithe.\n"
"\n"
"Sula n-íoslódálann tú, is féidir leat limistéar spéise (AOI) a shainiú trí "
"chliceáil ar dheilbhín uirlis roghnúcháin an Limistéir ![selection](icon).\n"
"Déanfar do shonraí a ghearradh chun an limistéar seo a mheaitseáil."

msgid ""
"With this tool (available to logged-in users), you can create a timelapse "
"animation of the visualised layer and displayed location.\n"
"\n"
"First, choose a time range. You can refine your search results further via "
"the **Filter by months** checkbox and/or by selecting one\n"
"image per defined period (orbit, day, week, month, year).\n"
"\n"
"Then press <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i> "
"Search</span> and select your images. You can select all \n"
"by checking the checkbox or filter the images by cloud coverage by moving "
"the slider. Or you can pick images one by one by scrolling \n"
"through the list and selecting them. Via the **Borders** checkbox, you can "
"enable/disable the borders on your image.\n"
"\n"
"You can preview the timelapse by pressing the play button <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-play-circle\"></i></span>, set the speed "
"(frames per second)\n"
"and transition mode, all available at the bottom of the screen. See "
"additional settings by clicking the\n"
"settings icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-cogs\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"When you are satisfied with the result, click the download button and the "
"timelapse will be downloaded as a <code>.gif</code> or <code>.mp4</code> "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Leis an uirlis seo (atá ar fáil d'úsáideoirí logáilte isteach), is féidir "
"leat beochan time-lapse a chruthú den chiseal amharcléirithe agus den "
"suíomh a thaispeántar.\n"
"\n"
"Roghnaigh raon ama ar dtús. Is féidir leat do thorthaí cuardaigh a scagadh "
"tuilleadh tríd an ticbhosca **Scag de réir míonna** agus/nó trí íomhá "
"amháin a roghnú\n"
"in aghaidh gach tréimhse shainithe (orbit, lá, seachtain, mí, bliain).\n"
"\n"
"Brúigh ansin <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i> "
"Cuardaigh</span> agus roghnaigh d'íomhánna. Is féidir leat iad ar fad a "
"roghnú \n"
"trí an ticbhosca a thicáil nó na híomhánna a scagadh de réir clúdach "
"scamall trí an sleamhnán a bhogadh. Nó is féidir leat íomhánna a roghnú "
"ceann ar cheann trí scrollú \n"
"tríd an liosta agus iad a roghnú. Tríd an ticbhosca **Teorainneacha**, is "
"féidir leat na teorainneacha ar d'íomhá a chumasú/a dhíchumasú.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat réamhamharc a dhéanamh ar an time-lapse trí an cnaipe "
"seinnte a bhrú <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-play-circle\"></i></span>, an luas (fráma sa soicind) a shocrú\n"
"agus an mód aistrithe, atá ar fad ar fáil ag bun an scáileáin. Féach "
"socruithe breise trí chliceáil ar an\n"
"deilbhín socruithe <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-cogs\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Nuair atá tú sásta leis an toradh, cliceáil ar an gcnaipe íoslódála agus "
"íoslódálfar an time-lapse mar chomhad <code>.gif</code> nó "
"<code>.mp4</code>."

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to navigate and fly through terrain effortlessly.\n"
"\n"
"You can make use of the 3D feature by utilising the following tools:\n"
"- Use **Vertical Terrain Scaling** to make flatter areas appear more "
"dynamic\n"
"- Simulate the Sun's movements and its projected shadows at any time of the "
"day\n"
"- Manipulate the **Shadow Parameters**\n"
"  - Shadow visibility\n"
"  - Shadow rendering distance\n"
"  - Shadow map size\n"
"- Control the ambient, diffuse and specular factors as well as specular "
"power\n"
"- Use the **Anaglyph Stereo Mode** to create two distinct red and blue "
"images to produce a single 3D stereo image"
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an uirlis seo duit nascleanúint agus eitilt a dhéanamh thar "
"tír-raon go héasca.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat leas a bhaint as an ngné 3T trí úsáid a bhaint as na "
"huirlisí seo a leanas:\n"
"- Úsáid **Scálú Ingearach Tír-raoin** chun go mbeidh limistéir níos "
"leibhéalta le feiceáil níos bríomhaire\n"
"- Insamhail gluaiseachtaí na Gréine agus a scáthanna teilgthe ag am ar bith "
"den lá\n"
"- Láimhsigh na **Paraiméadair Scátha**\n"
"  - Infheictheacht scátha\n"
"  - Fad rindreála scátha\n"
"  - Méid léarscáile scátha\n"
"- Rialaigh na fachtóirí comhthimpeallacha, craobhscaoilte agus scáthánacha "
"chomh maith le cumhacht scáthánach\n"
"- Úsáid an **Mód Steiréó Anaglaife** chun dhá íomhá dhifriúla dhearga agus "
"ghorma a chruthú chun íomhá steiréó 3T amháin a tháirgeadh"

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to calculate and display statistical data (the "
"distribution of values) for specific layers.\n"
"\n"
"It is calculated for the data within your AOI (if defined) or otherwise for "
"the whole screen.\n"
"\n"
"You can hover over the bars in the histogram to read the values and "
"determine thresholds to distinguish between different spectral signatures.\n"
"\n"
"This tool currently only works for index layers (e.g. the NDVI)."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an uirlis seo duit sonraí staidrimh (dáileadh na luachanna) a ríomh "
"agus a thaispeáint do chisil ar leith.\n"
"\n"
"Ríomhtar é do na sonraí laistigh de d'AOI (más sainithe) nó ar shlí eile "
"don scáileán iomlán.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat do chúrsóir a chur os cionn na mbarraí sa histeagram chun na "
"luachanna a léamh agus tairseacha a chinneadh chun idirdhealú a dhéanamh "
"idir sínithe speictreacha éagsúla.\n"
"\n"
"Is ar chisil innéacs amháin a oibríonn an uirlis seo faoi láthair (m.sh. an "
"NDVI)."

msgid ""
"You have reached the end of the tutorial. If you have any other questions, "
"feel free to ask us on \n"
"[our forum](https://forum.dataspace.copernicus.eu/) or [submit a "
"request](https://helpcenter.dataspace.copernicus.eu/hc/en-gb/requests/new).\n"
"\n"
"If you would like to view the tutorial in the future, you can always access "
"it by clicking the info \n"
"icon <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> "
"in the top right corner."
msgstr ""
"Tá deireadh an teagaisc sroichte agat. Más ceist ar bith eile atá agat, ná "
"bíodh drogall ort ceist a chur orainn ar \n"
"[ár bhfóram](https://forum.dataspace.copernicus.eu/) nó [iarratas a chur "
"isteach](https://helpcenter.dataspace.copernicus.eu/hc/en-gb/requests/new).\n"
"\n"
"Má theastaíonn uait an teagasc a fheiceáil amach anseo, is féidir leat "
"teacht air i gcónaí trí chliceáil ar an deilbhín \n"
"faisnéise <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span> sa chúinne uachtarach ar dheis."

msgid ""
"#### Quick overview of Copernicus Browser features\n"
"\n"
"If you have a small screen, please go "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Applications/Browser."
"html) to view our user guide.\n"
"\n"
"You can always view this info again by clicking the info icon <span "
"class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> in the top "
"right corner.\n"
"\n"
"#### Other resources\n"
