msgid ""
"A **configuration** determines which collections, visualisation layers and "
"highlights are available to you.\n"
"\n"
"- **Configurations** are prepared by us and cover common use cases. Each "
"one comes with a curated list of collections that fit its purpose.\n"
"- **User configurations** are your own instances, created in your [personal "
"dashboard](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/). They are "
"available when you are logged in.\n"
"- **Highlights** are shown by default for our prepared configurations. They "
"are ready-made examples that let you start exploring without setting "
"anything up first."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn **cumraíocht** cé na bailiúcháin, na cisil amharcléirithe agus na "
"buaicphointí atá ar fáil duit.\n"
"\n"
"- Ullmhaímid **Cumraíochtaí** agus clúdaíonn siad cásanna úsáide coitianta. "
"Tagann liosta bailiúchán roghnaithe le gach ceann acu a oireann dá "
"chuspóir.\n"
"- Is cásanna de do chuid féin iad **cumraíochtaí úsáideora**, a "
"chruthaítear i do [dheais "
"pearsanta](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/). Tá siad ar "
"fáil nuair atá tú logáilte isteach.\n"
"- Taispeántar **Buaicphointí** de réir réamhshocraithe dár gcumraíochtaí "
"ullmhaithe. Is samplaí réamhdhéanta iad a ligeann duit tosú ag iniúchadh "
"gan aon rud a shocrú ar dtús."

