msgid ""
"No products were found for the selected time range and area. To search for "
"products select a time range within an area where data is displayed on the "
"map first."
msgstr ""
"Níor aimsíodh aon táirgí don raon ama agus don limistéar roghnaithe. Chun "
"táirgí a chuardach, roghnaigh raon ama ar dtús laistigh de limistéar ina "
"dtaispeántar sonraí ar an léarscáil."

msgid ""
"No products were found for the selected search parameters.\n"
"\n"
"The filters you've applied might be limiting your results. To get more "
"results, try selecting more data sources, extending the time range or "
"selecting a larger area on the map. You could also review your additional "
"filters."
msgstr ""
"Níor aimsíodh aon táirgí do na paraiméadair chuardaigh roghnaithe.\n"
"\n"
"D'fhéadfadh na scagairí a chuir tú i bhfeidhm do thorthaí a theorannú. Chun "
"níos mó torthaí a fháil, bain triail as níos mó foinsí sonraí a roghnú, an "
"raon ama a leathnú nó limistéar níos mó a roghnú ar an léarscáil. D'fhéadfá "
"do scagairí breise a athbhreithniú freisin."

msgid ""
"No products were found for one of your selected data sources.\n"
"\n"
"The filters you've applied might be limiting the results for that source. "
"You could try extending the time range, selecting a larger area on the map, "
"or reviewing your additional filters."
msgstr ""
"Níor aimsíodh aon táirgí d'fhoinse amháin de do chuid foinsí sonraí "
"roghnaithe.\n"
"\n"
"D'fhéadfadh na scagairí a chuir tú i bhfeidhm na torthaí don fhoinse sin a "
"theorannú. D'fhéadfá triail a bhaint as an raon ama a leathnú, limistéar "
"níos mó a roghnú ar an léarscáil, nó do scagairí breise a athbhreithniú."

msgid "Select a data source or enter search criteria to see results."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh foinse sonraí nó iontráil critéir chuardaigh chun torthaí a "
"fheiceáil."

msgid "Invalid time range!"
msgstr "Raon ama neamhbhailí!"

msgid "Invalid date range!"
msgstr "Raon dátaí neamhbhailí!"

