msgid ""
"**Sentinel-5P** is a satellite that provides atmospheric measurements to be "
"used for air quality, ozone monitoring, UV radiation,\n"
"and climate monitoring and forecasting.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 7 x 3.5km (that is, only details bigger than 7 x "
"3.5km can be seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since April 2018 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Monitoring the concentration of carbon monoxide (CO), "
"nitrogen dioxide (NO2) and ozone (O3) in the air. Monitoring the UV aerosol "
"index (AER_AI) and various geophysical parameters of clouds (Cloud)."
msgstr ""
"Is satailít é **Sentinel-5P** a sholáthraíonn tomhais atmaisféir le húsáid "
"le haghaidh cáilíocht aeir, faireachán ózóin, radaíocht UV,\n"
"agus faireachán agus réamhaisnéis aeráide.\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil:** 7 x 3.5km (is é sin, ní fheictear ach mionsonraí is "
"mó ná 7 x 3.5km).\n"
"\n"
"**Am athchuairte:** 1 lá ar a mhéad chun an limistéar céanna a athchuairt.\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** Ó Aibreán 2018 ar aghaidh.\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Faireachán ar thiúchan monocsaíde carbóin (CO), "
"dé-ocsaíd nítrigine (NO2) agus ózóin (O3) san aer. Faireachán ar innéacs "
"aeraisil UV (AER_AI) agus paraiméadair gheoifisiceacha éagsúla de scamaill "
"(Cloud)."

msgid ""
"### Ozone (O3)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ozone is of crucial importance for the equilibrium of the Earth atmosphere. "
"In the stratosphere, the ozone layer shields the biosphere from dangerous "
"solar ultraviolet radiation. In the troposphere, it acts as an efficient "
"cleansing agent, but at high concentration it also becomes harmful to the "
"health of humans, animals, and vegetation. Ozone is also an important "
"greenhouse-gas contributor to ongoing climate change. Since the discovery "
"of the Antarctic ozone hole in the 1980s and the subsequent Montreal "
"Protocol regulating the production of chlorine-containing ozone-depleting "
"substances, ozone has been routinely monitored from the ground and from "
"space. Measurements are in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ozone-profile)"
msgstr ""
"### Ózón (O3)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tá tábhacht ríthábhachtach ag baint le hózón do chomhsheasmhacht atmaisféar "
"an Domhain. Sa strataisféar, cosnaíonn an ciseal ózóin an bithsféar ar "
"radaíocht ultrafhioláin dhainséarach na gréine. Sa troposféar, feidhmíonn "
"sé mar ghníomhaire glantacháin éifeachtach, ach ag tiúchan ard bíonn sé "
"díobhálach do shláinte daoine, ainmhithe agus plandúlachta freisin. Is "
"ranníocóir tábhachtach gáis cheaptha teasa é ózón freisin d'athrú aeráide "
"leanúnach. Ó fuarthas amach poll ózóin na hAntartaice sna 1980idí agus "
"Prótacal Montréal ina dhiaidh sin a rialaíonn táirgeadh substaintí a ídíonn "
"ózón ina bhfuil clóirín, déantar ózón a mhonatóiriú go rialta ón talamh "
"agus ón spás. Tá na tomhais i móil in aghaidh an mheadair chearnaigh (mol/ "
"m^2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ozone-profile)"

msgid ""
"### Nitrogen Dioxide (NO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Nitrogen dioxide (NO2) and nitrogen oxide (NO) together are usually "
"referred to as nitrogen oxides. They are important trace gases in the "
"Earth’s atmosphere, present in both the troposphere and the stratosphere. "
"They enter the atmosphere as a result of anthropogenic activities "
"(particularly fossil fuel combustion and biomass burning) and natural "
"processes (such as microbiological processes in soils, wildfires and "
"lightning). Measurements are in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-nitrogen-"
"dioxide)"
msgstr ""
"### Dé-ocsaíd Nítrigine (NO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Go hiondúil tugtar ocsaídí nítrigine ar dhé-ocsaíd nítrigine (NO2) agus "
"ocsaíd nítrigine (NO) le chéile. Is gáis rianaithe thábhachtacha iad in "
"atmaisféar an Domhain, atá i láthair sa troposféar agus sa strataisféar "
"araon. Isteach san atmaisféar leo mar thoradh ar ghníomhaíochtaí "
"antrapaigineacha (go háirithe dóchán breoslaí iontaise agus dó bithmhaise) "
"agus próisis nádúrtha (ar nós próisis mhiocrábheathaíocha in ithreacha, "
"tinte fiáine agus tintreach). Tá na tomhais i móil in aghaidh an mheadair "
"chearnaigh (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-nitrogen-"
"dioxide)"

msgid ""
"### Sulfur Dioxide (SO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Sulphur dioxide enters the Earth’s atmosphere through both natural and "
"anthropogenic (human made) processes. It plays a role in chemistry on a "
"local and global scale and its impact ranges from short term pollution to "
"effects on climate. Only about 30% of the emitted SO2 comes from natural "
"sources; the majority is of anthropogenic origin. Sentinel-5P/TROPOMI "
"instrument samples the Earth’s surface with a revisit time of one day with "
"a spatial resolution of 3.5 x 7 km which allows the resolution of fine "
"details including the detection of smaller SO2 plumes. Measurements are in "
"mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-sulphur-dioxide)"
msgstr ""
"### Dé-ocsaíd Shulfair (SO2)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Téann dé-ocsaíd shulfair isteach in atmaisféar an Domhain trí phróisis "
"nádúrtha agus antrapaigineacha (de dhéantús an duine) araon. Tá ról aici sa "
"cheimic ar scála áitiúil agus domhanda agus téann a tionchar ó thruailliú "
"gearrthéarmach go héifeachtaí ar an aeráid. Ní thagann ach thart ar 30% den "
"SO2 astaithe ó fhoinsí nádúrtha; is de bhunadh antrapaigineach é an chuid "
"is mó. Déanann ionstraim Sentinel-5P/TROPOMI dromchla an Domhain a "
"shampláil le ham athchuairte de lá amháin agus taifeach spásúil de 3.5 x 7 "
"km a cheadaíonn mionsonraí a réiteach lena n-áirítear brath ar phlúiseanna "
"SO2 níos lú. Tá na tomhais i móil in aghaidh an mheadair chearnaigh (mol/ "
"m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-sulphur-dioxide)"

msgid ""
"### Carbon Monoxide (CO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Carbon monoxide (CO) is an important atmospheric trace gas. In certain "
"urban areas, it is a major atmospheric pollutant. Main sources of CO are "
"combustion of fossil fuels, biomass burning, and atmospheric oxidation of "
"methane and other hydrocarbons. The carbon monoxide total column is "
"measured in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-carbon-monoxide)"
msgstr ""
"### Monocsaíd Charbóin (CO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Is gás rianaithe atmaisféarach tábhachtach é monocsaíd charbóin (CO). I "
"limistéir uirbeacha áirithe, is mór-thruailleán atmaisféarach é. Is iad "
"príomhfhoinsí CO ná dóchán breoslaí iontaise, dó bithmhaise, agus ocsaídiú "
"atmaisféarach méatáin agus hidreacarbón eile. Tomhaistear colún iomlán na "
"monocsaíde carbóin i móil in aghaidh an mheadair chearnaigh (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-carbon-monoxide)"

msgid ""
"### Formaldehyde (HCHO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Long term satellite observations of tropospheric formaldehyde (HCHO) are "
"essential to support air quality and chemistry-climate related studies from "
"the regional to the global scale. The seasonal and inter-annual variations "
"of the formaldehyde distribution are principally related to temperature "
"changes and fire events, but also to changes in anthropogenic (human-made) "
"activities. Its lifetime being of the order of a few hours, HCHO "
"concentrations in the boundary layer can be directly related to the release "
"of short-lived hydrocarbons, which mostly cannot be observed directly from "
"space. Measurements are in mol per square meter (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-formaldehyde)"
msgstr ""
"### Formaildéad (HCHO)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tá breathnuithe fadtéarmacha satailíte ar fhormaildéad troposféarach (HCHO) "
"riachtanach chun tacú le staidéir ar chaighdeán aeir agus ar cheimic-aeráid "
"ón scála réigiúnach go dtí an scála domhanda. Baineann athruithe séasúracha "
"agus idirbhliantúla ar dháileadh formaildéide go príomha le hathruithe "
"teochta agus teagmhais tine, ach freisin le hathruithe ar ghníomhaíochtaí "
"antrapaigineacha (de dhéantús an duine). Toisc go bhfuil a shaolré thart ar "
"chúpla uair an chloig, is féidir tiúchan HCHO sa chiseal teorann a cheangal "
"go díreach le scaoileadh hidreacarbón gearrshaolach, nach féidir a "
"bhformhór a bhreathnú go díreach ón spás. Tá na tomhais i móil in aghaidh "
"an mheadair chearnaigh (mol/ m^2).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-formaldehyde)"

msgid ""
"### Methane (CH4)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Methane is, after carbon dioxide, the most important contributor to the "
"anthropogenically (caused by human activity) enhanced greenhouse effect. "
"Measurements are provided in parts per billion (ppb) with a spatial "
"resolution of 7 km x 3.5 km.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/tropomi-level-2-methane)"
msgstr ""
"### Méatan (CH4)\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Is é méatan, tar éis dé-ocsaíde carbóin, an ranníocóir is tábhachtaí leis "
"an éifeacht cheaptha teasa fheabhsaithe go hantrapaigineach (de bharr "
"gníomhaíochta an duine). Soláthraítear tomhais i gcodanna in aghaidh an "
"bhilliúin (ppb) le taifeach spásúil de 7 km x 3.5 km.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/tropomi-level-2-methane)"

msgid ""
"### Aerosol Index\n"
"\n"
"The Aerosol Index (AI) is a qualitative index indicating the presence of "
"elevated layers of aerosols in the atmosphere. It can be used to detect the "
"presence of UV absorbing aerosols such as desert dust and volcanic ash "
"plumes. Positive values (from light blue to red) indicate the presence of "
"UV-absorbing aerosol. This index is calculated for two pairs of "
"wavelengths: 340/380 nm and 354/388 nm.\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ultraviolet-"
"aerosol-index)"
msgstr ""
"### Innéacs Aeraisil\n"
"\n"
"Is innéacs cáilíochtúil é an tInnéacs Aeraisil (AI) a léiríonn láithreacht "
"sraitheanna ardaithe aeraisil san atmaisféar. Is féidir é a úsáid chun "
"láithreacht aeraisil a ionsúíonn UV a bhrath, amhail deannach fásaigh agus "
"plúiseanna luaithreach bolcánach. Léiríonn luachanna dearfacha (ó ghorm "
"éadrom go dearg) láithreacht aeraisil a ionsúíonn UV. Ríomhtar an t-innéacs "
"seo do dhá phéire tonnfhad: 340/380 nm agus 354/388 nm.\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo.](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-ultraviolet-"
"aerosol-index)"

msgid ""
"### Cloud\n"
"\n"
"The TROPOMI instrument, single payload onboard Sentinel-5 Precursor, "
"retrieves operationally the most important quantities for cloud correction "
"of satellite trace gas retrievals: cloud fraction, cloud optical thickness "
"(albedo), and cloud-top pressure (height). Cloud parameters from TROPOMI "
"are not only used for enhancing the accuracy of trace gas retrievals, but "
"also to extend the satellite data record of cloud information.\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-cloud)."
msgstr ""
"### Scamall\n"
"\n"
"Aisghabhann ionstraim TROPOMI, an t-aon phálasta ar bord Sentinel-5 "
"Precursor, go hoibríochtúil na cainníochtaí is tábhachtaí le haghaidh "
"ceartú scamall d'aisghabhálacha gáis rianaithe satailíte: codán scamall, "
"tiús optúil scamall (albedo), agus brú barr scamaill (airde). Ní úsáidtear "
"paraiméadair scamall ó TROPOMI chun cruinneas aisghabhálacha gáis rianaithe "
"a fheabhsú amháin, ach chun taifead sonraí satailíte faisnéise scamall a "
"leathnú freisin.\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/web/sentinel/data-products/-/asset_"
"publisher/fp37fc19FN8F/content/sentinel-5-precursor-level-2-cloud)."

msgid ""
"**Sentinel-3** mission's main objective is to measure the sea surface "
"topography, the sea and land surface temperature, and the colour of the "
"ocean and land surface. To achieve this goal, Sentinel-3 has a combination "
"of different instruments on board. The most important instruments are the "
"Ocean and Land Colour Instrument (OLCI), the SAR Radar Altimeter (SRAL) and "
"the Sea and Land Surface Temperature Radiometer (SLSTR).\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2016 onwards."
msgstr ""
"Is é príomhchuspóir mhisean **Sentinel-3** topagrafaíocht dhromchla na "
"farraige, teocht dhromchla na farraige agus na talún, agus dath dhromchla "
"an aigéin agus na talún a thomhas. Chun an sprioc seo a bhaint amach, tá "
"meascán d'ionstraimí éagsúla ar bord Sentinel-3. Is iad na hionstraimí is "
"tábhachtaí ná an Ionstraim Datha Aigéin agus Talún (OLCI), an tAltaiméadar "
"Radair SAR (SRAL) agus an Raidiméadar Teochta Dromchla Farraige agus Talún "
"(SLSTR).\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** Ó Bhealtaine 2016 ar aghaidh."

msgid ""
"The **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** instrument on board "
"Sentinel-3 measures the global and regional sea and land surface \n"
"temperature. The SLSTR covers the visible, shortwave infrared, and thermal "
"infrared wavelengths of the electromagnetic spectrum. \n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 500m for visible, near- and shortwave infrared "
"wavelengths and 1km for thermal infrared (that is, only details \n"
"bigger than 500m and 1km can be seen, respectively).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2016 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Climate change monitoring, vegetation monitoring, active "
"fire detection, land and sea surface temperature monitoring."
msgstr ""
"Tomhaiseann an ionstraim **Teocht Dromchla Farraige agus Talún (SLSTR)** ar "
"bord Sentinel-3 teocht dhromchla na farraige agus na talún go domhanda agus "
"go réigiúnach. Clúdaíonn an SLSTR tonnfhaid infheicthe, infridhearga "
"gearrthonnacha, agus infridhearga teirmeacha den speictream "
"leictreamaighnéadach. \n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil:** 500m do thonnfhaid infheicthe, gar-infridhearga agus "
"infridhearga gearrthonnacha agus 1km d'infridhearg teirmeach (is é sin, ní "
"fheictear ach mionsonraí \n"
"is mó ná 500m agus 1km, faoi seach).\n"
"\n"
"**Am athchuairte:** 1 lá ar a mhéad chun an limistéar céanna a athchuairt, "
"ag úsáid an dá shatailít.\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** Ó Bhealtaine 2016 ar aghaidh.\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Faireachán ar athrú aeráide, faireachán plandúlachta, "
"brath tine ghníomhaí, faireachán ar theocht dhromchla na talún agus na "
"farraige."

msgid ""
"The **Ocean and Land Colour Instrument (OLCI)** on board Sentinel-3 is a "
"spectrometer that \n"
"measures the solar radiation reflected by Earth, and it monitors the ocean, "
"the environment, \n"
"and climate. It provides more frequent visible imagery than Sentinel-2 but "
"at a lower resolution\n"
"and with more wavelengths covered. The Sentinel-3 OLCI instrument continues "
"the measurements previously performed by the MERIS instrument on board "
"Envisat, whose mission concluded.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 300m (that is, only details bigger than 300m can be "
"seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 2 days to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2016 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Surface topography, ocean and land surface colour "
"observations and monitoring."
msgstr ""
"Is speictriméadar é an **Ionstraim Datha Aigéin agus Talún (OLCI)** ar bord "
"Sentinel-3 a \n"
"tomhaiseann an radaíocht ghréine a fhrithchaitheann an Domhan, agus déanann "
"sé faireachán ar an aigéan, ar an gcomhshaol, \n"
"agus ar an aeráid. Soláthraíonn sé íomhánna infheicthe níos minice ná "
"Sentinel-2 ach ag taifeach níos ísle\n"
"agus le níos mó tonnfhad clúdaithe. Leanann ionstraim OLCI Sentinel-3 leis "
"na tomhais a rinne an ionstraim MERIS ar bord Envisat roimhe seo, a bhfuil "
"a misean críochnaithe.\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil:** 300m (is é sin, ní fheictear ach mionsonraí is mó ná "
"300m).\n"
"\n"
"**Am athchuairte:** 2 lá ar a mhéad chun an limistéar céanna a athchuairt, "
"ag úsáid an dá shatailít.\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** Ó Bhealtaine 2016 ar aghaidh.\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Topagrafaíocht dromchla, breathnuithe agus faireachán "
"ar dhath dhromchla an aigéin agus na talún."

msgid ""
"**The Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** is a combination of the OLCI and SLSTR "
"acquisitions with original objective to provide surface vegetation "
"products. [The Level-2 "
"SYN](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products) product provides "
"surface reflectances for all SYN channels and aerosol parameters over land.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution**: 300 m  \n"
"\n"
"**Temporal resolution**: < 2 days  \n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: Global since October 2018  \n"
"\n"
"**Common usage**: Land Monitoring and Security, Climate Change Monitoring"
msgstr ""
"Is meascán de ghabhálacha OLCI agus SLSTR é **Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** a bhfuil "
"mar chuspóir bunaidh aige táirgí plandúlachta dromchla a sholáthar. "
"Soláthraíonn táirge [Leibhéal-2 "
"SYN](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products) "
"frithchaitheachtaí dromchla do gach cainéal SYN agus paraiméadair aeraisil "
"thar talamh.\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil**: 300 m  \n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach ama**: < 2 lá  \n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: Domhanda ó Dheireadh Fómhair 2018  \n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta**: Faireachán agus Slándáil Talún, Faireachán ar Athrú "
"Aeráide"

msgid ""
"**The Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** is a combination of the OLCI and SLSTR "
"acquisitions with original objective to provide surface vegetation "
"products. [The Level-2 "
"VG1](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products) product "
"contains 1 km VEGETATION-like product, 1 day synthesis surface reflectances "
"and NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Temporal resolution**: Daily\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: Global since October 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage**: Land Monitoring and Security, Climate Change Monitoring"
msgstr ""
"Is meascán de ghabhálacha OLCI agus SLSTR é **Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** a bhfuil "
"mar chuspóir bunaidh aige táirgí plandúlachta dromchla a sholáthar. Tá "
"táirge VEGETATION-chosúil 1 km, frithchaitheachtaí dromchla sintéise 1 lae "
"agus NDVI i dtáirge [Leibhéal-2 "
"VG1](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products).\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach ama**: Laethúil\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: Domhanda ó Dheireadh Fómhair 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta**: Faireachán agus Slándáil Talún, Faireachán ar Athrú "
"Aeráide"

msgid ""
"**The Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** is a combination of the OLCI and SLSTR "
"acquisitions with original objective to provide surface vegetation "
"products. [The Level-2 "
"V10](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products) product "
"contains 1 km VEGETATION-like product, 10 day synthesis surface "
"reflectances and NDVI.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Temporal resolution**: 10-days composite\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: Global since October 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage**: Land Monitoring and Security, Climate Change Monitoring"
msgstr ""
"Is meascán de ghabhálacha OLCI agus SLSTR é **Sentinel-3 SYNERGY** a bhfuil "
"mar chuspóir bunaidh aige táirgí plandúlachta dromchla a sholáthar. Tá "
"táirge VEGETATION-chosúil 1 km, frithchaitheachtaí dromchla sintéise 10 lá "
"agus NDVI i dtáirge [Leibhéal-2 "
"V10](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/synergy-products#SYNERGYProducts-L2"
"VG1andV10ProductsS3-Synergy-Products-L2-VG1-and-V10-Products).\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil**: 1 km\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach ama**: Comhshuíomh 10 lá\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: Domhanda ó Dheireadh Fómhair 2018\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta**: Faireachán agus Slándáil Talún, Faireachán ar Athrú "
"Aeráide"

msgid ""
"The **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** instrument on board "
"Sentinel-3 measures the global and regional sea and land surface "
"temperature. The SLSTR L2 Land Surface Temperature (LST) product provides "
"land surface temperature retrieved from the thermal infrared channels.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 1km (that is, only details bigger than 1km can be "
"seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2018 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Climate change monitoring, land surface temperature "
"monitoring, drought monitoring, urban heat island studies."
msgstr ""
"Tomhaiseann an ionstraim **Teocht Dromchla Farraige agus Talún (SLSTR)** ar "
"bord Sentinel-3 teocht dhromchla na farraige agus na talún go domhanda agus "
"go réigiúnach. Soláthraíonn táirge Teocht Dromchla Talún (LST) SLSTR L2 "
"teocht dhromchla na talún a aisghabhadh ó na cainéil infridhearga "
"teirmeacha.\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil:** 1km (is é sin, ní fheictear ach mionsonraí is mó ná "
"1km).\n"
"\n"
"**Am athchuairte:** 1 lá ar a mhéad chun an limistéar céanna a athchuairt, "
"ag úsáid an dá shatailít.\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** Ó Bhealtaine 2018 ar aghaidh.\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Faireachán ar athrú aeráide, faireachán ar theocht "
"dhromchla na talún, faireachán triomaigh, staidéir ar oileáin teasa "
"uirbeacha."

msgid ""
"**Sentinel-2** provides high-resolution images in the visible and infrared "
"wavelengths, to monitor vegetation, soil and water cover, inland waterways "
"and coastal areas.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 10m, 20m, and 60m, depending on the wavelength "
"(that is, only details bigger than 10m, 20m, and 60m can be seen). More "
"info "
"[here](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/user-guides/sentinel-2-msi/"
"resolutions/spatial). \n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** maximum 5 days to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since June 2015. Full global coverage since March "
"2017.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Land-cover maps, land-change detection maps, vegetation "
"monitoring, monitoring of burnt areas."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn **Sentinel-2** íomhánna ard-taifigh sna tonnfhaid infheicthe "
"agus infridhearga, chun faireachán a dhéanamh ar phlandúlacht, ithir agus "
"clúdach uisce, uiscebhealaí intíre agus limistéir chósta.\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil:** 10m, 20m, agus 60m, ag brath ar an tonnfhad (is é "
"sin, ní fheictear ach mionsonraí is mó ná 10m, 20m, agus 60m). Tuilleadh "
"eolais "
"[anseo](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/user-guides/sentinel-2-msi/"
"resolutions/spatial). \n"
"\n"
"**Am athchuairte:** 5 lá ar a mhéad chun an limistéar céanna a athchuairt, "
"ag úsáid an dá shatailít.\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** Ó Mheitheamh 2015. Clúdach domhanda iomlán ó "
"Mhárta 2017.\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Léarscáileanna clúdaigh talún, léarscáileanna braite "
"athraithe talún, faireachán plandúlachta, faireachán ar limistéir dhóite."

msgid ""
"Level 2A data are high quality data where the effects of the atmosphere on "
"the light being reflected off of the surface of the Earth and reaching the "
"sensor are excluded. Data are available globally since March 2017.\n"
"\n"
"More info about atmospheric correction "
"[here](https://www.sentinel-hub.com/develop/api/ogc/custom-parameters/"
"atmospheric-correction/)."
msgstr ""
"Is sonraí ardchaighdeáin iad sonraí Leibhéal 2A ina mbaintear amach "
"éifeachtaí an atmaisféir ar an solas a fhrithchaitear de dhromchla an "
"Domhain agus a shroicheann an braiteoir. Tá na sonraí ar fáil go domhanda ó "
"Mhárta 2017.\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais faoi cheartú atmaisféarach "
"[anseo](https://www.sentinel-hub.com/develop/api/ogc/custom-parameters/"
"atmospheric-correction/)."

msgid ""
"Level 1C data are data of sufficient quality for most investigations, where "
"all image corrections were done except for the atmospheric correction. Data "
"are available globally since June 2015 onwards."
msgstr ""
"Is sonraí iad sonraí Leibhéal 1C atá de chaighdeán leordhóthanach don chuid "
"is mó d'imscrúduithe, inar rinneadh gach ceartú íomhá ach amháin an ceartú "
"atmaisféarach. Tá na sonraí ar fáil go domhanda ó Mheitheamh 2015 ar "
"aghaidh."

msgid ""
"**Sentinel-1** provides all-weather, day and night radar imagery for land "
"and ocean services. EO\n"
"Browser provides data acquired in Interferometric Wide Swath (IW) and Extra "
"Wide Swath (EW) modes\n"
"processed to Level-1 Ground Range Detected (GRD).\n"
"\n"
"**Pixel spacing:** 10m (IW), 40m (EW).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** <= 5 days using both satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time** (for asc/desc and overlap using both satellites): <= 3 "
"days, see [observation "
"scenario](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/missions/sentinel-1/"
"observation-scenario)\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since October 2014.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Maritime and land monitoring, emergency response, climate "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn **Sentinel-1** íomhánna radair gach aimsir, de lá agus d'oíche "
"do sheirbhísí talún agus aigéin. Soláthraíonn EO\n"
"Browser sonraí a gabhadh i modhanna Interferometric Wide Swath (IW) agus "
"Extra Wide Swath (EW)\n"
"próiseáilte go Leibhéal-1 Ground Range Detected (GRD).\n"
"\n"
"**Spásáil picteilíní:** 10m (IW), 40m (EW).\n"
"\n"
"**Am athchuairte:** <= 5 lá ag úsáid an dá shatailít.\n"
"\n"
"**Am athchuairte** (le haghaidh asc/desc agus forluí ag úsáid an dá "
"shatailít): <= 3 lá, féach [cás "
"breathnóireachta](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/missions/sentinel-1/"
"observation-scenario)\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** Ó Dheireadh Fómhair 2014.\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Faireachán muirí agus talún, freagairt éigeandála, "
"athrú aeráide."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics** is a monthly composite obtained by "
"computing the local resolution weighted average of radiometrically and "
"geometrically terrain corrected input scenes. Due to the use of all "
"available data in a month, it contains less speckle (temporal average) and "
"the best possible local resolution (combination of ascending and descending "
"orbits).\n"
"\n"
"The input for the Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics are scenes with DH "
"polarization and can come from all acquisition modes.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Primarily polar and near-polar areas, as well as "
"ocean-relevant areas\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"The data for each month is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding month (e.g. 1.1. or 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** ~40 meters."
msgstr ""
"Is comhshuíomh míosúil é **Mósáicí Míosúla DH Sentinel-1** a fhaightear trí "
"mheán ualaithe taifigh áitiúil a ríomh de radharcanna ionchuir arna gceartú "
"go raidiméadrach agus go geoiméadrach do thír-raon. Toisc go n-úsáidtear na "
"sonraí go léir atá ar fáil i mí, tá níos lú breacáin ann (meán ama) agus an "
"taifeach áitiúil is fearr is féidir (meascán d'orbit ardaitheach agus "
"íslitheach).\n"
"\n"
"Is radharcanna le polarúchán DH atá mar ionchur do Mhósáicí Míosúla DH "
"Sentinel-1 agus is féidir leo teacht ó gach mód gabhála.\n"
"\n"
"**Clúdach:** Go príomha limistéir pholacha agus gar-pholacha, chomh maith "
"le limistéir a bhfuil baint acu leis an aigéan\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Tá na sonraí do gach mí ar fáil sa chatalóg ar 1ú lá na míosa comhfhreagraí "
"(m.sh. 1.1. nó 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach Spásúil:** ~40 méadar."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics** is a monthly composite obtained by "
"computing the local resolution weighted average of radiometrically and "
"geometrically terrain corrected input scenes. Due to the use of all "
"available data in a month, it contains less speckle (temporal average) and "
"the best possible local resolution (combination of ascending and descending "
"orbits).\n"
"\n"
"The input for the Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics are scenes taken in the IW "
"acquisition mode with DV polarization.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Over land and coastal areas (mainly between 80°N and 56°S)\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"The data for each month is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding month (e.g. 1.1. or 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** ~20 meters."
msgstr ""
"Is comhshuíomh míosúil é **Mósáicí Míosúla IW Sentinel-1** a fhaightear trí "
"mheán ualaithe taifigh áitiúil a ríomh de radharcanna ionchuir arna gceartú "
"go raidiméadrach agus go geoiméadrach do thír-raon. Toisc go n-úsáidtear na "
"sonraí go léir atá ar fáil i mí, tá níos lú breacáin ann (meán ama) agus an "
"taifeach áitiúil is fearr is féidir (meascán d'orbit ardaitheach agus "
"íslitheach).\n"
"\n"
"Is radharcanna a tógadh sa mhód gabhála IW le polarúchán DV atá mar ionchur "
"do Mhósáicí Míosúla IW Sentinel-1.\n"
"\n"
"**Clúdach:** Thar talamh agus limistéir chósta (go príomha idir 80°N agus "
"56°S)\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Tá na sonraí do gach mí ar fáil sa chatalóg ar 1ú lá na míosa comhfhreagraí "
"(m.sh. 1.1. nó 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach Spásúil:** ~20 méadar."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **WorldCover Annual Cloudless Mosaics** product offers an almost "
"cloud-free image over the entire globe, created by stitching together the "
"cloudless Sentinel-2 images acquired over a one-year period at a spatial "
"resolution of 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"More information can be found "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/SentinelMissions/"
"Sentinel2.html#sentinel-2-level-2a-worldcover-annual-cloudless-mosaic-"
"rgbnir).\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Global Coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Data for each year is available in the catalog on the 1.1. of the "
"corresponding year.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Creating Basemaps, Land cover classification, "
"Infrastructure/Land use planning, Environmental monitoring, Water resource "
"management and more."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge **Mósáicí Neamhscamallacha Bliantúla WorldCover** íomhá "
"beagnach saor ó scamaill thar an domhan go léir, a cruthaíodh trí íomhánna "
"neamhscamallacha Sentinel-2 a gabhadh thar thréimhse bliana a fhuáil le "
"chéile ag taifeach spásúil de 10 méadar.\n"
"\n"
"Gheofar tuilleadh faisnéise "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data/SentinelMissions/"
"Sentinel2.html#sentinel-2-level-2a-worldcover-annual-cloudless-mosaic-"
"rgbnir).\n"
"\n"
"**Clúdach:** Clúdach Domhanda.\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Tá sonraí do gach bliain ar fáil sa chatalóg ar an 1.1. den bhliain "
"chomhfhreagrach.\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach Spásúil:** 10 méadar.\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Bunmhapaí a chruthú, aicmiú clúdaigh talún, pleanáil "
"bonneagair/úsáide talún, faireachán comhshaoil, bainistiú acmhainní uisce "
"agus níos mó."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-2 Quarterly Mosaics** product offers an almost cloud-free "
"image over the entire globe, created by stitching together the cloudless "
"Sentinel-2 images acquired over a quarterly period (every 3 months) at a "
"spatial resolution of 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Global Coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Data for each quarter is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding quarter (e.g. 1.1. or 1.4.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Creating Basemaps, Land cover classification, "
"Infrastructure/Land use planning, Environmental monitoring, Water resource "
"management and more."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge **Mósáicí Ráithiúla Sentinel-2** íomhá beagnach saor ó "
"scamaill thar an domhan go léir, a cruthaíodh trí íomhánna neamhscamallacha "
"Sentinel-2 a gabhadh thar thréimhse ráithiúil (gach 3 mhí) a fhuáil le "
"chéile ag taifeach spásúil de 10 méadar.\n"
"\n"
"**Clúdach:** Clúdach Domhanda.\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Tá sonraí do gach ráithe ar fáil sa chatalóg ar 1ú lá na ráithe "
"comhfhreagraí (m.sh. 1.1. nó 1.4.).\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach Spásúil:** 10 méadar.\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Bunmhapaí a chruthú, aicmiú clúdaigh talún, pleanáil "
"bonneagair/úsáide talún, faireachán comhshaoil, bainistiú acmhainní uisce "
"agus níos mó."

msgid "General complementary data information."
msgstr "Faisnéis ghinearálta sonraí comhlántacha."

msgid ""
"The **Landsat 8-9** collection contains imagery from the two most recently "
"launched Landsat satellites (Landsat 8 and Landsat 9, provided by "
"NASA/USGS). Both carry the Operational Land Imager (OLI) and the Thermal "
"Infrared Sensor (TIRS), with 9 optical and 2 thermal bands. These two "
"sensors provide seasonal coverage of the global landmass.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 15 m for the panchromatic band and 30 m for the "
"rest (the thermal bands are re-sampled from 100 m).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** 16 days\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since January 2021\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Vegetation monitoring, land use, land cover maps, change "
"monitoring, etc.\n"
"\n"
"**Level-1** data (from **Landsat Collection 2**) provides global top of the "
"atmosphere reflectance and top of the atmosphere brightness temperature "
"products. \n"
"  \n"
"The data underwent several processing steps including geometric and "
"radiometric improvements. \n"
"  \n"
"More info about Level-1 data "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/SentinelHub/Data/"
"Landsat8-9.html)."
msgstr ""
"Tá íomhánna sa bhailiúchán **Landsat 8-9** ón dá shatailít Landsat is "
"déanaí a lainseáladh (Landsat 8 agus Landsat 9, arna soláthar ag "
"NASA/USGS). Iompraíonn an bheirt acu an Ionstraim Íomhánna Oibríochtúil "
"Talún (OLI) agus an Braiteoir Infridhearg Teirmeach (TIRS), le 9 mbanda "
"optúla agus 2 bhanda teirmeacha. Soláthraíonn an dá bhraiteoir seo clúdach "
"séasúrach ar mhais talún an domhain.\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil:** 15 m don bhanda pancrómatach agus 30 m don chuid eile "
"(athsamplaítear na bandaí teirmeacha ó 100 m).\n"
"\n"
"**Am athchuairte:** 16 lá\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí:** Ó Eanáir 2021\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Faireachán plandúlachta, úsáid talún, léarscáileanna "
"clúdaigh talún, faireachán athraithe, etc.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraíonn sonraí **Leibhéal-1** (ó **Landsat Collection 2**) táirgí "
"frithchaitheachta barr an atmaisféir agus teochta gile barr an atmaisféir "
"domhanda. \n"
"  \n"
"Chuaigh na sonraí trí roinnt céimeanna próiseála lena n-áirítear "
"feabhsúcháin gheoiméadracha agus raidiméadracha. \n"
"  \n"
"Tuilleadh eolais faoi shonraí Leibhéal-1 "
"[anseo](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/SentinelHub/Data/"
"Landsat8-9.html)."

msgid ""
"Global, cloud-free, and reconstructed historical Landsat spectral bands are "
"provided at a spatial resolution of 30 meters and temporal resolution of "
"bimonthly intervals from 1997 onwards. The dataset was generated using the "
"GLAD Landsat ARD version 2 as the primary input for temporal aggregation "
"and the imputation of missing values."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraítear bandaí speictreacha Landsat stairiúla domhanda, saor ó "
"scamaill, athchruthaithe ag taifeach spásúil de 30 méadar agus taifeach ama "
"d'eatraimh dhémhíosúla ó 1997 ar aghaidh. Gineadh an tacar sonraí ag baint "
"úsáide as GLAD Landsat ARD leagan 2 mar phríomh-ionchur le haghaidh "
"comhiomlánú ama agus luachanna ar iarraidh a líonadh isteach."

msgid ""
"A **DEM** (Digital Elevation Model) is a digital representation of a "
"terrain (usually Earth's surface). It is obtained by dividing the whole "
"globe into grid cells, each holding a corresponding altitude value in "
"meters. Depending on the gride cell size, a DEM can be more detailed (high "
"resolution) or less detailed (low resolution). Sentinel Hub DEM data "
"collections are static (independent of date) and globally available.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Modelling water flows, orthorectification of Sentinel-1 "
"imagery and engineering."
msgstr ""
"Léiriú digiteach de thír-raon (dromchla an Domhain de ghnáth) is ea **DEM** "
"(Samhail Digiteach Airde). Faightear é trí an domhan go léir a roinnt ina "
"chealla eangaí, agus luach airde comhfhreagrach i méadair i ngach ceann "
"acu. Ag brath ar mhéid an chille eangaí, is féidir le DEM a bheith níos "
"mionsonraithe (ard-taifeach) nó níos lú mionsonraithe (taifeach íseal). Is "
"bailiúcháin statacha (neamhspleách ar dháta) agus ar fáil go domhanda iad "
"bailiúcháin sonraí DEM Sentinel Hub.\n"
"\n"
"**Úsáid choitianta:** Samhaltú sreabhadh uisce, ortho-cheartú íomhánna "
"Sentinel-1 agus innealtóireacht."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Copernicus DEM** represents the surface of the Earth including "
"buildings, infrastructure and vegetation. Similar to the Mapzen DEM, it is "
"based on a combination of different DEMs (basis "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/)). It is a static collection "
"(independent of date) with global coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 30 m infilled with 90 m (where 30 m tiles are not "
"released).\n"
"\n"
"Credits: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn **Copernicus DEM** dromchla an Domhain lena n-áirítear foirgnimh, "
"bonneagar agus plandúlacht. Cosúil leis an Mapzen DEM, tá sé bunaithe ar "
"mheascán de DEManna éagsúla (bonn "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/)). Is bailiúchán statach é "
"(neamhspleách ar dháta) le clúdach domhanda.\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil:** 30 m líonta le 90 m (nuair nach bhfuil tíleanna 30 m "
"eisithe).\n"
"\n"
"Creidmheasanna: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Copernicus DEM** represents the surface of the Earth including "
"buildings, infrastructure and vegetation. Similar to the Mapzen DEM, it is "
"based on a combination of different DEMs (basis "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/)). It is a static collection "
"(independent of date) with global coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 90 m\n"
"\n"
"Credits: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn **Copernicus DEM** dromchla an Domhain lena n-áirítear foirgnimh, "
"bonneagar agus plandúlacht. Cosúil leis an Mapzen DEM, tá sé bunaithe ar "
"mheascán de DEManna éagsúla (bonn "
"[WorldDEMTM](https://www.geospatialworld.net/article/worlddemtm-new-"
"standard-of-global-elevation-models/)). Is bailiúchán statach é "
"(neamhspleách ar dháta) le clúdach domhanda.\n"
"\n"
"**Taifeach spásúil:** 90 m\n"
"\n"
"Creidmheasanna: [ESA](${ COPERNICUS_CREDITS_URL })"

msgid "Credits:"
msgstr "Aitheantais:"

msgid ""
"Geographical information on land cover and its changes, land use, ground "
"motion, vegetation state, water cycle and earth surface energy variables "
"for both Europe and the entire globe. Visit the [CLMS "
"website](https://land.copernicus.eu/en) for more information."
msgstr ""
"Faisnéis gheografach ar chlúdach talún agus a athruithe, úsáid talún, "
"gluaiseacht talún, staid plandúlachta, timthriall uisce agus athraitheacha "
"fuinnimh dhromchla an domhain don Eoraip agus don domhan go léir. Tabhair "
"cuairt ar [shuíomh gréasáin CLMS](https://land.copernicus.eu/en) chun "
"tuilleadh eolais a fháil."

msgid ""
"Provides at global level spatial information on different types (classes) "
"of physical coverage of the Earth's surface, e.g. forests, grasslands, "
"croplands, lakes, wetlands for the 2019 base year. The data are updated "
"annually and are available for the 2015-2019 years. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé ar leibhéal domhanda faisnéis spásúil ar chineálacha "
"(ranganna) éagsúla clúdaigh fhisiciúil de dhromchla an Domhain, m.sh. "
"foraoisí, féarthailte, talamh curaíochta, locha, riasca don bhunbhliain "
"2019. Déantar na sonraí a nuashonrú go bliantúil agus tá siad ar fáil do na "
"blianta 2015-2019. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover)."

msgid ""
"Provides a statistical overview of the land surface temperature over each "
"10-day compositing period regardless of any specific hour and every "
"geostationary sensor image pixel. The data are available at global scale in "
"the spatial resolution of about 5 km and covers the period from January "
"2017 to January 2021. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"-daily-land-surface-temperature-thermal-condition-index-global-v1-0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé forbhreathnú staidrimh ar theocht dhromchla na talún thar "
"gach tréimhse comhshuite 10 lá beag beann ar uair ar leith agus gach "
"picteilín d'íomhá braiteora gheosheasta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ar scála "
"domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de thart ar 5 km agus clúdaíonn siad an "
"tréimhse ó Eanáir 2017 go hEanáir 2021. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/1"
"0-daily-land-surface-temperature-thermal-condition-index-global-v1-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides a statistical overview of the land surface temperature daily cycle "
"for each 10-day compositing period and every geostationary sensor image "
"pixel. The data are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of "
"about 5 km and covers the period from January 2017 to January 2021. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"-daily-land-surface-temperature-daily-cycle-global-v1-0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé forbhreathnú staidrimh ar thimthriall laethúil teochta "
"dhromchla na talún do gach tréimhse comhshuite 10 lá agus gach picteilín "
"d'íomhá braiteora gheosheasta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag "
"taifeach spásúil de thart ar 5 km agus clúdaíonn siad an tréimhse ó Eanáir "
"2017 go hEanáir 2021. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/1"
"0-daily-land-surface-temperature-daily-cycle-global-v1-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides hourly land surface temperature from geostationary sensors "
"observations. The data are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of about 5 km and covers the period from July 2010 to January "
"2021. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"hourly-land-surface-temperature-global-v1-0-5km). \n"
"\n"
"*Please note that under default settings, the dataset displayed for each "
"day is the latest image available, which typically reflects the data "
"captured up to midnight. To access data from a specific hour, use the "
"\"Date: time range\" mode."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé teocht dhromchla na talún in aghaidh na huaire ó "
"bhreathnuithe braiteoirí geosheasta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ar scála domhanda "
"ag taifeach spásúil de thart ar 5 km agus clúdaíonn siad an tréimhse ó Iúil "
"2010 go hEanáir 2021. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"hourly-land-surface-temperature-global-v1-0-5km). \n"
"\n"
"*Tabhair faoi deara de réir na socruithe réamhshocraithe gurb é an tacar "
"sonraí a thaispeántar do gach lá an íomhá is déanaí atá ar fáil, a léiríonn "
"de ghnáth na sonraí a gabhadh suas go meán oíche. Chun rochtain a fháil ar "
"shonraí ó uair ar leith, úsáid an mód \"Dáta: raon ama\"."

msgid ""
"Provides a statistical overview of the land surface temperature over each "
"10-day compositing period regardless of any specific hour and every "
"geostationary sensor image pixel. The data are available at global scale in "
"the spatial resolution of about 5 km and covers the period from January "
"2021 to January 2023 with version 2.0 and from January 2023 to 2026 with "
"version 2.1. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"-daily-land-surface-temperature-thermal-condition-index-global-v2-0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé forbhreathnú staidrimh ar theocht dhromchla na talún thar "
"gach tréimhse comhshuite 10 lá beag beann ar uair ar leith agus gach "
"picteilín d'íomhá braiteora gheosheasta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ar scála "
"domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de thart ar 5 km agus clúdaíonn siad an "
"tréimhse ó Eanáir 2021 go hEanáir 2023 le leagan 2.0 agus ó Eanáir 2023 go "
"2026 le leagan 2.1. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/1"
"0-daily-land-surface-temperature-thermal-condition-index-global-v2-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides hourly land surface temperature from geostationary sensors "
"observations. The data are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of about 5 km and covers the period from January 2021 to January "
"2023 with version 2.0 and from January 2023 to 2026 with version 2.1. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"hourly-land-surface-temperature-global-v2-0-5km). \n"
"\n"
"*Please note that under default settings, the dataset displayed for each "
"day is the latest image available, which typically reflects the data "
"captured up to midnight. To access data from a specific hour, use the "
"\"Date: time range\" mode."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé teocht dhromchla na talún in aghaidh na huaire ó "
"bhreathnuithe braiteoirí geosheasta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ar scála domhanda "
"ag taifeach spásúil de thart ar 5 km agus clúdaíonn siad an tréimhse ó "
"Eanáir 2021 go hEanáir 2023 le leagan 2.0 agus ó Eanáir 2023 go 2026 le "
"leagan 2.1. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"hourly-land-surface-temperature-global-v2-0-5km). \n"
"\n"
"*Tabhair faoi deara de réir na socruithe réamhshocraithe gurb é an tacar "
"sonraí a thaispeántar do gach lá an íomhá is déanaí atá ar fáil, a léiríonn "
"de ghnáth na sonraí a gabhadh suas go meán oíche. Chun rochtain a fháil ar "
"shonraí ó uair ar leith, úsáid an mód \"Dáta: raon ama\"."

msgid ""
"Provides a statistical overview of the land surface temperature daily cycle "
"for each 10-day compositing period and every geostationary sensor image "
"pixel. The data are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of "
"about 5 km and covers the period from January 2021 to January 2023 with "
"version 2.0 and from January 2023 to 2026 with version 2.1. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"-daily-land-surface-temperature-daily-cycle-global-v2-0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé forbhreathnú staidrimh ar thimthriall laethúil teochta "
"dhromchla na talún do gach tréimhse comhshuite 10 lá agus gach picteilín "
"d'íomhá braiteora gheosheasta. Tá na sonraí ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag "
"taifeach spásúil de thart ar 5 km agus clúdaíonn siad an tréimhse ó Eanáir "
"2021 go hEanáir 2023 le leagan 2.0 agus ó Eanáir 2023 go 2026 le leagan "
"2.1. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/1"
"0-daily-land-surface-temperature-daily-cycle-global-v2-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the fraction of the solar radiation absorbed by live plants for "
"photosynthesis. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale in "
"the spatial resolution of about 1 km covering the period from 1999 to June "
"2020 from SPOT/VEGETATION and PROBA-V data. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Cainníonn sé an codán den radaíocht ghréine a ionsúnn plandaí beo le "
"haghaidh fótasintéise. Tá meastacháin gach 10 lá ar fáil ar scála domhanda "
"ag taifeach spásúil de thart ar 1 km a chlúdaíonn an tréimhse ó 1999 go "
"Meitheamh 2020 ó shonraí SPOT/VEGETATION agus PROBA-V. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-1km)."

msgid ""
