msgid ""
"Defined as half the total area of green elements of the canopy per unit "
"horizontal ground area. Every 10-days estimates are available at global "
"scale in the spatial resolution of about 1 km covering the period from 1999 "
"to June 2020 from SPOT/VEGETATION and PROBA-V data. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2-"
"0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhínítear é mar leath de achar iomlán eilimintí glasa an chanbhaisín in "
"aghaidh an aonaid achair talún chothrománaigh. Tá meastacháin gach 10 lá ar "
"fáil ar scála domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de thart ar 1 km a chlúdaíonn an "
"tréimhse ó 1999 go Meitheamh 2020 ó shonraí SPOT/VEGETATION agus PROBA-V. "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2"
"-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Represents the overall growth rate or dry biomass increase of the "
"vegetation and is directly related to ecosystem Net Primary Production "
"(NPP), however with units customized for agro-statistical purposes "
"(kg/ha/day). Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale in the "
"spatial resolution of about 1km and with the temporal extent from 1999 to "
"June 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn sé ráta iomlán fáis nó méadú bithmhaise tirim na plandúlachta agus "
"tá baint dhíreach aige le Táirgeacht Phríomhúil Ghlan (NPP) an "
"éiceachórais, ach le haonaid saincheaptha chun críocha agra-staidrimh "
"(kg/ha/lá). Tá meastacháin gach 10 lá ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag taifeach "
"spásúil de thart ar 1km agus leis an méid ama ó 1999 go Meitheamh 2020. "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-1km)."

