msgid ""
"Provides information on the relative water content of the top few "
"centimeters soil, describing how wet or dry the soil is in its topmost "
"layer, expressed in percent saturation. Daily observations are available "
"for the continental Europe in the spatial resolution of 1 km and with the "
"temporal extent from October 2014 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-surface-"
"soil-moisture-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé faisnéis ar ábhar coibhneasta uisce na gcúpla ceintiméadar "
"barr d'ithir, ag cur síos ar cé chomh fliuch nó tirim atá an ithir ina "
"ciseal is uachtaraí, léirithe i gcéatadán sáithithe. Tá breathnuithe "
"laethúla ar fáil don Eoraip ilchríochach ag taifeach spásúil de 1 km agus "
"leis an méid ama ó Dheireadh Fómhair 2014 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-surface-"
"soil-moisture-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Maps burn scars, surfaces which have been sufficiently affected by fire to "
"display significant changes in the vegetation cover (destruction of dry "
"material, reduction or loss of green material) and in the ground surface "
"(temporarily darker because of ash). Monthly datasets are available at "
"global scale, in the spatial resolution of 300 m, and with a time lag of "
"two months. They cover the period from 2019 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"monthly-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Léarscáiliú ar choilm dhóite, dromchlaí ar chuir tine isteach orthu go "
"leordhóthanach chun athruithe suntasacha a thaispeáint sa chlúdach "
"plandúlachta (scrios ábhair thirim, laghdú nó cailliúint ábhair ghlais) "
"agus i ndromchla na talún (níos dorcha go sealadach mar gheall ar "
"luaithreach). Tá tacair shonraí mhíosúla ar fáil ar scála domhanda, ag "
"taifeach spásúil de 300 m, agus le moill ama dhá mhí. Clúdaíonn siad an "
"tréimhse ó 2019 go 2025. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/burnt-area-v3-1-"
"monthly-300m)."

msgid ""
