"agus i ndromchla na talún (níos dorcha go sealadach mar gheall ar "
"luaithreach). Tá tacair shonraí laethúla ar fáil ar scála domhanda, ag "
"taifeach spásúil de 300 m, agus laistigh de 24 uair an chloig tar éis "
"ghabháil an tsatailíte. Clúdaíonn siad an tréimhse ón Nollaig 2024 go dtí "
"seo. Tuilleadh eolais _ag teacht go luath_."

msgid ""
"Provide at global scale and for Europe information on vegetation phenology "
"and productivity gathering 13 parameters  for two growing seasons. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé ar scála domhanda agus don Eoraip faisnéis ar "
"fheinealaíocht agus ar tháirgiúlacht plandúlachta a thiomsaíonn 13 "
"pharaiméadar do dhá shéasúr fáis. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."

msgid ""
"Provides at global scale and for Europe information on vegetation phenology "
"and productivity gathering 13 parameters for two growing seasons. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé ar scála domhanda agus don Eoraip faisnéis ar "
"fheinealaíocht agus ar tháirgiúlacht plandúlachta a thiomsaíonn 13 "
"pharaiméadar do dhá shéasúr fáis. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation?tab=vegetation_"
"phenology_and_productivity_parameters)."

msgid ""
"Provides the total amount of carbon compounds produced by photosynthesis of "
"plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time. 10-daily observations are "
"available at global scale in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2023 to 2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé iomlán na gcomhdhúl carbóin a tháirgtear trí fhótasintéis "
"plandaí in éiceachóras i dtréimhse ama ar leith. Tá breathnuithe gach 10 lá "
"ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de 300 m agus leis an méid "
"ama ó 2023 go 2026. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Defined as half the total area of green elements of the canopy per unit "
"horizontal ground area. Every 10-days estimates are available in near real "
"time at global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from January "
"2014 to June 2020 based upon PROBA-V data with version 1.0 and from July "
"2020 onwards based upon Sentinel-3/OLCI data with version 1.1. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-300"
"m-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhínítear é mar leath de achar iomlán eilimintí glasa an chanbhaisín in "
"aghaidh an aonaid achair talún chothrománaigh. Tá meastacháin gach 10 lá ar "
"fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am ar scála domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de thart ar "
"300 m ó Eanáir 2014 go Meitheamh 2020 bunaithe ar shonraí PROBA-V le leagan "
"1.0 agus ó Iúil 2020 ar aghaidh bunaithe ar shonraí Sentinel-3/OLCI le "
"leagan 1.1. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-30"
"0m-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Defined as half the total area of green elements of the canopy per unit "
"horizontal ground area. Every 10-days estimates are available in near real "
"time at global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from January "
"2014 to June 2020 based upon PROBA-V data with version 1.0 and from July "
"2020 to 2026 based upon Sentinel-3/OLCI data with version 1.1. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-300"
"m-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhínítear é mar leath de achar iomlán eilimintí glasa an chanbhaisín in "
"aghaidh an aonaid achair talún chothrománaigh. Tá meastacháin gach 10 lá ar "
"fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am ar scála domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de thart ar "
"300 m ó Eanáir 2014 go Meitheamh 2020 bunaithe ar shonraí PROBA-V le leagan "
"1.0 agus ó Iúil 2020 go 2026 bunaithe ar shonraí Sentinel-3/OLCI le leagan "
"1.1. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-30"
"0m-v1.0)."

msgid ""
"Provides the amount of carbon retained in an ecosystem (increase in "
"biomass); it is equal to the difference between the amount of carbon "
"produced through photosynthesis (GPP) and the amount of energy that is used "
"for respiration (R). 10-daily observations are available at global scale in "
"the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé an méid carbóin a choinnítear in éiceachóras (méadú "
"bithmhaise); is ionann é agus an difríocht idir an méid carbóin a "
"tháirgtear trí fhótasintéis (GPP) agus an méid fuinnimh a úsáidtear le "
"haghaidh riospráide (R). Tá breathnuithe gach 10 lá ar fáil ar scála "
"domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de 300 m agus leis an méid ama ó 2023 go 2026. "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, a spectral index "
"quantifying the amount and vigour of vegetation. Every 10-days, estimates "
"are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~1km from January "
"1999 to June 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé an tInnéacs Plandúlachta Difríochta Normalaithe, innéacs "
"speictreach a chainníonn méid agus bríomhaireacht na plandúlachta. Gach 10 "
"lá, tá meastacháin ar fáil ar scála domhanda, ag taifeach spásúil de ~1km ó "
"Eanáir 1999 go Meitheamh 2020. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Averages the daily Soil Water Index product over 10 days. The data are "
"produced every 10 days over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé meán den táirge laethúil Innéacs Uisce Ithreach thar 10 lá. "
"Táirgtear na sonraí gach 10 lá thar an domhan ag taifeach spásúil de 0.1° "
"agus leis an méid ama ó Eanáir 2007 go 2025. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."

msgid ""
"Provides daily updates on the moisture conditions in different soil layers. "
"The data are available over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé nuashonruithe laethúla ar na coinníollacha taise i gciseal "
"ithreach éagsúla. Tá na sonraí ar fáil thar an domhan ag taifeach spásúil "
"de 0.1° agus leis an méid ama ó Eanáir 2007 go 2025. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5km)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the moisture condition at various depths in the soil. Daily "
"observations are available for the continental Europe in the spatial "
"resolution of 1 km and with the temporal extent from January 2015 to 2025. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Cainníonn sé an coinníoll taise ag doimhneachtaí éagsúla san ithir. Tá "
"breathnuithe laethúla ar fáil don Eoraip ilchríochach ag taifeach spásúil "
"de 1 km agus leis an méid ama ó Eanáir 2015 go 2025. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-v1-0-1km)."

#. LOT2
msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water providing the maximum and the "
"minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal dynamics. "
"10-daly data are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of 300 "
"m and with the temporal extent from 2014 to 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Braitheann sé na limistéir atá clúdaithe ag uisce intíre, ag soláthar "
"uasmhéid agus íosmhéid dhromchla an uisce chomh maith leis an dinimic "
"séasúrach. Tá sonraí gach 10 lá ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag taifeach "
"spásúil de 300 m agus leis an méid ama ó 2014 go 2020. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water providing the maximum and the "
"minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal dynamics. "
"Monthly updates are available at global scale in the spatial resolution of "
"300 m and with the temporal extent from 2020 to present More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Braitheann sé na limistéir atá clúdaithe ag uisce intíre, ag soláthar "
"uasmhéid agus íosmhéid dhromchla an uisce chomh maith leis an dinimic "
"séasúrach. Tá nuashonruithe míosúla ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag taifeach "
"spásúil de 300 m agus leis an méid ama ó 2020 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides for the Northern Hemisphere daily updates of the equivalent amount "
"of liquid water stored in the snow pack. The data is available in the "
"spatial resolution of 5 km and with the temporal extent from January 2006 "
"to June 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v1-"
"0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé don Leathsféar Thuaidh nuashonruithe laethúla ar an méid "
"coibhéiseach uisce leachtaigh atá stóráilte sa sneachta cnuasaithe. Tá na "
"sonraí ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil de 5 km agus leis an méid ama ó Eanáir "
"2006 go Meitheamh 2024. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v1"
"-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for the Northern Hemisphere daily updates of the equivalent amount "
"of liquid water stored in the snow pack. The data is available in near real "
"time in the spatial resolution of 5 km and with the temporal extent from "
"July 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v2-"
"0-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé don Leathsféar Thuaidh nuashonruithe laethúla ar an méid "
"coibhéiseach uisce leachtaigh atá stóráilte sa sneachta cnuasaithe. Tá na "
"sonraí ar fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am ag taifeach spásúil de 5 km agus leis "
"an méid ama ó Iúil 2024 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-water-equivalent-v2"
"-0-5km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for Europe daily updates of the fraction of snow cover on the "
"ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The "
"data is available in near real time in the spatial resolution of 500 m and "
"with the temporal extent from March 2017 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-europe-"
"v1-0-500m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé don Eoraip nuashonruithe laethúla ar an gcodán de chlúdach "
"sneachta ar an talamh (i limistéir foraoisithe freisin) in aghaidh an "
"phicteilín i gcéatadán (0% – 100%). Tá na sonraí ar fáil beagnach i "
"bhfíor-am ag taifeach spásúil de 500 m agus leis an méid ama ó Mhárta 2017 "
"go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"europe-v1-0-500m)."

msgid ""
"Provides for Northern Hemisphere daily maps of the fraction of snow cover "
"on ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The "
"data is available in near real time with a pixel spacing of about 1 km and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2018 to 2026. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé don Leathsféar Thuaidh léarscáileanna laethúla den chodán "
"de chlúdach sneachta ar an talamh (i limistéir foraoisithe freisin) in "
"aghaidh an phicteilín i gcéatadán (0% – 100%). Tá na sonraí ar fáil "
"beagnach i bhfíor-am le spásáil picteilíní de thart ar 1 km agus leis an "
"méid ama ó Eanáir 2018 go 2026. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-v1-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides for global land areas (excluding Antarctica) daily maps of the "
"fraction of snow cover on ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in "
"percentage (0% – 100%). The data is available in near real time with a "
"pixel spacing of about 1 km and with the temporal extent from December 2025 "
"to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé do limistéir talún dhomhanda (ach amháin an Antartaice) "
"léarscáileanna laethúla den chodán de chlúdach sneachta ar an talamh (i "
"limistéir foraoisithe freisin) in aghaidh an phicteilín i gcéatadán (0% – "
"100%). Tá na sonraí ar fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am le spásáil picteilíní de "
"thart ar 1 km agus leis an méid ama ó Nollaig 2025 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh "
"eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis classifies pixels in Northern Hemisphere freshwater bodies "
"into 1) Ice, 2) Open water, and 3) Cloud. The class “Ice” includes various "
"types of ice, also snow-covered ice. The data is updated in near real-time "
"with the spatial resolution of 500 m and with a temporal extent from April "
"2021 to 2025. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-500m)."
msgstr ""
"Gach lá aicmíonn sé picteilíní i gcomhlachtaí fíoruisce an Leathsféir "
"Thuaidh i 1) Oighear, 2) Uisce oscailte, agus 3) Scamall. Áirítear leis an "
"aicme “Oighear” cineálacha éagsúla oighir, oighear atá clúdaithe le "
"sneachta freisin. Déantar na sonraí a nuashonrú beagnach i bhfíor-am ag "
"taifeach spásúil de 500 m agus le méid ama ó Aibreán 2021 go 2025. "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"northern-hemisphere-500m)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis, classifies pixels of Continental Europe freshwater bodies "
"as 1) Fully snow-covered ice, 2) Partially snow-covered or snow-free ice, "
"and 3) Open water. The data is available in near real time in a spatial "
"resolution of 250 m and with the temporal extent from July the 1st, "
"onwards. In June 2024, the data input sensor was transferred from Terra "
"MODIS (VERSION 1.2.1) to NOAA-20 VIIRS (VERSION 2.2.1), and the area was "
"extended from the Baltic region to cover Continental Europe. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"europe-v2-250m)."
msgstr ""
"Gach lá, aicmíonn sé picteilíní de chomhlachtaí fíoruisce na hEorpa "
"Ilchríochaí mar 1) Oighear atá clúdaithe go hiomlán le sneachta, 2) Oighear "
"atá clúdaithe go páirteach le sneachta nó saor ó sneachta, agus 3) Uisce "
"oscailte. Tá na sonraí ar fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am ag taifeach spásúil de "
"250 m agus leis an méid ama ón 1 Iúil ar aghaidh. I Meitheamh 2024, "
"aistríodh an braiteoir ionchuir sonraí ó Terra MODIS (LEAGAN 1.2.1) go "
"NOAA-20 VIIRS (LEAGAN 2.2.1), agus leathnaíodh an limistéar ó réigiún na "
"Baltaice chun an Eoraip Ilchríochach a chlúdach. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"europe-v2-250m)."

msgid ""
"Detects the areas covered by inland water along the year providing the "
"maximum and the minimum extent of the water surface as well as the seasonal "
"dynamics. Monthly updates are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of 100 m and with the temporal extent from 2020 to present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Braitheann sé na limistéir atá clúdaithe ag uisce intíre le linn na bliana, "
"ag soláthar uasmhéid agus íosmhéid dhromchla an uisce chomh maith leis an "
"dinimic séasúrach. Tá nuashonruithe míosúla ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag "
"taifeach spásúil de 100 m agus leis an méid ama ó 2020 go dtí seo. "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-bodies-"
"global-v1-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes. 10-daily observations are available in near real time at "
"300 m spatial resolution from September 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-near-real-time-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé breathnuithe leasleanúnacha do líon mór lochanna meánmhéide "
"agus móra. Tá breathnuithe gach 10 lá ar fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am ag "
"taifeach spásúil de 300 m ó Mheán Fómhair 2024 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-near-real-time-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2002 to 2012. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé breathnuithe leasleanúnacha do líon mór lochanna meánmhéide "
"agus móra, de réir an Bhunachar Sonraí Domhanda Lochanna agus Báchoill "
"(GLWD) nó a bhfuil spéis faireacháin chomhshaoil ar leith iontu ar shlí "
"eile. Tá breathnuithe gach 10 lá ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil de 300 m agus "
"leis an méid ama ó 2002 go 2012. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in the spatial resolution of 300 m and with the "
"temporal extent from 2016 to 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé breathnuithe leasleanúnacha do líon mór lochanna meánmhéide "
"agus móra, de réir an Bhunachar Sonraí Domhanda Lochanna agus Báchoill "
"(GLWD) nó a bhfuil spéis faireacháin chomhshaoil ar leith iontu ar shlí "
"eile. Tá breathnuithe gach 10 lá ar fáil ag taifeach spásúil de 300 m agus "
"leis an méid ama ó 2016 go 2024. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-offline-v1-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in near real time in the spatial resolution of "
"100 m and with the temporal extent from 2019 to 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v1-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé breathnuithe leasleanúnacha do líon mór lochanna meánmhéide "
"agus móra, de réir an Bhunachar Sonraí Domhanda Lochanna agus Báchoill "
"(GLWD) nó a bhfuil spéis faireacháin chomhshaoil ar leith iontu ar shlí "
"eile. Tá breathnuithe gach 10 lá ar fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am ag taifeach "
"spásúil de 100 m agus leis an méid ama ó 2019 go 2024. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v1-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides spatial information at global level on different types (classes) "
"of physical coverage of the Earth's surface, e.g. forests, grasslands, "
"croplands, water bodies, wetlands for the base year 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products?tab=full_coverage_land_cover__"
"use)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé faisnéis spásúil ar leibhéal domhanda ar chineálacha "
"(ranganna) éagsúla clúdaigh fhisiciúil de dhromchla an Domhain, m.sh. "
"foraoisí, féarthailte, talamh curaíochta, comhlachtaí uisce, riasca don "
"bhunbhliain 2020. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products?tab=full_coverage_land_cover_"
"_use)."

msgid ""
"Provides yearly tree cover density for the pantropical region at 10 m "
"resolution, expressed as percentage of tree cover. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/"
"tree-cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé dlús bliantúil clúdaigh crann don réigiún pantrópaiceach ag "
"taifeach 10 m, léirithe mar chéatadán de chlúdach crann. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/"
"tree-cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."

msgid ""
"On a daily basis classifies pixels in Global freshwater bodies into 1) "
"Snow-covered ice, 2) Partially snow-covered or snow-free ice, 3) Open "
"water, and 4) Cloud. The data is updated in near-real time with the spatial "
"resolution of 500 m and with a temporal extent from July 2025 to present. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"global-500m_v2)."
msgstr ""
"Gach lá aicmíonn sé picteilíní i gcomhlachtaí fíoruisce domhanda i 1) "
"Oighear atá clúdaithe le sneachta, 2) Oighear atá clúdaithe go páirteach le "
"sneachta nó saor ó sneachta, 3) Uisce oscailte, agus 4) Scamall. Déantar na "
"sonraí a nuashonrú beagnach i bhfíor-am ag taifeach spásúil de 500 m agus "
"le méid ama ó Iúil 2025 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"global-500m_v2)."

msgid ""
"Provides daily updates on the moisture conditions in different soil layers. "
"The data are available over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from 2007 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-12-5km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé nuashonruithe laethúla ar na coinníollacha taise i gciseal "
"ithreach éagsúla. Tá na sonraí ar fáil thar an domhan ag taifeach spásúil "
"de 0.1° agus leis an méid ama ó 2007 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-12-5km)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the moisture condition at various depths in the soil. Daily "
"observations are available for the continental Europe in the spatial "
"resolution of 1 km and with the temporal extent from July 2025 to present. "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Cainníonn sé an coinníoll taise ag doimhneachtaí éagsúla san ithir. Tá "
"breathnuithe laethúla ar fáil don Eoraip ilchríochach ag taifeach spásúil "
"de 1 km agus leis an méid ama ó Iúil 2025 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/daily-soil-"
"water-index-europe-1km)."

msgid ""
"Averages the daily Soil Water Index product over 10 days. The data are "
"produced every 10 days over the globe at the spatial resolution of 0.1° and "
"with the temporal extent from January 2007 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."
msgstr ""
"Déanann sé meán den táirge laethúil Innéacs Uisce Ithreach thar 10 lá. "
"Táirgtear na sonraí gach 10 lá thar an domhan ag taifeach spásúil de 0.1° "
"agus leis an méid ama ó Eanáir 2007 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/soil-moisture/10-daily-soil-"
"water-index-global-v3-0-12-5-km)."

msgid ""
"On daily basis for the Northern Europe classifies, in pixels, "
"inland/freshwater bodies as 1) Fully snow-covered ice, 2) Partially "
"snow-covered or snow-free ice, 3) Open water. The data is available in near "
"real time in the spatial resolution of 250 m and with the temporal extent "
"from March 2017 to 30 June 2024. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"baltic-v1-250m)."
msgstr ""
"Gach lá do Thuaisceart na hEorpa, aicmíonn sé, i bpicteilíní, comhlachtaí "
"intíre/fíoruisce mar 1) Oighear atá clúdaithe go hiomlán le sneachta, 2) "
"Oighear atá clúdaithe go páirteach le sneachta nó saor ó sneachta, 3) Uisce "
"oscailte. Tá na sonraí ar fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am ag taifeach spásúil de "
"250 m agus leis an méid ama ó Mhárta 2017 go 30 Meitheamh 2024. Tuilleadh "
"eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-ice-extent-"
"baltic-v1-250m)."

msgid ""
"Provides actual evapotranspiration, soil evaporation and canopy "
"transpiration with some quality indicators. Estimates are provided for two "
"evapotranspiration schemes and an Ensemble of models. Every 10-days "
"estimate are available in near real time at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of about 300 m from November 2025 onwards in version 1.0. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/"
"evapotranspiration-2025-present-raster-300m-global-10-daily-version-1)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé galú-trasghalú iarbhír, galú ithreach agus trasghalú "
"ceannbhrait le roinnt táscairí cáilíochta. Soláthraítear meastacháin do dhá "
"scéim galú-trasghalaithe agus Ensemble de shamhlacha. Tá meastacháin gach "
"10 lá ar fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am ar scála domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de "
"thart ar 300 m ó Shamhain 2025 ar aghaidh i leagan 1.0. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/"
"evapotranspiration-2025-present-raster-300m-global-10-daily-version-1)."

msgid ""
"Provides latent and sensible heat fluxes with one auxiliary information. "
"Estimates are provided for each Sentinel-3 overpass in near real time at "
"global scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from November 2025 "
"onwards in version 1.0. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/heat-flux-2"
"025-present-raster-300-m-global-daily-version-1)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé flosanna teasa folaigh agus intuigthe le píosa amháin "
"faisnéise cúnta. Soláthraítear meastacháin do gach pas Sentinel-3 beagnach "
"i bhfíor-am ar scála domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de thart ar 300 m ó "
"Shamhain 2025 ar aghaidh i leagan 1.0. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/evapotranspiration/heat-flux-"
"2025-present-raster-300-m-global-daily-version-1)."

msgid ""
"Provides the temperature of the water at the lake surface. The LSWT "
"observations (every 10 days) are available at global scale at spatial "
"resolution of ~1 km and with the temporal extent from 2002 to 2012. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-offline-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé teocht an uisce ar dhromchla an locha. Tá breathnuithe LSWT "
"(gach 10 lá) ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de ~1 km agus "
"leis an méid ama ó 2002 go 2012. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-offline-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides the temperature of the water at the lake surface. The near real "
"time observations (every 10 days) are available at global scale at spatial "
"resolution of ~1 km and with the temporal extent from 2016 to present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-near-real-time-v1-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé teocht an uisce ar dhromchla an locha. Tá na breathnuithe "
"beagnach i bhfíor-am (gach 10 lá) ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag taifeach "
"spásúil de ~1 km agus leis an méid ama ó 2016 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"lake-surface-water-temperature-near-real-time-v1-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides semi-continuous observations for a large number of medium and "
"large-sized lakes, according to the Global Lakes and Wetlands Database "
"(GLWD) or otherwise of specific environmental monitoring interest. 10-daily "
"observations are available in near real time at 100 m spatial resolution "
"from September 2024 to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v2-0-100m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé breathnuithe leasleanúnacha do líon mór lochanna meánmhéide "
"agus móra, de réir an Bhunachar Sonraí Domhanda Lochanna agus Báchoill "
"(GLWD) nó a bhfuil spéis faireacháin chomhshaoil ar leith iontu ar shlí "
"eile. Tá breathnuithe gach 10 lá ar fáil beagnach i bhfíor-am ag taifeach "
"spásúil de 100 m ó Mheán Fómhair 2024 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/lake-water-"
"quality-v2-0-100m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about Leaf Area Index, defined as half the total area "
"of green elements of the canopy per unit horizontal ground area. Every "
"10-days estimates are available at global scale in the spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2-"
"0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé faisnéis faoin Innéacs Achair Duille, a shainmhínítear mar "
"leath de achar iomlán eilimintí glasa an chanbhaisín in aghaidh an aonaid "
"achair talún chothrománaigh. Tá meastacháin gach 10 lá ar fáil ar scála "
"domhanda ag taifeach spásúil de ~300 m ó Eanáir 2014 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh "
"eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2"
"-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the fraction of the solar radiation absorbed by live plants for "
"photosynthesis. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, in "
"the spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Cainníonn sé an codán den radaíocht ghréine a ionsúnn plandaí beo le "
"haghaidh fótasintéise. Tá meastacháin gach 10 lá ar fáil ar scála domhanda, "
"ag taifeach spásúil de ~ 300 m, ó Eanáir 2014 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information of the fraction of ground covered by green vegetation. "
"Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale in the spatial "
"resolution of ~ 300 m from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-green-"
"vegetation-cover-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé faisnéis faoin gcodán den talamh atá clúdaithe ag "
"plandúlacht ghlas. Tá meastacháin gach 10 lá ar fáil ar scála domhanda ag "
"taifeach spásúil de ~ 300 m ó Eanáir 2014 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-green-"
"vegetation-cover-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2018 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover data for 764 "
"Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the 2018 "
"reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans countries, as "
"well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Clúdach Talún agus Úsáid Talún Urban Atlas 2018 sonraí "
"iontaofa, inchomparáide, ard-taifigh ar úsáid talún agus ar chlúdach talún "
"do 764 Limistéar Uirbeach Feidhmiúil (FUA) a bhfuil breis is 50,000 "
"áitritheoir iontu don bhliain thagartha 2018 i dtíortha EEA38 (AE, EFTA, "
"tíortha na mBalcán Thiar, chomh maith le Türkiye) agus sa Ríocht Aontaithe. "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use 2021 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover data for 790 "
"Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the 2021 "
"reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans countries, as "
"well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Clúdach Talún agus Úsáid Talún Urban Atlas 2021 sonraí "
"iontaofa, inchomparáide, ard-taifigh ar úsáid talún agus ar chlúdach talún "
"do 790 Limistéar Uirbeach Feidhmiúil (FUA) a bhfuil breis is 50,000 "
"áitritheoir iontu don bhliain thagartha 2021 i dtíortha EEA38 (AE, EFTA, "
"tíortha na mBalcán Thiar, chomh maith le Türkiye) agus sa Ríocht Aontaithe. "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Land Cover and Land Use Change 2018-2021 provides reliable, "
"inter-comparable, high-resolution land use and land cover change data for "
"764 Functional Urban Areas (FUA) with more than 50,000 inhabitants for the "
"2021 reference year in EEA38 countries (EU, EFTA, Western Balkans "
"countries, as well as Türkiye) and the United Kingdom. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Athrú Clúdaigh Talún agus Úsáide Talún Urban Atlas 2018-2021 "
"sonraí iontaofa, inchomparáide, ard-taifigh ar athrú úsáide talún agus "
"clúdaigh talún do 764 Limistéar Uirbeach Feidhmiúil (FUA) a bhfuil breis is "
"50,000 áitritheoir iontu don bhliain thagartha 2021 i dtíortha EEA38 (AE, "
"EFTA, tíortha na mBalcán Thiar, chomh maith le Türkiye) agus sa Ríocht "
"Aontaithe. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Street Tree Layer 2021 provides information about presence of "
"trees within Functional Urban Areas (FUA). More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Ciseal Crann Sráide Urban Atlas 2021 faisnéis faoi láithreacht "
"crann laistigh de Limistéir Uirbeacha Feidhmiúla (FUA). Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"Provides detailed land cover and land use information for 59 thematic "
"classes in selected Natura2000 and Emerald sites for the 2021 reference "
"year. The dataset has a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.5 ha and a Minimum "
"Mapping Width (MMW) of 10 m and is available as vector data. More "
"information [here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/n2k)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé faisnéis mhionsonraithe ar chlúdach talún agus ar úsáid "
"talún do 59 aicme théamach i suíomhanna roghnaithe Natura2000 agus Emerald "
"don bhliain thagartha 2021. Tá Aonad Íosta Léarscáilithe (MMU) de 0.5 ha "
"agus Leithead Íosta Léarscáilithe (MMW) de 10 m ag an tacar sonraí agus tá "
"sé ar fáil mar shonraí veicteora. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/n2k)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the overall growth rate, or net dry biomass "
"increase, of the vegetation. It is equivalent to Net Primary Production "
"(NPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and per day. Every "
"10-days, estimates are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé faisnéis faoin ráta fáis iomlán, nó an méadú glan "
"bithmhaise tirime, ar an bplandúlacht. Tá sé coibhéiseach le "
"Príomhtháirgeacht Ghlan (NPP) ach léirithe i kg ábhair thirim in aghaidh an "
"heictéir agus in aghaidh an lae. Gach 10 lá, tá meastacháin ar fáil ar "
"scála domhanda, ag taifeach spásúil de ~300 m, ó Eanáir 2014 go dtí seo. "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of carbon compounds produced by "
"photosynthesis of plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time, "
"expressed in gC/m²/day. Every 10-days, estimates are available at global "
"scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé faisnéis faoin méid iomlán comhdhúl carbóin a tháirgtear "
"trí fhótasintéis plandaí in éiceachóras i dtréimhse ama ar leith, léirithe "
"i gC/m²/lá. Gach 10 lá, tá meastacháin ar fáil ar scála domhanda, ag "
"taifeach spásúil de ~ 300 m, ó Eanáir 2014 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the net amount of biomass, or carbon, produced "
"by plants per unit area and time, expressed in gC/m²/day. It is equal to "
"the difference between the Gross Primary Production (GPP), i.e. the total "
"amount of carbon produced through photosynthesis, and the amount of energy "
"used for plant respiration. Every 10-days, estimates are available at "
"global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé faisnéis faoin méid glan bithmhaise, nó carbóin, a "
"tháirgeann plandaí in aghaidh an aonaid achair agus ama, léirithe i "
"gC/m²/lá. Is ionann é agus an difríocht idir an Phríomhtháirgeacht Ghrosa "
"(GPP), is é sin, an méid iomlán carbóin a tháirgtear trí fhótasintéis, agus "
"an méid fuinnimh a úsáidtear le haghaidh riospráid plandaí. Gach 10 lá, tá "
"meastacháin ar fáil ar scála domhanda, ag taifeach spásúil de ~ 300 m, ó "
"Eanáir 2014 go dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of dry matter produced by land "
"plants per unit time through photosynthesis. It is equivalent to Gross "
"Primary Production (GPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and "
"per day. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, at a "
"spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé faisnéis faoin méid iomlán ábhair thirim a tháirgeann "
"plandaí talún in aghaidh an aonaid ama trí fhótasintéis. Tá sé coibhéiseach "
"le Príomhtháirgeacht Ghrosa (GPP) ach léirithe i kg ábhair thirim in "
"aghaidh an heictéir agus in aghaidh an lae. Tá meastacháin gach 10 lá ar "
"fáil ar scála domhanda, ag taifeach spásúil de ~ 300 m, ó Eanáir 2014 go "
"dtí seo. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Dominant Leaf Type (DLT) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-tree "
"covered areas, broadleaved and coniferous).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chineáil Duille Cheannasaigh Ard-Taifigh "
"(DLT) aicmiú bunúsach clúdaigh talún le 3 aicme théamacha (gach limistéar "
"nach bhfuil clúdaithe le crainn, leathanduilleach agus buaircíneach).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú le 2018 i rastair 10 "
"méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 "
"x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Clúdach Crann agus Foraoise. Tá ciseal muiníne ar "
"fáil don tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Presence (CPFLP) "
"raster product provides the yearly fallow land classification indicating if "
"arable land has been left fallow in the respective calendar year. This "
"dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the "
"European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer "
"available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - "
"Láithreacht Branair (CPFLP) aicmiú bliantúil branair a léiríonn ar fágadh "
"talamh inaiste ina bhranar sa bhliain féilire faoi seach. Soláthraítear an "
"tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair 10 méadar "
"(comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 x 100 "
"km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38. Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún "
"Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh "
"Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil After (CPBSA) "
"raster product provides bare soil period (in days) after the harvest of the "
"main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend the "
"calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - "
"Ithir Lom Ina Dhiaidh (CPBSA) tréimhse ithreach loim (i laethanta) tar éis "
"fómhar an phríomhbharr bliantúil. Tabhair faoi deara nach féidir leis an "
"tréimhse ithreach loim dul thar an mbliain féilire a gintear an táirge di.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don "
"tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Duration (CPFLD) "
"raster product provides information on the duration of fallow land periods, "
"expressed in days, over a five-year period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"Note: each product covers a five-year window and is referenced by the end "
"year of that window (e.g. the 2021 product covers the period 2017–2021).\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - Fad "
"Branair (CPFLD) faisnéis ar fhad tréimhsí branair, léirithe i laethanta, "
"thar thréimhse cúig bliana.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Nóta: clúdaíonn gach táirge fuinneog cúig bliana agus tagraítear dó de réir "
"bhliain dheiridh na fuinneoige sin (m.sh. clúdaíonn táirge 2021 an tréimhse "
"2017–2021).\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don "
"tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil Before (CPBSB) "
"raster product provides the bare soil period (in days) before the emergence "
"of the main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend "
"the calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - "
"Ithir Lom Roimhe (CPBSB) an tréimhse ithreach loim (i laethanta) roimh "
"theacht chun cinn an phríomhbharr bliantúil. Tabhair faoi deara nach féidir "
"leis an tréimhse ithreach loim dul thar an mbliain féilire a gintear an "
"táirge di.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don "
"tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Dominant Leaf Type Change (DLTC) raster provides "
"information on the change between two reference years, and consists of 5 "
"thematic classes (new broadleaved cover / new coniferous cover / loss of "
"broadleaved cover / loss of coniferous cover / unchanged areas with tree "
"cover). This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 and "
"2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"The production of the high resolution forest layers was coordinated by the "
"European Environment Agency (EEA) in the frame of the EU Copernicus "
"programme.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Athrú Cineáil Duille "
"Cheannasaigh (DLTC) faisnéis ar an athrú idir dhá bhliain thagartha, agus "
"tá 5 aicme théamacha ann (clúdach leathanduilleach nua / clúdach "
"buaircíneach nua / cailliúint clúdaigh leathanduilleach / cailliúint "
"clúdaigh bhuaircíneach / limistéir gan athrú le clúdach crann). Clúdaíonn "
"an tacar sonraí seo dhá thréimhse chomparáide, 2018-2021 agus 2021-2024, "
"agus tá gach táirge dátaithe de réir bhliain dheiridh a thréimhse "
"comparáide.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo i rastair 20 méadar (comhoiriúnach go "
"hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn "
"tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Chomhordaigh an Ghníomhaireacht Eorpach Comhshaoil (EEA) táirgeadh na "
"gciseal foraoise ard-taifigh faoi chlár Copernicus an AE.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Crop Types (CTY) raster product provides high "
"resolution crop type classification for 17 classes of both arable and "
"permanent crops across the EEA38 extent. Using both Sentinel-1 and "
"Sentinel-2, the model is finetuned to first map the crop field boundaries, "
"and then determine the main crop for each field.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Cineálacha Barr (CTY) "
"aicmiú ard-taifigh cineálacha barr do 17 aicme de bharra inaiste agus buan "
"ar fud limistéar EEA38. Ag baint úsáide as Sentinel-1 agus Sentinel-2 "
"araon, déantar an tsamhail a mhionchoigeartú chun teorainneacha na ngort "
"barr a léarscáiliú ar dtús, agus ansin an príomhbharr do gach gort a "
"chinneadh.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don "
"tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Duration (CPMCD) "
"raster product provides the duration (in days) of the growing season for "
"the main (annual) crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is "
"part of the European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence "
"layer available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - Fad "
"an Phríomhbharr (CPMCD) fad (i laethanta) an tséasúir fáis don phríomhbharr "
"(bliantúil).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38. Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin "
"Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh "
"Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The Copernicus High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Presence Change (TCPC) "
"raster product provides information on the change between two reference "
"years, and consists of 3 thematic classes (new tree cover / loss of tree "
"cover / unchanged areas with tree cover). The class 255 = outside area is "
"predefined by the 100m boundary layer and remains unchanged. This layer for "
"previous reference year comparisons is called Tree Cover Change Mask "
"(TCCM). This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 and "
"2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"The production of the high resolution forest layers was coordinated by the "
"European Environment Agency (EEA) in the frame of the EU Copernicus "
"programme. Confidence layer available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Copernicus Athrú "
"Láithreachta Clúdaigh Crann (TCPC) faisnéis ar an athrú idir dhá bhliain "
"thagartha, agus tá 3 aicme théamacha ann (clúdach crann nua / cailliúint "
"clúdaigh crann / limistéir gan athrú le clúdach crann). Tá an aicme 255 = "
"limistéar lasmuigh réamhshainithe ag an gciseal teorann 100m agus fanann sé "
"gan athrú. Tugtar Masc Athraithe Clúdaigh Crann (TCCM) ar an gciseal seo le "
"haghaidh comparáidí na mblianta tagartha roimhe seo. Clúdaíonn an tacar "
"sonraí seo dhá thréimhse chomparáide, 2018-2021 agus 2021-2024, agus tá "
"gach táirge dátaithe de réir bhliain dheiridh a thréimhse comparáide.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo i rastair 20 méadar (comhoiriúnach go "
"hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn "
"tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Chomhordaigh an Ghníomhaireacht Eorpach Comhshaoil (EEA) táirgeadh na "
"gciseal foraoise ard-taifigh faoi chlár Copernicus an AE. Tá ciseal muiníne "
"ar fáil don tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Change (GRAC) raster product at 20m "
"resolution provides information on changes in grassland vegetation cover. "
"The thematic classes indicate all non-grassland areas, grassland gain and "
"grassland loss, unchanged grassland in both years and unverified grassland "
"gain and loss areas. This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 "
"and 2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Athrú Féarthailte (GRAC) ag "
"taifeach 20m faisnéis ar athruithe ar chlúdach plandúlachta féarthailte. "
"Léiríonn na haicmí téamacha gach limistéar nach féarthailte iad, gnóthú "
"féarthailte agus cailliúint féarthailte, féarthailte gan athrú sa dá "
"bhliain agus limistéir gnóthaithe agus caillte féarthailte "
"neamhsheiceáilte. Clúdaíonn an tacar sonraí seo dhá thréimhse chomparáide, "
"2018-2021 agus 2021-2024, agus tá gach táirge dátaithe de réir bhliain "
"dheiridh a thréimhse comparáide.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo i rastair 20 méadar (comhoiriúnach go "
"hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn "
"tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Féarthailte. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don tacar "
"sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) provides a forest "
"classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-forest areas / broadleaved "
"forest / coniferous forest) at 10m spatial resolution and with a Minimum "
"Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.5 ha. This raster layer is largely following the "
"FAO (Food and Agriculture Organisation of the United Nations) forest "
"definition with tree covered areas in agricultural and urban context "
"excluded using the respective Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Cineál Foraoise (FTY) aicmiú foraoise le "
"3 aicme théamacha (gach limistéar nach foraois é / foraois leathanduilleach "
"/ foraois bhuaircíneach) ag taifeach spásúil 10m agus le hAonad Íosta "
"Léarscáilithe (MMU) de 0.5 ha. Leanann an ciseal raster seo den chuid is mó "
"sainmhíniú foraoise FAO (Eagraíocht Bia agus Talmhaíochta na Náisiún "
"Aontaithe) agus limistéir atá clúdaithe le crainn i gcomhthéacs "
"talmhaíochta agus uirbeach eisiata ag baint úsáide as an gCiseal Tacaíochta "
"Breise Foraoise faoi seach (FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo ar mhinicíocht 3 bliana i rastair 10 "
"méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 "
"x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Clúdach Crann agus Foraoise.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Féarthailte (GRA) ciseal "
"stádais dénártha de masc féarthailte/neamh-fhéarthailte. Áirítear sa táirge "
"bonnlíne plandúlachta féarach agus neamhchrannach seo gach cineál "
"féarthailte: féarthailte bainistithe, féarthailte leath-nádúrtha agus "
"plandúlacht fhéarach nádúrtha. Ní áirítear féarthailte sealadacha, a "
"mhaisctear amach ag baint úsáide as an táscaire Treafa comhfhreagrach "
"(PLOUGH), a thugann le fios líon na mblianta ó treafadh picteilín go "
"deireanach.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Féarthailte. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don tacar "
"sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 10 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth’s surface\".\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn tacar sonraí an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Dlús Clúdaigh Crann (TCD) "
"faisnéis ar an gclúdach coróin comhréireach in aghaidh an phicteilín ag "
"taifeach spásúil 10 méadar agus is ó 0% (gach limistéar nach bhfuil "
"clúdaithe le crainn) go 100% é, agus sainmhínítear Dlús Clúdaigh Crann mar "
"“theilgean ingearach de choróin crann ar dhromchla cothrománach an "
"domhain”.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú le 2018 i rastair 10 "
"méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 "
"x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Clúdach Crann agus Foraoise. Tá ciseal muiníne ar "
"fáil don tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH) raster product "
"continues the 2015 and 2018 PLOUGH Layer following a rolling archive "
"principle by adding current information and removing historic years. It "
"indicates the number of years since the last indication of ploughing within "
"the permanent grassland area. PLOUGH is derived by taking into account the "
"series of binary HER layers, the BVL classifications and HR VPP PPI (Plant "
"Phenology Index) quantiles. BVL classes 4 (crop) and 7 (overlaying layer "
"between herbaceous and crop) indicate a ploughing event. Low HR VPP PPI "
"quantiles indicate low vegetation at a certain time of the year. For years "
"with missing information (2016 and earlier) the ploughing information from "
"the historic PLOUGH product is considered which causes some issues.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Leanann táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Táscaire Treafa (PLOUGH) ar "
"aghaidh le Ciseal PLOUGH 2015 agus 2018 de réir prionsabal cartlainne "
"rolláilte trí fhaisnéis reatha a chur leis agus blianta stairiúla a bhaint. "
"Léiríonn sé líon na mblianta ón táscaire treafa is déanaí laistigh den "
"limistéar féarthailte buan. Díorthaítear PLOUGH trí aird a thabhairt ar "
"shraith de chisil dhénártha HER, ar aicmiúcháin BVL agus ar chuaintílí HR "
"VPP PPI (Innéacs Feinealaíochta Plandaí). Léiríonn ranganna BVL 4 (barr) "
"agus 7 (ciseal forleagtha idir luibheach agus barr) teagmhas treafa. "
"Léiríonn cuaintílí ísle HR VPP PPI plandúlacht íseal ag am áirithe den "
"bhliain. Do bhlianta nach bhfuil faisnéis ann (2016 agus roimhe sin) tógtar "
"san áireamh an fhaisnéis treafa ón táirge stairiúil PLOUGH rud a "
"chruthaíonn roinnt fadhbanna.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Féarthailte.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 is a 10 m high resolution raster "
"layer containing height information generated for selected cities and urban "
"areas as part of the Urban atlas suite of products. Height information is "
"based on satellite information and derived datasets like the digital "
"surface model, the digital terrain model and the normalized digital surface "
"model (DSM). More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Is ciseal raster ard-taifigh 10 m é Airde Bloc Foirgnimh Urban Atlas 2021 "
"ina bhfuil faisnéis airde a gineadh do chathracha agus do limistéir "
"uirbeacha roghnaithe mar chuid de shraith táirgí Urban Atlas. Tá an "
"fhaisnéis airde bunaithe ar fhaisnéis satailíte agus ar thacair shonraí "
"díorthaithe cosúil leis an tsamhail dhigiteach dromchla, an tsamhail "
"dhigiteach tír-raoin agus an tsamhail dhigiteach dromchla normalaithe "
"(DSM). Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Type (CPSCT) "
"raster product indicates if a cover crop was present within the respective "
"calendar year and further segregates the types of cover crop into: short "
"summer, long summer, short winter and long winter cover crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - Cineál "
"Barr Tánaisteach (CPSCT) an raibh barr clúdaigh i láthair laistigh den "
"bhliain féilire faoi seach agus deighleann sé cineálacha an bharr clúdaigh "
"tuilleadh i: barr clúdaigh samhraidh ghearr, samhraidh fhada, gheimhridh "
"ghearr agus gheimhridh fhada.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don "
"tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Dates (GRAMD) raster product "
"provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m a basic "
"land cover classification, flagging and mapping the start date (DOY) "
"(GRAMD) within the detected Herbaceous cover layer (temporal and permanent "
"grassland)) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.25 ha. The GRAMD product "
"will flag and map the dates (Day of Year) of each mowing event on temporary "
"or permanent grassland per year, resulting in a product split in four "
"different rasters per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2017 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Dátaí Bainte Féarthailte "
"(GRAMD) ar leibhéal pan-Eorpach ag taifeach spásúil 10 m aicmiú bunúsach "
"clúdaigh talún, ag marcáil agus ag léarscáiliú an dáta tosaigh (DOY) "
"(GRAMD) laistigh den chiseal clúdaigh Luibhigh braite (féarthailte "
"sealadach agus buan)) le hAonad Íosta Léarscáilithe (MMU) de 0.25 ha. "
"Marcálfaidh agus léarscáilfidh an táirge GRAMD dátaí (Lá den Bhliain) gach "
"teagmhais bainte ar fhéarthailte sealadach nó buan in aghaidh na bliana, "
"agus mar thoradh air sin tá an táirge roinnte i gceithre rastar éagsúla in "
"aghaidh na bliana.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú le 2017 i rastair 10 "
"méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 "
"x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Féarthailte.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Types "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides the number of different crop types grown in "
"a 3-year period [0-3] (excluding cover crops).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - "
"Cineálacha Séasúr Curaíochta (CPCSY) líon na gcineálacha barr éagsúil a "
"fhástar i dtréimhse 3 bliana [0-3] (gan barra clúdaigh a áireamh).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Events (GRAME) raster product "
"provides a basic land cover classification containing respectively the "
"number of grassland mowing events within the detected Herbaceous cover "
"layer (temporal and permanent grassland) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) "
"of 0.25 ha. The GRAME product will flag and map the number of mowing events "
"(1, 2, 3, or 4+) on temporary or permanent grassland detected per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Teagmhais Bainte "
"Féarthailte (GRAME) aicmiú bunúsach clúdaigh talún ina bhfuil líon na "
"dteagmhas bainte féarthailte laistigh den chiseal clúdaigh Luibhigh braite "
"(féarthailte sealadach agus buan) faoi seach le hAonad Íosta Léarscáilithe "
"(MMU) de 0.25 ha. Marcálfaidh agus léarscáilfidh an táirge GRAME líon na "
"dteagmhas bainte (1, 2, 3, nó 4+) ar fhéarthailte sealadach nó buan a "
"braitheadh in aghaidh na bliana.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Féarthailte. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don tacar "
"sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Herbaceous cover (HER) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 2 thematic classes (temporal and "
"permanent herbaceous / non-herbaceous). The production of the herbaceous "
"layer is primarily based on the probability estimates obtained from the "
"Base Vegetation Layer (BVL) which also serves to harmonize the different "
"vegetated HRL products (Grasslands, Tree Cover and Forests, Croplands). HER "
"is further used as input for the Grassland status layer (GRA) extracting "
"the permanent herbaceous in combination with the Ploughing indicator "
"(PLOUGH).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Clúdach Luibhigh (HER) "
"aicmiú bunúsach clúdaigh talún le 2 aicme théamacha (luibheach sealadach "
"agus buan / neamh-luibheach). Tá táirgeadh an chiseil luibhigh bunaithe go "
"príomha ar na meastacháin dóchúlachta a fhaightear ón mBunchiseal "
"Plandúlachta (BVL) a fhónann freisin chun na táirgí HRL plandúlachta "
"éagsúla (Féarthailte, Clúdach Crann agus Foraoisí, Talamh Curaíochta) a "
"chomhchuibhiú. Úsáidtear HER tuilleadh mar ionchur don chiseal stádais "
"Féarthailte (GRA) ag baint an luibhigh bhuain as in éineacht leis an "
"táscaire Treafa (PLOUGH).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Féarthailte.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Yearly "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides number of growing seasons detected within 1 "
"year (0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - "
"Séasúir Churaíochta Bliantúla (CPCSY) líon na séasúr fáis a braitheadh "
"laistigh de 1 bhliain (0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé meastacháin Teochta Dromchla Talún ar scála domhanda, ag "
"taifeach spásúil de ~3 km. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/1"
"0daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé meastacháin Teochta Dromchla Talún ar scála domhanda, ag "
"taifeach spásúil de ~3 km. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn sé meastacháin Teochta Dromchla Talún ar scála domhanda, ag "
"taifeach spásúil de ~3 km. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Emergence "
"(CPSCE) raster product provides the date of emergence of the cover crop in "
"days of the year (DOY). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year (e.g. 19 "
"for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365)\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - "
"Teacht Chun Cinn Barr Tánaisteach (CPSCE) dáta teacht chun cinn an bharr "
"clúdaigh i laethanta den bhliain (DOY). YYDOY áit a bhfuil YY = an dá "
"dhigit dheireanacha den bhliain (m.sh. 19 do 2019) agus is é DOY an lá den "
"bhliain (1-365)\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don "
"tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) provides "
"information on trees under agricultural use or in urban context to be "
"excluded from the Forest Type (FTY) product and at 10m spatial resolution. "
"The derivation of Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) is based on the "
"spatial intersection of the 10m DLT and TCD layers with CORINE Land Cover "
"(CLC) 2018 and HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 with 10 m spatial resolution; "
"TCD range of 10-100%; with a MMW of 10m and no MMU (pixel base).\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Ciseal Tacaíochta Breise Foraoise "
"(FADSL) faisnéis ar chrainn faoi úsáid talmhaíochta nó i gcomhthéacs "
"uirbeach atá le heisiamh ón táirge Cineál Foraoise (FTY) agus ag taifeach "
"spásúil 10m. Tá díorthú an Chiseil Tacaíochta Breise Foraoise (FADSL) "
"bunaithe ar thrasnú spásúil na gciseal 10m DLT agus TCD le CORINE Land "
"Cover (CLC) 2018 agus HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 le taifeach spásúil 10 "
"m; raon TCD de 10-100%; le MMW de 10m agus gan MMU (bunaithe ar "
"phicteilín).\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo ar mhinicíocht 3 bliana i rastair 10 "
"méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 "
"x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Clúdach Crann agus Foraoise.\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Duration "
"(CPSCD) raster product provides the duration (in days) of the cover crop "
"season (can exceed the calendar year).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - Fad "
"Barr Tánaisteach (CPSCD) fad (i laethanta) shéasúr an bharr clúdaigh (is "
"féidir leis dul thar an mbliain féilire).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don "
"tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The Cloud Classification (CC) product provides information on the extent of "
"clouds and cloud shadows derived from optical satellite data acquired by "
"the **Sentinel-2** constellation. Cloud detection is performed at a "
"**120m** spatial resolution using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a pixel spacing of 20 m "
"x 20 m. It used to produce the CLMS High-Resolution Water, Snow and Ice "
"datasets (HR-WSI), which rely on Sentinel-2 imagery.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. No product is generated for a "
"Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds 90%.<br><br>More information in "
"the products documentation "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an táirge Aicmiú Scamall (CC) faisnéis ar fhairsinge scamall "
"agus scáthanna scamall a díorthaíodh ó shonraí optúla satailíte a gabhadh "
"ag réaltbhuíon **Sentinel-2**. Déantar brath scamall ag taifeach spásúil "
"**120m** ag baint úsáide as an [bogearra "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Gintear é "
"beagnach i bhfíor-am ar scála Eorpach, le spásáil picteilíní 20 m x 20 m. "
"Úsáideadh é chun tacair shonraí Uisce, Sneachta agus Oighir Ard-Taifigh "
"CLMS (HR-WSI) a tháirgeadh, a bhraitheann ar íomhánna "
"Sentinel-2.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí seo. Ní "
"ghintear aon táirge do tíle Sentinel-2 nuair a sháraíonn an clúdach scamall "
"90%.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais i ndoiciméadacht na dtáirgí "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The **Fractional Snow Cover (FSC)** product provides the fraction of the "
"surface covered by snow at the top of canopy (FSC-TOC) and on ground "
"(FSC-OG) per pixel as a percentage (0% – 100%). Cloud detection in the "
"Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale based on optical satellite "
"data from the **Sentinel-2** constellation, with a spatial resolution of "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No "
"product is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an táirge **Clúdach Sneachta Codánach (FSC)** an codán den "
"dromchla atá clúdaithe ag sneachta ag barr an chanbhaisín (FSC-TOC) agus ar "
"an talamh (FSC-OG) in aghaidh an phicteilín mar chéatadán (0% – 100%). "
"Déantar brath scamall in íomhánna Sentinel-2 ag baint úsáide as an "
"[bogearra "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Gintear é "
"beagnach i bhfíor-am ar scála Eorpach bunaithe ar shonraí optúla satailíte "
"ó réaltbhuíon **Sentinel-2**, le taifeach spásúil **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí seo. Ní ghintear aon "
"táirge do tíle Sentinel-2 nuair a sháraíonn an clúdach scamall "
"90%.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The **SAR Wet Snow (SWS)** product provides the wet snow extent for high "
"mountain areas, based on C-band Synthetic Aperture Radar satellite data "
"from the **Sentinel-1** constellation.<br><br>It is generated in near "
"real-time for selected high mountain areas at European scale with a spatial "
"resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to "
"the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-sar-wet-"
"snow)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an táirge **Sneachta Fliuch SAR (SWS)** fairsinge an tsneachta "
"fhliuch do limistéir ard-sléibhte, bunaithe ar shonraí satailíte Radair "
"Cuasa Sintéiseach banda C ó réaltbhuíon **Sentinel-1**.<br><br>Gintear é "
"beagnach i bhfíor-am do limistéir ard-sléibhte roghnaithe ar scála Eorpach "
"le taifeach spásúil **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó "
"2016 go dtí seo.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-sar-wet-"
"snow)."

msgid ""
"The **Wet / Dry Snow (WDS)** product provides information on the snow state "
"(wet or dry) by combining **Sentinel-1** radar-based wet snow maps within "
"the snow cover extent derived from **Sentinel-2** optical data. Cloud "
"detection in the Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a spatial resolution of "
"**60 m x 60 m** in areas where Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 observation tracks "
"overlap.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No product "
"is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-wet-dry-"
"snow)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an táirge **Sneachta Fliuch / Tirim (WDS)** faisnéis ar staid "
"an tsneachta (fliuch nó tirim) trí léarscáileanna sneachta fliuch "
"Sentinel-1 atá bunaithe ar radar a chomhcheangal laistigh de fhairsinge an "
"chlúdaigh sneachta a díorthaíodh ó shonraí optúla **Sentinel-2**. Déantar "
"brath scamall in íomhánna Sentinel-2 ag baint úsáide as an [bogearra "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Gintear é "
"beagnach i bhfíor-am ar scála Eorpach, le taifeach spásúil **60 m x 60 m** "
"i limistéir ina bhfuil rianta breathnóireachta Sentinel-1 agus Sentinel-2 "
"ag forluí.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí seo. Ní ghintear "
"aon táirge do tíle Sentinel-2 nuair a sháraíonn an clúdach scamall "
"90%.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-wet-dry-"
"snow)."

msgid ""
"The daily cumulative **Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover (GFSC)** product "
"provides pixel-wise snow cover extent as a percentage (0% – 100%). It is "
"based on synthetic aperture radar (SAR) data from the **Sentinel-1** "
"constellation and optical imagery from the **Sentinel-2** constellation. "
"The product is generated by merging all available Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 "
"observations acquired over the previous **seven days** to produce a "
"spatially complete composite of snow conditions, thereby reducing data gaps "
"caused by cloud cover and sensor coverage limitations. Snow information "
"derived from Sentinel-1 is focused on the detection of wet snow in "
"high-mountain areas.<br><br>It is generated on a daily basis at European "
"scale, with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-gap-"
"filled-fractional-snow-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an táirge laethúil carnach **Clúdach Sneachta Codánach Líonta "
"Bearnaí (GFSC)** fairsinge clúdaigh sneachta in aghaidh an phicteilín mar "
"chéatadán (0% – 100%). Tá sé bunaithe ar shonraí radair cuasa sintéisigh "
"(SAR) ó réaltbhuíon **Sentinel-1** agus ar íomhánna optúla ó réaltbhuíon "
"**Sentinel-2**. Gintear an táirge trí gach breathnóireacht Sentinel-1 agus "
"Sentinel-2 atá ar fáil a gabhadh thar na **seacht lá** roimhe sin a chumasc "
"chun comhshuíomh iomlán go spásúil de choinníollacha sneachta a tháirgeadh, "
"agus bearnaí sonraí de bharr clúdach scamall agus teorainneacha clúdaigh "
"braiteoirí á laghdú dá bharr. Díríonn an fhaisnéis sneachta a díorthaíodh ó "
"Sentinel-1 ar bhrath sneachta fhliuch i limistéir "
"ard-sléibhte.<br><br>Gintear é go laethúil ar scála Eorpach, le taifeach "
"spásúil **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí "
"seo.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-gap-"
"filled-fractional-snow-cover)."

msgid ""
"The Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S2)** product characterizes the timing "
"and duration of the snow season. For each pixel and for a given "
"hydrological year, it provides the number of days with snow cover, as well "
"as the first and last day of the longest continuous snow period. The "
"hydrological year starts on 1 September.<br><br>The product is generated at "
"the European scale with a spatial resolution of **20 m x 20 m**, consistent "
"with the input snow cover maps derived from optical satellite data acquired "
"by the Sentinel-2 constellation (Fractional Snow Cover - "
"FSC).<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can "
"be downloaded in multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an táirge Sentinel-2 **Feinealaíocht Sneachta (SP S2)** am agus fad "
"shéasúr an tsneachta a shainiú. Do gach picteilín agus do bhliain "
"hidreolaíoch ar leith, soláthraíonn sé líon na laethanta le clúdach "
"sneachta, chomh maith leis an gcéad lá agus an lá deireanach den tréimhse "
"sneachta leanúnaigh is faide. Tosaíonn an bhliain hidreolaíoch ar 1 Meán "
"Fómhair.<br><br>Gintear an táirge ar scála Eorpach le taifeach spásúil **20 "
"m x 20 m**, i gcomhréir leis na léarscáileanna clúdaigh sneachta ionchuir a "
"díorthaíodh ó shonraí optúla satailíte a gabhadh ag réaltbhuíon Sentinel-2 "
"(Clúdach Sneachta Codánach - FSC).<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 "
"go dtí seo. Is féidir na sonraí a íoslódáil i dteilgin agus i spásáil "
"picteilíní iolracha.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."

msgid ""
"The Sentinel-1 & Sentinel-2 **Snow Phenology (SP S1+S2)** product "
"characterizes the timing and duration of the snow season. For each pixel "
"and for a given hydrological year, it provides the number of days with snow "
"cover, as well as the first and last day of the longest continuous snow "
"period. The hydrological year starts on 1 September.<br><br>The product is "
"generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 "
"m**, consistent with the input snow cover maps derived from optical "
"satellite data acquired by the Sentinel-2 constellation and from C-band "
"Synthetic Aperture Radar satellite data acquired by the Sentinel-1 "
"constellation (Gap-filled Fractional Snow Cover - GFSC).<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an táirge Sentinel-1 & Sentinel-2 **Feinealaíocht Sneachta (SP "
"S1+S2)** am agus fad shéasúr an tsneachta a shainiú. Do gach picteilín agus "
"do bhliain hidreolaíoch ar leith, soláthraíonn sé líon na laethanta le "
"clúdach sneachta, chomh maith leis an gcéad lá agus an lá deireanach den "
"tréimhse sneachta leanúnaigh is faide. Tosaíonn an bhliain hidreolaíoch ar "
"1 Meán Fómhair.<br><br>Gintear an táirge ar scála Eorpach le taifeach "
"spásúil **60 m x 60 m**, i gcomhréir leis na léarscáileanna clúdaigh "
"sneachta ionchuir a díorthaíodh ó shonraí optúla satailíte a gabhadh ag "
"réaltbhuíon Sentinel-2 agus ó shonraí satailíte Radair Cuasa Sintéisigh "
"banda C a gabhadh ag réaltbhuíon Sentinel-1 (Clúdach Sneachta Codánach "
"Líonta Bearnaí - GFSC).<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí "
"seo. Is féidir na sonraí a íoslódáil i dteilgin agus i spásáil picteilíní "
"iolracha.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/high-resolution-snow-"
"phenology)."

msgid ""
"The **Water Cover Duration (WCD)** product estimates the number of days "
"land is covered by water. For each pixel and for a given hydrological year, "
"it indicates how frequently water is present. The hydrological year starts "
"on 1 September. It is based on water masks derived from **Sentinel-1** "
"radar and **Sentinel-2** optical data, combined with Water/Ice Cover data "
"from Sentinel-2 (WIC S2).<br><br>The product is generated at the European "
"scale with a spatial resolution of **10 m x 10 m**.<br><br>**Data "
"availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-cover-duration)."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an táirge **Fad Clúdaigh Uisce (WCD)** líon na laethanta a bhíonn "
"talamh clúdaithe ag uisce a mheas. Do gach picteilín agus do bhliain "
"hidreolaíoch ar leith, léiríonn sé cé chomh minic is atá uisce i láthair. "
"Tosaíonn an bhliain hidreolaíoch ar 1 Meán Fómhair. Tá sé bunaithe ar "
"mhascanna uisce a díorthaíodh ó radar **Sentinel-1** agus ó shonraí optúla "
"**Sentinel-2**, in éineacht le sonraí Clúdach Uisce/Oighir ó Sentinel-2 "
"(WIC S2).<br><br>Gintear an táirge ar scála Eorpach le taifeach spásúil "
"**10 m x 10 m**.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí seo. Is "
"féidir na sonraí a íoslódáil i dteilgin agus i spásáil picteilíní "
"iolracha.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-cover-duration)."

msgid ""
"The **Ice Cover Duration (ICD)** product describes how long inland waters "
"are covered by ice. For each pixel and for a given hydrological year, it "
"provides the number of days with ice cover. The hydrological year starts on "
"1 September. It is based on ice cover maps derived from **Sentinel-2** "
"optical data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S2) and **Sentinel-1** C-band Synthetic "
"Aperture Radar data (Water/Ice Cover WIC S1).<br><br>The product is "
"generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. The data can "
"be downloaded in multiple projections and pixel spacings.<br><br>More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"ice-cover-duration)."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an táirge **Fad Clúdaigh Oighir (ICD)** cur síos ar fhad an ama a "
"bhíonn uiscí intíre clúdaithe ag oighear. Do gach picteilín agus do bhliain "
"hidreolaíoch ar leith, soláthraíonn sé líon na laethanta le clúdach oighir. "
"Tosaíonn an bhliain hidreolaíoch ar 1 Meán Fómhair. Tá sé bunaithe ar "
"léarscáileanna clúdaigh oighir a díorthaíodh ó shonraí optúla "
"**Sentinel-2** (Clúdach Uisce/Oighir WIC S2) agus ó shonraí Radair Cuasa "
"Sintéisigh banda C **Sentinel-1** (Clúdach Uisce/Oighir WIC "
"S1).<br><br>Gintear an táirge ar scála Eorpach le taifeach spásúil **20 m x "
"20 m**.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí seo. Is féidir na "
"sonraí a íoslódáil i dteilgin agus i spásáil picteilíní "
"iolracha.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"ice-cover-duration)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 (WICS1)** product provides "
"information about river and lake areas covered by snow-covered or snow-free "
"ice. It is based on synthetic aperture radar data from the **Sentinel-1** "
"constellation.<br><br>It is generated in near real-time at European scale, "
"with a spatial resolution of **60 m x 60 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: "
"from 2016 to the present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an táirge **Clúdach Uisce agus Oighir ó Sentinel-1 (WICS1)** "
"faisnéis faoi limistéir aibhneacha agus lochanna atá clúdaithe ag oighear "
"atá clúdaithe le sneachta nó saor ó sneachta. Tá sé bunaithe ar shonraí "
"radair cuasa sintéisigh ó réaltbhuíon **Sentinel-1**.<br><br>Gintear é "
"beagnach i bhfíor-am ar scála Eorpach, le taifeach spásúil **60 m x 60 "
"m**.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí seo.<br><br>Tuilleadh "
"eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-2 (WICS2)** product provides the "
"water and ice extent over land. A water mask is used to differentiate "
"between snow on ice-covered water areas and snow on land. Cloud detection "
"in the Sentinel-2 imagery is performed using the [MAJA "
"software](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>It is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale based on optical satellite "
"data from the Sentinel-2 constellation, with a spatial resolution of **20 m "
"x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the present. No "
"product is generated for a Sentinel-2 tile when cloud cover exceeds "
"90%.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an táirge **Clúdach Uisce agus Oighir ó Sentinel-2 (WICS2)** "
"fairsinge uisce agus oighir thar talamh. Úsáidtear masc uisce chun "
"idirdhealú a dhéanamh idir sneachta ar limistéir uisce atá clúdaithe le "
"hoighear agus sneachta ar thalamh. Déantar brath scamall in íomhánna "
"Sentinel-2 ag baint úsáide as an [bogearra "
"MAJA](https://gitlab.orfeo-toolbox.org/maja/maja/).<br><br>Gintear é "
"beagnach i bhfíor-am ar scála Eorpach bunaithe ar shonraí optúla satailíte "
"ó réaltbhuíon Sentinel-2, le taifeach spásúil **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí seo. Ní ghintear aon "
"táirge do tíle Sentinel-2 nuair a sháraíonn an clúdach scamall "
"90%.<br><br>Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The **Water and Ice Cover by Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 (WIC S1+S2)** "
"product shows which river and lake areas are covered by ice, with or "
"without snow. It combines data from two types of instruments acquired on "
"the same day to increase coverage and reduce missing information. It uses "
"water/ice cover information derived from **Sentinel-2** optical images (WIC "
"S2), and from **Sentinel-1** radar data (WIC S1).<br><br>The product is "
"generated in near real-time at European scale, with a spatial resolution of "
"**20 m x 20 m**.<br><br>**Data availability**: from 2016 to the "
"present.<br><br>More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánann an táirge **Clúdach Uisce agus Oighir ó Sentinel-1 agus "
"Sentinel-2 (WIC S1+S2)** cé na limistéir aibhneacha agus lochanna atá "
"clúdaithe ag oighear, le sneachta nó gan sneachta. Comhcheanglaíonn sé "
"sonraí ó dhá chineál ionstraime a gabhadh an lá céanna chun clúdach a "
"mhéadú agus faisnéis ar iarraidh a laghdú. Úsáideann sé faisnéis chlúdaigh "
"uisce/oighir a díorthaíodh ó íomhánna optúla **Sentinel-2** (WIC S2), agus "
"ó shonraí radair **Sentinel-1** (WIC S1).<br><br>Gintear an táirge beagnach "
"i bhfíor-am ar scála Eorpach, le taifeach spásúil **20 m x 20 "
"m**.<br><br>**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: ó 2016 go dtí seo.<br><br>Tuilleadh "
"eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/water-and-ice-"
"cover-raster-20-m-60-m-europe-daily)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Broadleaved Density (BCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of broadleaved pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of broadleaved "
"pixels are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the "
"BCD. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn tacar sonraí an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Dlús Leathanduilleach "
"(BCD) faisnéis ar chéatadán na bpicteilíní leathanduilleacha ag taifeach "
"spásúil 100m, agus díorthaítear é trí chomhiomlánú an DLT 10m don bhliain "
"thagartha faoi seach. Laistigh de gach cill déantar líon na bpicteilíní "
"leathanduilleacha a chomhaireamh agus stóráiltear na céatadáin i bpicteilín "
"100m an BCD. Tá an aicme 255 = limistéar lasmuigh réamhshainithe ag an "
"gciseal teorann 100m agus fanann sé gan athrú.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú le 2018 i rastair "
"100 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Clúdach Crann agus Foraoise.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Coniferous Cover Density (CCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of coniferous pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of coniferous pixels "
"are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the CCD. "
"The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer and "
"remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn tacar sonraí an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Dlús Clúdaigh Buaircíneach "
"(CCD) faisnéis ar chéatadán na bpicteilíní buaircíneacha ag taifeach "
"spásúil 100m, agus díorthaítear é trí chomhiomlánú an DLT 10m don bhliain "
"thagartha faoi seach. Laistigh de gach cill déantar líon na bpicteilíní "
"buaircíneacha a chomhaireamh agus stóráiltear na céatadáin i bpicteilín "
"100m an CCD. Tá an aicme 255 = limistéar lasmuigh réamhshainithe ag an "
"gciseal teorann 100m agus fanann sé gan athrú.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú le 2018 i rastair "
"100 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Clúdach Crann agus Foraoise.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) dataset provides the Forest "
"Type estimation at 100 meter spatial resolution. The number of broadleaved "
"and coniferous pixels are counted and the percentages stored in the 100m "
"cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn tacar sonraí an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Cineál Foraoise (FTY) "
"meastachán Cineáil Foraoise ag taifeach spásúil 100 méadar. Comhairítear "
"líon na bpicteilíní leathanduilleacha agus buaircíneacha agus stóráiltear "
"na céatadáin sa chill 100m. Tá an aicme 255 = limistéar lasmuigh "
"réamhshainithe ag an gciseal teorann 100m agus fanann sé gan athrú.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo ar mhinicíocht 3 bliana i rastair 100 "
"méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna 100 "
"x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Clúdach Crann agus Foraoise.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed. In the 100 meter raster product, the "
"number of Grassland pixels are counted and the percentages stored in each "
"100 meter cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m "
"boundary layer and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Féarthailte (GRA) ciseal "
"stádais dénártha de masc féarthailte/neamh-fhéarthailte. Áirítear sa táirge "
"bonnlíne plandúlachta féarach agus neamhchrannach seo gach cineál "
"féarthailte: féarthailte bainistithe, féarthailte leath-nádúrtha agus "
"plandúlacht fhéarach nádúrtha. Ní áirítear féarthailte sealadacha, a "
"mhaisctear amach ag baint úsáide as an táscaire Treafa comhfhreagrach "
"(PLOUGH), a thugann le fios líon na mblianta ó treafadh picteilín go "
"deireanach. Sa táirge raster 100 méadar, comhairítear líon na bpicteilíní "
"Féarthailte agus stóráiltear na céatadáin i ngach cill 100 méadar. Tá an "
"aicme 255 = limistéar lasmuigh réamhshainithe ag an gciseal teorann 100m "
"agus fanann sé gan athrú.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"100 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Féarthailte.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 100 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth's surface\". This product is an aggregation of "
"its corresponding high resolution dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn tacar sonraí an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Dlús Clúdaigh Crann (TCD) "
"faisnéis ar an gclúdach coróin comhréireach in aghaidh an phicteilín ag "
"taifeach spásúil 100 méadar agus is ó 0% (gach limistéar nach bhfuil "
"clúdaithe le crainn) go 100% é, agus sainmhínítear Dlús Clúdaigh Crann mar "
"“theilgean ingearach de choróin crann ar dhromchla cothrománach an "
"domhain”. Is comhiomlánú de thacar sonraí ard-taifigh comhfhreagrach é an "
"táirge seo.\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú le 2018 i rastair "
"100 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Clúdach Crann agus Foraoise. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Emergence (CPMCE) "
"raster product provides the emergence date of the main (annual) crop "
"expressed in DOY (day of year). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year "
"(e.g. 19 for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - "
"Teacht Chun Cinn an Phríomhbharr (CPMCE) dáta teacht chun cinn an "
"phríomhbharr (bliantúil) arna léiriú i DOY (lá den bhliain). YYDOY áit a "
"bhfuil YY = an dá dhigit dheireanacha den bhliain (m.sh. 19 do 2019) agus "
"is é DOY an lá den bhliain (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don "
"tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Harvest (CPMCH) "
"raster product provides the harvest date of the main (annual) crop "
"expressed in days of the year (DOY). The harvest is considered as the time "
"of removal of most of the biomass. YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the "
"year (e.g. 19 for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn táirge raster an Chiseil Ard-Taifigh Patrúin Churaíochta - "
"Fómhar an Phríomhbharr (CPMCH) dáta fómhair an phríomhbharr (bliantúil) "
"arna léiriú i laethanta den bhliain (DOY). Meastar gurb é an fómhar an t-am "
"a bhaintear an chuid is mó den bhithmhais. YYDOY áit a bhfuil YY = an dá "
"dhigit dheireanacha den bhliain (m.sh. 19 do 2019) agus is é DOY an lá den "
"bhliain (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"Soláthraítear an tacar sonraí seo go bliantúil ag tosú in 2017 le rastair "
"10 méadar (comhoiriúnach go hiomlán le heangach tagartha EEA) i dtíleanna "
"100 x 100 km a chlúdaíonn tíortha EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Is cuid de Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún Copernicus an Aontais Eorpaigh é "
"táirge Ciseal Ard-Taifigh Talamh Curaíochta. Tá ciseal muiníne ar fáil don "
"tacar sonraí.\n"
"\n"
"Áirítear sna sonraí seo sonraí ó Chríocha Thar Lear na Fraince (DOManna). "
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"This metadata refers to the CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, Land-Use "
"Change and Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), an annually "
"updated, pan-European, spatially consistent and seamless geospatial proxy "
"for land use reporting under the LULUCF regulation. The product is "
"delivered as a single raster layer with a spatial resolution of 100 m, "
"derived from multiple pan-European Copernicus Land Monitoring Service "
"(CLMS) high resolution input datasets. The LULUCF Instance is available for "
"the reference years 2018, 2021, 2022 and 2023, with production moving to an "
"annual update cycle starting from the 2021 product. Each raster cell "
"represents a dominant LULUCF land-use class, assigned according to thematic "
"and spatial rulesets implemented during the extraction process. While each "
"pixel corresponds primarily to one of the six main LULUCF land use "
"categories - forest land, grassland, cropland, settlements, wetlands, and "
"other lands - the dataset further differentiates these categories into sub "
"classes, resulting in a total of 27 classes. This classification structure "
"supports greenhouse gas reporting and other applications within the LULUCF "
"sector by providing a harmonised and policy relevant representation of land "
"use across Europe. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."
msgstr ""
"Tagraíonn na meiteashonraí seo don CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, "
"Land-Use Change and Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), ionadaí "
"geospásúil pan-Eorpach, comhsheasmhach go spásúil agus gan uaim, a "
"nuashonraítear go bliantúil le haghaidh tuairiscithe úsáide talún faoin "
"rialachán LULUCF. Seachadtar an táirge mar chiseal raster amháin le "
"taifeach spásúil 100 m, a díorthaíodh ó thacair shonraí ionchuir "
"ard-taifigh iolracha pan-Eorpacha de chuid Sheirbhís Faireacháin Talún "
"Copernicus (CLMS). Tá an LULUCF Instance ar fáil do na blianta tagartha "
"2018, 2021, 2022 agus 2023, agus táirgeadh ag aistriú go timthriall "
"nuashonraithe bliantúil ag tosú ón táirge 2021. Léiríonn gach cill raster "
"aicme cheannasach úsáide talún LULUCF, a shanntar de réir rialacha téamacha "
"agus spásúla a cuireadh i bhfeidhm le linn an phróisis eastósctha. Cé go "
"bhfreagraíonn gach picteilín go príomha do cheann amháin de na sé "
"phríomhchatagóir úsáide talún LULUCF - talamh foraoise, féarthailte, talamh "
"curaíochta, lonnaíochtaí, báchoill, agus talamh eile - déanann an tacar "
"sonraí na catagóirí seo a idirdhealú tuilleadh ina bhfo-ranganna, agus 27 "
"aicme san iomlán mar thoradh air. Tacaíonn an struchtúr aicmithe seo le "
"tuairisciú gáis cheaptha teasa agus le feidhmeanna eile laistigh den "
"earnáil LULUCF trí léiriú comhchuibhithe agus ábhartha don bheartas ar "
"úsáid talún ar fud na hEorpa a sholáthar. Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."

msgid ""
"The **High Resolution Water Layer (HRWL)** product provides classified maps "
"showing permanent water, temporary water, dry areas, and sea water. It is a "
"multi-annual product, typically covering a **7-year period**, and is "
"updated every 3 years. It is based on the annual Water Cover Duration (WCD) "
"production, which combines water masks from **Sentinel-1** radar and "
"**Sentinel-2** optical imagery with Water/Ice Cover data from Sentinel-2 "
"(WIC S2).\n"
"\n"
"The product is generated at the European scale with a spatial resolution of "
"**10 m × 10 m**.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability**: HRWL is available for the reference years 2021 and "
"2024, covering the periods **01/09/2016**–31/12/2021 and "
"**01/09/2018**–31/12/2024, respectively. The dataset can be downloaded in "
"multiple projections and pixel spacings.\n"
"\n"
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-layer)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn an táirge **Ciseal Uisce Ard-Taifigh (HRWL)** léarscáileanna "
"aicmithe a thaispeánann uisce buan, uisce sealadach, limistéir thriomacha, "
"agus uisce farraige. Is táirge ilbhliantúil é, a chlúdaíonn de ghnáth "
"**tréimhse 7 mbliana**, agus déantar é a nuashonrú gach 3 bliana. Tá sé "
"bunaithe ar tháirgeadh bliantúil an Fhad Clúdaigh Uisce (WCD), a "
"chomhcheanglaíonn mascanna uisce ó radar **Sentinel-1** agus ó íomhánna "
"optúla **Sentinel-2** le sonraí Clúdach Uisce/Oighir ó Sentinel-2 (WIC S2).\n"
"\n"
"Gintear an táirge ar scála Eorpach le taifeach spásúil **10 m × 10 m**.\n"
"\n"
"**Infhaighteacht sonraí**: Tá HRWL ar fáil do na blianta tagartha 2021 agus "
"2024, a chlúdaíonn na tréimhsí **01/09/2016**–31/12/2021 agus "
"**01/09/2018**–31/12/2024, faoi seach. Is féidir an tacar sonraí a "
"íoslódáil i dteilgin agus i spásáil picteilíní iolracha.\n"
"\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/water-bodies/high-resolution-"
"water-layer)."

msgid ""
"This dataset comprises one cloud-free Very High Resolution optical coverage "
"of 39 European States (EEA-39) including all islands of those countries "
"plus \n"
"the French Overseas Departments of French Guiana, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte and Réunion but excluding French Overseas Territories for a total "
"coverage \n"
"of ~ 6 million square kilometres. The area of interest is extended by a 4 "
"km buffer over the sea and a 500 m buffer over countries bordering the "
"EEA-39 states. \n"
"More "
"[info](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2018)."
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn an tacar sonraí seo clúdach optúil An-Ard-Taifigh amháin saor ó "
"scamaill de 39 Stát Eorpach (EEA-39) lena n-áirítear oileáin na dtíortha "
"sin ar fad móide \n"
"Rannóga Thar Lear na Fraince: Guáin na Fraince, Martinique, Guadalúip, "
"Mayotte agus Réunion ach gan Críocha Thar Lear na Fraince a áireamh, le "
"clúdach iomlán \n"
"de ~ 6 mhilliún ciliméadar cearnach. Leathnaítear an limistéar spéise le "
"maolán 4 km thar an bhfarraige agus maolán 500 m thar thíortha atá ar "
"theorainn le stáit EEA-39. \n"
"Tuilleadh "
"[eolais](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/VHR-IMAGE-2018)."

msgid ""
"This dataset comprises one cloud-free Very High Resolution optical coverage "
