"vhrimage2024)."
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn an tacar sonraí seo clúdach optúil An-Ard-Taifigh amháin saor ó "
"scamaill de 39 Stát Eorpach (EEA-39) lena n-áirítear oileáin na dtíortha "
"sin ar fad móide\n"
"Rannóga Thar Lear na Fraince: Guáin na Fraince, Martinique, Guadalúip, "
"Mayotte agus Réunion ach gan Críocha Thar Lear na Fraince a áireamh. "
"Leathnaítear an limistéar\n"
"spéise (~6 mhilliún ciliméadar cearnach) le maolán 4 km thar an bhfarraige "
"agus maolán 500 m thar thíortha atá ar theorainn le stáit EEA-39.\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/optical-vhr-coverage-over-europe-"
"vhrimage2024)."

msgid ""
"The collection holds Level-2 Land Surface Temperature (LST) products from "
"OroraTech’s\n"
"FOREST satellites, at 200 m ground sampling distance, over selected "
"European pilot sites.\n"
"Each product is a Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF giving the land surface "
"temperature, in Kelvin.\n"
"Daytime and night-time acquisitions from complementary orbits make the "
"collection suited to\n"
"studying the daily temperature cycle, urban heat islands, drought and "
"surface water stress."
msgstr ""
"Tá táirgí Teochta Dromchla Talún (LST) Leibhéal-2 ó shatailítí FOREST de "
"chuid OroraTech sa bhailiúchán,\n"
"ag achar samplála talún 200 m, thar shuíomhanna píolótacha roghnaithe san "
"Eoraip.\n"
"Is Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF é gach táirge a thugann teocht dhromchla na "
"talún, i Kelvin.\n"
"Toisc go bhfuil gabhálacha lae agus oíche ó orbit comhlántacha ann, tá an "
"bailiúchán oiriúnach chun\n"
"timthriall laethúil teochta, oileáin teasa uirbeacha, triomach agus strus "
"uisce dromchla a staidéar."

msgid ""
"This mosaic dataset, directly processed and delivered by the data provider, "
"comprises one cloud-free Very High Resolution optical coverage of 39 "
"European States (EEA-39) including all islands of those countries plus\n"
"the French Overseas Departments of French Guiana, Martinique, Guadeloupe, "
"Mayotte and Réunion but excluding French Overseas Territories. The area of\n"
"interest (~6 million square kilometres) is extended by a 4 km buffer over "
"the sea and a 500 m buffer over countries bordering the EEA-39 states.\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/optical-vhr-coverage-over-europe-"
"vhrimage2024)."
msgstr ""
"Cuimsíonn an tacar sonraí mósáice seo, a phróiseáil agus a sheachad an "
"soláthraí sonraí go díreach, clúdach optúil An-Ard-Taifigh amháin saor ó "
"scamaill de 39 Stát Eorpach (EEA-39), lena n-áirítear oileáin na dtíortha "
"sin ar fad móide\n"
"Rannóga Thar Lear na Fraince: Guáin na Fraince, Martinique, Guadalúip, "
"Mayotte agus Réunion ach gan Críocha Thar Lear na Fraince a áireamh. "
"Leathnaítear an limistéar\n"
"spéise (~6 mhilliún ciliméadar cearnach) le maolán 4 km thar an bhfarraige "
"agus maolán 500 m thar thíortha atá ar theorainn le stáit EEA-39.\n"
"Tuilleadh eolais "
"[anseo](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/optical-vhr-coverage-over-europe-"
"vhrimage2024)."

msgid ""
"The Copernicus Contributing Missions (CCM) provide data that complements "
"the Copernicus Sentinel Missions and play a crucial role in Earth "
"observation.\n"
"These missions are conducted by ESA, its Member States, and international "
"third-party operators, and they offer very high to high resolution optical, "
"radar\n"
"and elevation model data. More "
"[info](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions)."
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn na Misin Rannpháirteacha Copernicus (CCM) sonraí a "
"chomhlánaíonn Misin Sentinel Copernicus agus tá ról ríthábhachtach acu i "
"bhfaire an Domhain.\n"
"Is iad ESA, a Baill-Stáit, agus oibreoirí tríú páirtí idirnáisiúnta a "
"stiúrann na misin seo, agus tairgeann siad sonraí optúla, radair\n"
"agus samhla airde ar ard-taifeach go han-ard-taifeach. Tuilleadh "
"[eolais](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/"
"copernicus-contributing-missions)."

